(4, 'you-have-grown-up', 'You have grown up', '你长大了', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/1062.mp3', 'N/A', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/you-have-grown-up/', '孩子经常找爸爸妈妈要钱买东西这一天孩子又找爸爸要钱孩子说爸爸给我五毛钱吧我想买吃的东西爸爸说你岁了已经长大了昨天你要了五毛钱今天你又要五毛钱明天还要五毛钱这样不好吧大孩子会这样做吗孩子想了想说爸爸你说得对这样不好我是大孩子了那你今天给我五块钱吧', 'hái zi jīng cháng zhǎo bàba māma yào qián mǎi dōngxi zhè yī tiān hái zi yòu zhǎo bàba yào qián hái zi shuō bàba gěi wǒ wǔ máo qián ba wǒ xiǎng mǎi chī de dōngxi bàba shuō nǐ suì le yǐ jīng zhǎng dà le zuó tiān nǐ yào le wǔ máo qián jīn tiān nǐ yòu yào wǔ máo qián míng tiān hái yào wǔ máo qián zhè yàng bù hǎo ba dà hái zi huì zhè yàng zuò ma hái zi xiǎng le xiǎng shuō bàba nǐ shuō de duì zhè yàng bù hǎo wǒ shì dà hái zi le nà nǐ jīn tiān gěi wǒ wǔ kuài qián ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nchild (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">孩子</span><span class=\"tr\">孩子</span><rt>hái zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nask; request (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">找</span><span class=\"tr\">找</span><rt>zhǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to, ask for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></rub