(5, 'what-are-you-studying', 'What are you studying?', '你在学什么？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/1061.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1061-pzvitfsnr5jmsdkf5ewj44ji2ckhdkybc2soqzad76.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-are-you-studying/', '你在学什么我在学汉语你有汉语老师吗我有两个汉语老师他们也是我的好朋友你在家学习吗不我在汉语学校学习我有三十个同学你学汉语多长时间了我学汉语三年了现在是四级真棒但是我的汉字不好很多汉字我会读不会写没关系多练习就好了我的老师也这么说', 'nǐ zài xué shén me wǒ zài xué hàn yǔ nǐ yǒu hàn yǔ lǎo shī ma wǒ yǒu liǎng gè hàn yǔ lǎo shī tā men yě shì wǒ de hǎo péng yǒu nǐ zài jiā xué xí ma bù wǒ zài hàn yǔ xué xiào xué xí wǒ yǒu sān shí gè tóng xué nǐ xué hàn yǔ duō cháng shí jiān le wǒ xué hàn yǔ sān nián le xiàn zài shì sì jí zhēn bàng dàn shì wǒ de hàn zì bù hǎo hěn duō hàn zì wǒ huì dú bù huì xiě méi guān xì duō liàn xí jiù hǎo le wǒ de lǎo shī yě zhè me shuō', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFamily (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nschool (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthirty\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三十</span><span class=\"tr\">三十</span><rt>sān shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóng xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclassmate (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">同学</span><span class=\"tr\">同學</span><rt>tóng xué</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow long\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多长</span><span class=\"tr\">多長</span><rt>duō cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时间</span><span class=\"tr\">時間</span><rt>shí jiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr>HSK<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFour (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">四</span><span class=\"tr\">四</span><rt>sì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlevel\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">级</span><span class=\"tr\">級</span><rt>jí</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真</span><span class=\"tr\">真</span><rt>zhēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGreat (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">棒</span><span class=\"tr\">棒</span><rt>bàng</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese character\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉字</span><span class=\"tr\">漢字</span><rt>hàn zì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese character\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉字</span><span class=\"tr\">漢字</span><rt>hàn zì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nread (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">读</span><span class=\"tr\">讀</span><rt>dú</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWrite (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">写</span><span class=\"tr\">寫</span><rt>xiě</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi guān xì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIt\'s ok (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没关系</span><span class=\"tr\">沒關係</span><rt>méi guān xì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liàn xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npractise (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">练习</span><span class=\"tr\">練習</span><rt>liàn xí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfine (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这么</span><span class=\"tr\">這麽</span><rt>zhè me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(6, 'my-family-2', 'My family', '我的家人', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/1060.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1060-pybqsfoqlhcli7dl5lerfi5jdlv37tme6qdjfowvo2.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/my-family-2/', '王老师好久不见好久不见你也来这家饭店吃饭对我和我的家人来吃饭我的朋友说这里的广东菜很好吃你的爸爸妈妈也来了吗没有他们喜欢在家吃我的孩子们来了那是我的老公小孙那个是我的大儿子小宝今年岁了这是我的小女儿小贝今年岁了你们一家四口人真幸福孩子们都上学了吗大儿子去年上小学了小女儿明年上小学你老公也会说汉语吗哈哈当然他是中国人', 'Wáng lǎo shī hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn nǐ yě lái zhè jiā fàn diàn chī fàn duì wǒ hé wǒ de jiā rén lái chī fàn wǒ de péng yǒu shuō zhè lǐ de Guǎngdōng cài hěn hǎo chī nǐ de bà ba mā ma yě lái le ma méi yǒu tā men xǐ huān zài jiā chī wǒ de hái zi men lái le nà shì wǒ de lǎo gōng xiǎo Sūn nà gè shì wǒ de dà ér zi Xiǎobǎo jīn nián suì le zhè shì wǒ de xiǎo nǚ ér xiǎo Bèi jīn nián suì le nǐ men yī jiā sì kǒu rén zhēn xìng fú hái zi men dōu shàng xué le ma dà ér zi qù nián shàng xiǎo xué le xiǎo nǚ ér míng nián shàng xiǎo xué nǐ lǎo gōng yě huì shuō hàn yǔ ma hā hā dāng rán tā shì Zhōngguó rén', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWang\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">王</span><span class=\"tr\">王</span><rt>Wáng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhaven\'t seen you for a long time\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好久不见</span><span class=\"tr\">好久不見</span><rt>hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhaven\'t seen you for a long time\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好久不见</span><span class=\"tr\">好久不見</span><rt>hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fàn diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrestaurant\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">饭店</span><span class=\"tr\">飯店</span><rt>fàn diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeal\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">饭</span><span class=\"tr\">飯</span><rt>fàn</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nright (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFamily (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></a