x. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlittle (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnext year\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明年</span><span class=\"tr\">明年</span><rt>míng nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nprimary school\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小学</span><span class=\"tr\">小學</span><rt>xiǎo xué</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo gōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhusband\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老公</span><span class=\"tr\">老公</span><rt>lǎo gōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hā hā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHa ha\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哈哈</span><span class=\"tr\">哈哈</span><rt>hā hā</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dāng rán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncertainly (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">当然</span><span class=\"tr\">當然</span><rt>dāng rán</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国人</span><span class=\"tr\">中國人</span><rt>Zhōngguó rén</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(7, 'what-to-do-tomorrow', 'What to do tomorrow?', '明天做什么？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/1059.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1059-pwms56u41idwy5t5za0bxph04misi6bz1686ahqslu.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-to-do-tomorrow/', '明天你想做什么明天去学校明天星期六休息是呢我忘了明天上午我想在家睡觉下午我想去书店买书你呢我想去买东西你想买什么我想买一个杯子一盒牛奶还有一些水果你喜欢吃什么水果我喜欢吃香蕉和苹果我家也没有水果了现在的苹果很好你帮我也买一斤吧没问题我明天几点给你苹果明天我五点从书店回家你五点来我家吧你也可以在我家吃饭明天我们自己做怎么样好明天五点我去你家', 'míng tiān nǐ xiǎng zuò shén me míng tiān qù xué xiào míng tiān xīng qī liù xiū xī shì ne wǒ wàng le míng tiān shàng wǔ wǒ xiǎng zài jiā shuì jiào xià wǔ wǒ xiǎng qù shū diàn mǎi shū nǐ ne wǒ xiǎng qù mǎi dōng xi nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me wǒ xiǎng mǎi yī gè bēi zi yī hé niú nǎi hái yǒu yī xiē shuǐ guǒ nǐ xǐ huān chī shén me shuǐ guǒ wǒ xǐ huān chī xiāng jiāo hé píng guǒ wǒ jiā yě méi yǒu shuǐ guǒ le xiàn zài de píng guǒ hěn hǎo nǐ bāng wǒ yě mǎi yī jīn ba méi wèn tí wǒ míng tiān jǐ diǎn gěi nǐ píng guǒ míng tiān wǒ wǔ diǎn cóng shū diàn huí jiā nǐ wǔ diǎn lái wǒ jiā ba nǐ yě kě yǐ zài wǒ jiā chī fàn míng tiān wǒ men zì jǐ zuò zěn me yàng hǎo míng tiān wǔ diǎn wǒ qù nǐ jiā', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nschool (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīng qī liù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSaturday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星期六</span><span class=\"tr\">星期六</span><rt>xīng qī liù</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiū xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrest (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">休息</span><span class=\"tr\">休息</span><rt>xiū xī</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nforget\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">忘</span><span class=\"tr\">忘</span><rt>wàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=