(8, 'shopping-story', 'Shopping', '买东西', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/1058.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1058-pv46ek3zu27bg0ageifzlx4xc08n0kpmiv9oim4thu.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/shopping-story/', '先生你想买什么我很渴有喝的东西吗有我们有水茶牛奶咖啡啤酒你想喝什么我要一瓶啤酒好的还要什么吗我也买些吃的东西吧没问题我们有米饭面条也有面包你想要哪个一个面包一共多少钱啤酒三块五面包十块一共十三块五好的给你钱这是你买的东西再见再见', 'xiān shēng nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me wǒ hěn kě yǒu hē de dōngxi ma yǒu wǒ men yǒu shuǐ chá niú nǎi kā fēi pí jiǔ nǐ xiǎng hē shén me wǒ yào yī píng pí jiǔ hǎo de hái yào shén me ma wǒ yě mǎi xiē chī de dōngxi ba méi wèn tí wǒ men yǒu mǐ fàn miàn tiáo yě yǒu miàn bāo nǐ xiǎng yào nǎ gè yī gè miàn bāo yī gòng duō shǎo qián pí jiǔ sān kuài wǔ miàn bāo shí kuài yī gòng shí sān kuài wǔ hǎo de gěi nǐ qián zhè shì nǐ mǎi de dōngxi zài jiàn zài jiàn', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiān shēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsir (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">先生</span><span class=\"tr\">先生</span><rt>xiān shēng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">