(9, 'how-is-it-going-recently', 'How is it going recently?', '最近怎么样', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/1057.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1057-pu9mecrobwic8dsns3ts5w6md8lrrcnao21xrhr1aq.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/how-is-it-going-recently/', '李老师好久不见乐乐妈妈好久不见乐乐最近在学校怎么样他喜欢帮助大家同学们也很喜欢他但是最近学习马马虎虎他学习不努力每天回家就喜欢看电视看太多电视不好是我说了他不听明天他来学校我也跟他说说这个事太好了谢谢李老师', 'lǐ lǎo shī hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn lè lè mā mā hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn lè lè zuì jìn zài xué xiào zěn me yàng tā xǐ huān bāng zhù dà jiā tóng xué men yě hěn xǐ huān tā dàn shì zuì jìn xué xí mǎ mǎ hǔ hǔ tā xué xí bù nǔ lì měi tiān huí jiā jiù xǐ huān kàn diàn shì kàn tài duō diàn shì bù hǎo shì wǒ shuō le tā bù tīng míng tiān tā lái xué xiào wǒ yě gēn tā shuō shuō zhè gè shì tài hǎo le xiè xiè lǐ lǎo shī', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李</span><span class=\"tr\">李</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLong (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">久</span><span class=\"tr\">久</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSee\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr re