(10, 'dad-and-mom-are-not-at-home', 'Dad and mom are not at home', '爸妈不在家', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Dad_and_mom_are_not_at_home_-_1009.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1009-o2ub322plwm31p0p4axrrh0noyzi2nu8i7gawsglgs.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/dad-and-mom-are-not-at-home/', '今天爸爸妈妈不在家我和弟弟妹妹在家妹妹想喝可乐吃米饭弟弟想喝茶吃面条我想喝咖啡吃面包但是我不会做米饭和面条他们不喜欢面包这是个问题爸爸妈妈什么时候回家呢', 'jīn tiān bà ba mā ma bù zài jiā wǒ hé dì di mèi mei zài jiā mèi mei xiǎng hē kě lè chī mǐ fàn dì di xiǎng hē chá chī miàn tiáo wǒ xiǎng hē kā fēi chī miàn bāo dàn shì wǒ bù huì zuò mǐ fàn hé miàn tiáo tā men bù xǐ huān miàn bāo zhè shì gè wèn tí bà ba mā ma shén me shí hòu huí jiā ne', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì di :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLittle brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">弟弟</span><span class=\"tr\">弟弟</span><rt>dì di </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mèi mei :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妹妹</span><span class=\"tr\">妹妹</span><rt>mèi mei </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā </rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mèi mei :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妹妹</span><span class=\"tr\">妹妹</span><rt>mèi mei </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwant (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě lè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCoke\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可乐</span><span class=\"tr\">可樂</span><rt>kě lè </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǐ fàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrice (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">米饭</span><span class=\"tr\">米飯</span><rt>mǐ fàn </rt></ruby></abbr>；<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì di :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLittle brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">弟弟</span><span class=\"tr\">弟弟</span><rt>dì di </