tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDo not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǐ fàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrice (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">米饭</span><span class=\"tr\">米飯</span><rt>mǐ fàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn tiáo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnoodles (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面条</span><span class=\"tr\">麵條</span><rt>miàn tiáo </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDo not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn bāo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbread (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面包</span><span class=\"tr\">麵包</span><rt>miàn bāo </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèn tí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nproblem (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">问题</span><span class=\"tr\">問題</span><rt>wèn tí </rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麼</span><rt>shén me </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí hòu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时候</span><span class=\"tr\">時候</span><rt>shí hòu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí jiā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nReturn home\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回家</span><span class=\"tr\">回家</span><rt>huí jiā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne </rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(11, 'never-seen', 'Never Seen', '没见过', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Never_Seen-1052.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1052-o2uf0isa6a9mczj92gag0rw26lq6irfxye111ypl0s.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/never-seen/', '岁的女儿回家后妈妈看见她的手很脏就说看你的手多脏你什么时候看到过我的手这么脏了女儿回答没有妈妈因为我没有看到过你岁的样子', 'suì de nǚ ér huí jiā hòu mā ma kàn jiàn tā de shǒu hěn zāng jiù shuō kàn nǐ de shǒu duō zāng nǐ shén me shí hou kàn dào guò wǒ de shǒu zhè me zāng le nǚ ér huí dá méi yǒu mā ma yīn wèi wǒ méi yǒu kàn dào guò nǐ suì de yàng zi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>7<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyear old (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hòu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafter\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">后</span><span class=\"tr\">後</span><rt>hòu </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn jiàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsee (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看见</span><span class=\"tr\">看見</span><rt>kàn jiàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhand\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手</span><span class=\"tr\">手</span><rt>shǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zāng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndirty (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">脏</span><span class=\"tr\">髒</span><rt>zāng </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlook, see (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhand\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手</span><span class=\"tr\">手</span><rt>shǒu </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zāng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndirty (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">脏</span><span class=\"tr\">髒</span><rt>zāng </rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麼</span><rt>shén me </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí hou :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时候</span><span class=\"tr\">時候</span><rt>shí hou </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlook, see (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(as a verb complement to show the result of an action) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhand\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手</span><span class=\"tr\">手</span><rt>shǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè me :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这么</span><span class=\"tr\">這麼</span><rt>zhè me </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zāng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndirty (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">脏</span><span class=\"tr\">髒</span><rt>zāng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. wor