(12, 'ride-in-a-car', 'Ride in a Car', '坐车', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Ride_in_a_Car-1056.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1056-1-o3xqx4umv1xjegyxt57r9ihdwm7f786l1eds9r3xrg.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/ride-in-a-car/', '一天爸爸带儿子去玩回来的路上儿子对爸爸说爸爸我累了我们坐车吧那要看你表现爸爸说儿子说好的如果我表现好我们就坐公共汽车回去如果我表现不好我们就坐出租车回去', 'yī tiān bà ba dài ér zi qù wán huí lái de lù shang ér zi duì bà ba shuō bà ba wǒ lèi le wǒ men zuò chē ba nà yào kàn nǐ biǎo xiàn bà ba shuō ér zi shuō hǎo de rú guǒ wǒ biǎo xiàn hǎo wǒ men jiù zuò gōng gòng qì chē huí qù rú guǒ wǒ biǎo xiàn bù hǎo wǒ men jiù zuò chū zū chē huí qù', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī tiān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none day\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一天</span><span class=\"tr\">一天</span><rt>yī tiān </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbring (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplay (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">玩</span><span class=\"tr\">玩</span><rt>wán </rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn, go back (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí </rt></ruby