(13, 'fall-asleep', 'Fall Asleep', '睡着', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Fall_Asleep-1055.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1055-o3no6kd7uhqgqp9qoi8j4spyv68auikhnhf8sx6h0s.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/fall-asleep/', '儿子不想睡觉爸爸坐在他的旁边给他讲故事一个小时过去了房间里很安静没有一点儿声音这时妈妈开门问他睡着了吗睡着了妈妈儿子说爸爸读了一分钟就睡着了', 'ér zi bù xiǎng shuì jiào bà ba zuò zài tā de páng biān gěi tā jiǎng gù shi yī gè xiǎo shí guò qù le fáng jiān lǐ hěn ān jìng méi yǒu yī diǎnr shēng yīn zhè shí mā ma kāi mén wèn tā shuì zháo le ma shuì zháo le mā ma ér zi shuō bà ba dú le yī fēn zhōng jiù shuì zháo le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuì jiào :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to bed (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">睡觉</span><span class=\"tr\">睡覺</span><rt>shuì jiào </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsit (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坐</span><span class=\"tr\">坐</span><rt>zuò </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài