><span class=\"si\">房间</span><span class=\"tr\">房間</span><rt>fáng jiān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裡</span><rt>lǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ān jìng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquiet (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">安静</span><span class=\"tr\">安靜</span><rt>ān jìng </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi yǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī diǎnr :&lt;br /&gt;\r\na little, a bit\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一点儿</span><span class=\"tr\">一點兒</span><rt>yī diǎnr </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng yīn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsound (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">声音</span><span class=\"tr\">聲音</span><rt>shēng yīn </rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nopen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开</span><span class=\"tr\">開</span><rt>kāi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mén :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndoor (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">门</span><span class=\"tr\">門</span><rt>mén </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nask (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">问</span><span class=\"tr\">問</span><rt>wèn </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuì zháo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfall asleep\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">睡着</span><span class=\"tr\">睡著</span><rt>shuì zháo </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma </rt></ruby></abbr>？”</p>\r\n<p>”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuì zháo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfall asleep\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">睡着</span><span class=\"tr\">睡著</span><rt>shuì zháo </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma</rt></ruby></abbr>。”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>，”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dú :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nread (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">读</span><span class=\"tr\">讀</span><rt>dú </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span>