(14, 'result', 'Result', '结果', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Result-1054.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1054-o3cih4pasf4ce5b8ayzb5l9eu6sxgao9q0xfc5akrw.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/result/', '老师说今天我们来学习减法小明你哥哥有五个苹果你从那儿拿走三个结果会怎样小明回答老师结果他一定会打我的昨天我只吃了哥哥的一个苹果他就打我了所以我们可以不从哥哥那儿拿走苹果吗', 'lǎo shī shuō jīn tiān wǒ men lái xué xí jiǎn fǎ xiǎo míng nǐ gē ge yǒu wǔ gè píng guǒ nǐ cóng nàr ná zǒu sān gè jié guǒ huì zěn yàng xiǎo míng huí dá lǎo shī jié guǒ tā yī dìng huì dǎ wǒ de zuó tiān wǒ zhǐ chī le gē ge de yī gè píng guǒ tā jiù dǎ wǒ le suǒ yǐ wǒ men kě yǐ bù cóng gē ge nàr ná zǒu píng guǒ ma', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(before a verb, indicating an intended or suggested action) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlearn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎn fǎ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsubtraction\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">减法</span><span class=\"tr\">減法</span><rt>jiǎn fǎ </rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo míng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiao Ming\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小明</span><span class=\"tr\">小明</span><rt>xiǎo míng </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gē ge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbrother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gē ge</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǔ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfive (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>wǔ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"píng guǒ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\napple (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苹果</span><span class=\"tr\">蘋果</span><rt>píng guǒ </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nàr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那儿</span><span class=\"tr\">那兒</span><rt>nàr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ná :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拿</span><span class=\"tr\">拿</span><rt>ná </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\naway (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">走</span><span class=\"tr\">走</span><rt>zǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān :&lt;