(16, 'distribute-watermelon', 'Distribute Watermelon', '分西瓜', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Distribute_Watermelon-1051.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1051-o2uf08g233vgt9y9qttjrchznd5563aw8yuorx4wx8.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/distribute-watermelon/', '爸爸买了一个西瓜儿子叫来了两个小朋友一起吃一个说我要二分之一另一个说我要三分之一儿子最后说这个西瓜是我爸爸买的我就多吃一点儿我要百分之一', 'bà ba mǎi le yī gè xī guā ér zi jiào lái le liǎng gè xiǎo péng yǒu yī qǐ chī yī gè shuō wǒ yào èr fēn zhī yī lìng yī gè shuō wǒ yào sān fēn zhī yī ér zi zuì hòu shuō zhè gè xī guā shì wǒ bà ba mǎi de wǒ jiù duō chī yī diǎnr wǒ yào bǎi fēn zhī yī', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xī guā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwatermelon (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">西瓜</span><span class=\"tr\">西瓜</span><rt>xī guā </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abb