(17, 'smart-hawker', 'Smart Hawker', '聪明的小贩', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Smart_Hawker-1050.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1050-o2uezy3tzxhb9kdaf7cnhx3x44k3tf5ujjochvk8to.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/smart-hawker/', '有一个人去买牛奶小贩说三元一杯十元三杯他拿三块钱买了一杯像这样买了三次然后对小贩说你看我拿九块钱就买了三杯小贩说我这么做每次都能卖出三杯', 'yǒu yī gè rén qù mǎi niú nǎi xiǎo fàn shuō sān yuán yī bēi shí yuán sān bēi tā ná sān kuài qián mǎi le yī bēi xiàng zhè yàng mǎi le sān cì rán hòu duì xiǎo fàn shuō nǐ kàn wǒ ná jiǔ kuài qián jiù mǎi le sān bēi xiǎo fàn shuō wǒ zhè me zuò měi cì dōu néng mài chū sān bēi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén :&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"niú nǎi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmilk (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">牛奶</span><span class=\"tr\">牛奶</span><rt>niú nǎi </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo fàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhawker\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小贩</span><span class=\"tr\">小販</span><rt>xiǎo fàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(monetary unit of China) yuan  (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">元</span><span class=\"tr\">元</span><rt>yuán </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bēi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) cup\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杯</span><span class=\"tr\">杯</span><rt>bēi </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">十</span><span class=\"tr\">十</span><rt>shí </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(monetary unit of China) yuan  (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">元</span><span class=\"tr\">元</span><rt>yuán </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bēi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) cup\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杯</span><span class=\"tr\">杯</span><rt>bēi </rt></ruby></abbr>。”</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ná :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拿</span><span class=\"tr\">拿</span><rt>ná </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">块</span><span class=\"tr\">塊</span><rt>kuài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmoney (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱</span><span class=\"tr\">錢</span><rt>qián </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bēi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) cup\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杯</span><span class=\"tr\">杯</span><rt>bēi </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">像</span><span class=\"tr\">像</span><rt>xiàng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè yàng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsuch, so\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这样</span><span class=\"tr\">這樣</span><rt>zhè yàng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo fàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhawker\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小贩</span><span class=\"tr\">小販</span><rt>xiǎo fàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlook, see (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ná :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拿</span><span class=\"tr\">拿</span><rt>ná </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnine (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">九</span><span class=\"tr\">九</span><rt>jiǔ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">块</span><span class=\"tr\">塊</span><rt>kuài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmoney (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱</span><span class=\"tr\">錢</span><rt>qián </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux.