(18, 'lost-girl', 'Lost Girl', '迷失的女孩', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Lost_Girl-1049.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1049-o2uejt7kobe3yjt2n897ozp20039oh3qboi9wvhjn0.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/lost-girl/', '有一个小女孩在路边哭警察过来问好孩子怎么了小女孩哭着说我想回家但是我不知道回家的路了警察问你爸爸叫什么小女孩说亲爱的警察问你妈妈叫什么小女孩说宝贝', 'yǒu yī gè xiǎo nǚ hái zài lù biān kū jǐng chá guò lái wèn hǎo hái zi zěn me le xiǎo nǚ hái kū zhe shuō wǒ xiǎng huí jiā dàn shì wǒ bù zhī dào huí jiā de lù le jǐng chá wèn nǐ bà ba jiào shén me xiǎo nǚ hái shuō qīn ài de jǐng chá wèn nǐ mā ma jiào shén me xiǎo nǚ hái shuō bǎo bèi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlittle (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ hái :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngirl\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女孩</span><span class=\"tr\">女孩</span><rt>nǚ hái </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nroad, way (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">路</span><span class=\"tr\">路</span><rt>lù </rt></ruby></ab