(19, 'playing-with-water', 'Playing with Water', '玩水', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Playing_with_Water-1048.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1048-o2uejhxieayo389gh3dov2jivdmv43uya4og5jy9po.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/playing-with-water/', '星期六妈妈和儿子在家看电视妈妈说儿子你很喜欢玩水是不是五岁的儿子以为妈妈要带他去游泳池玩高兴地说是的妈妈妈妈说那你一定也喜欢洗碗今天你洗碗怎么样', 'xīng qī liù mā ma hé ér zi zài jiā kàn diàn shì mā ma shuō ér zi nǐ hěn xǐ huān wán shuǐ shì bù shì wǔ suì de ér zi yǐ wéi mā ma yào dài tā qù yóu yǒng chí wán gāo xìng de shuō shì de mā ma mā ma shuō nà nǐ yī dìng yě xǐ huān xǐ wǎn jīn tiān nǐ xǐ wǎn zěn me yàng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīng qī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweek (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星期</span><span class=\"tr\">星期</span><rt>xīng qī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsix (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">六</span><span class=\"tr\">六</span><rt>liù </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwatch (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn shì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTV (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">电视</span><span class=\"tr\">電視</span><rt>diàn shì </rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā ma :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā ma </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplay (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">玩</span><span class=\"tr\">玩</span><rt>wán </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwater (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">水</span><span class=\"tr\">水</span><rt>shuǐ </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù shì :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不是</span><span class=\"tr\">不是</span><rt>bù shì </rt></ruby></abbr>？”</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǔ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfive (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr