2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">洗</span><span class=\"tr\">洗</span><rt>xǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbowl (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">碗</span><span class=\"tr\">碗</span><rt>wǎn </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwash (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">洗</span><span class=\"tr\">洗</span><rt>xǐ </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbowl (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">碗</span><span class=\"tr\">碗</span><rt>wǎn </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me yàng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow about it (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麼樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng </rt></ruby></abbr>？”</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(20, 'climb-mountain', 'Climb Mountain', '爬山', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/learnchinese/Climb_Mountain-1037.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1037-o2uej6ng4aj87wpuayi615dzqr6gjqm68kume8ezsc.jpg', '', 'HSK1', 'https://mandarinbean.com/climb-mountain/', '星期六爸爸带着小儿子爬山他们花了个小时爬到了山顶爸爸说看山下的景色多好儿子说爸爸山下的景色那么好我们为什么要花那么多时间爬上来呢', 'xīng qī liù bà ba dài zhe xiǎo ér zi pá shān tā men huā le gè xiǎo shí pá dào le shān dǐng bà ba shuō kàn shān xià de jǐng sè duō hǎo ér zi shuō bà ba shān xià de jǐng sè nà me hǎo wǒ men wèi shén me yào huā nà me duō shí jiān pá shàng lái ne', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīng qī :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweek (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星期</span><span class=\"tr\">星期</span><rt>xīng qī </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liù :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsix (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">六</span><span class=\"tr\">六</span><rt>liù </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbring (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhe :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsmall, little (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pá :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclimb\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爬</span><span class=\"tr\">爬</span><rt>pá </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmountain\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">山</span><span class=\"tr\">山</span><rt>shān </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr>3<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo shí :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhour (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小时</span><span class=\"tr\">小時</span><rt>xiǎo shí </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pá :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclimb\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爬</span><span class=\"tr\">爬</span><rt>pá </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmountain\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">山</span><span class=\"tr\">山</span><rt>shān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǐng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntop (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">顶</span><span class=\"tr\">頂</span><rt>dǐng </rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlook (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmountain\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">山</span><span class=\"tr\">山</span><rt>shān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunder (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐng sè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nview (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">景色</span><span class=\"tr\">景色</span><rt>jǐng sè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo </rt></ruby></abbr>！”</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō </rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà ba :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bà ba </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmountain\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">山</span><span class=\"tr\">山</span><rt>shān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunder (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐng sè :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nview (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">景色</span><span class=\"tr\">景色</span><rt>jǐng sè </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà me :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那么</span><span class=\"tr\">那麼</span><rt>nà me </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo </rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèi shén me :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhy (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">为什么</span><span class=\"tr\">為什麼</span><rt>wèi shén me </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nneed (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà me :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那么</span><span class=\"tr\">那麼</span><rt>nà me </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí jiān :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时间</span><span class=\"tr\">時間</span><rt>shí jiān </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pá :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclimb\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爬</span><span class=\"tr\">爬</span><rt>pá </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng :&lt;br /&gt;\r\nup (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne :&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne </rt></ruby></abbr>？”</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(22, 'which-one-should-i-buy', 'Which One Should I Buy?', '买哪件？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2138.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2138-rd73cfjt7jckm8sfnejdhpsqk7ddan8wkmbipdkces.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/which-one-should-i-buy/', '我在商场买衣服红色的衣服很好看但是很贵黑色的衣服便宜一点儿但是颜色不好两件衣服的大小都合适我应该买哪件呢', 'wǒ zài shāng chǎng mǎi yīfu hóng sè de yīfu hěn hǎo kàn dàn shì hěn guì hēi sè de yīfu pián yí yī diǎnr dàn shì yán sè bù hǎo liǎng jiàn yīfu de dà xiǎo dōu hé shì wǒ yīng gāi mǎi nǎ jiàn ne', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shāng chǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshopping mall \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">商场</span><span class=\"tr\">商場</span><rt>shāng chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīfu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclothes (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yīfu</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hóng sè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nred \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">红色</span><span class=\"tr\">紅色</span><rt>hóng sè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīfu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclothes (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yīfu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood-looking \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好看</span><span class=\"tr\">好看</span><rt>hǎo kàn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexpensive (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">贵</span><span class=\"tr\">貴</span><rt>guì</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hēi sè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nblack \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">黑色</span><span class=\"tr\">黑色</span><rt>hēi sè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīfu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclothes (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yīfu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pián yí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncheap (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">便宜</span><span class=\"tr\">便宜</span><rt>pián yí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī diǎnr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na little \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一点儿</span><span class=\"tr\">一點兒</span><rt>yī diǎnr</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yán sè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncolor (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">颜色</span><span class=\"tr\">顔色</span><rt>yán sè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">件</span><span class=\"tr\">件</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīfu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclothes (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yīfu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà xiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsize \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大小</span><span class=\"tr\">大小</span><rt>dà xiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfit (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">合适</span><span class=\"tr\">合適</span><rt>hé shì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīng gāi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshould (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">应该</span><span class=\"tr\">應該</span><rt>yīng gāi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbuy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhich (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哪</span><span class=\"tr\">哪</span><rt>nǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"to