(23, 'my-daughter', 'My Daughter', '我的女儿', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2137.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2137-rbqul9q9z3ckk77wx3zgxvsel5cpqnibda86odncno.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/my-daughter/', '我有一个女儿她今年五岁她的名字叫小宝她很可爱也很聪明她每天早上七点起床穿衣服洗脸吃东西她最喜欢鸡蛋和牛奶她不喜欢学校每次去学校都会哭她喜欢晚上因为晚上可以听我讲故事我爱我的女儿', 'wǒ yǒu yī gè nǚ ér tā jīn nián wǔ suì tā de míng zì jiào Xiǎo Bǎo tā hěn kě ài yě hěn cōng míng tā měi tiān zǎo shàng qī diǎn qǐ chuáng chuān yī fú xǐ liǎn chī dōng xī tā zuì xǐ huān jī dàn hé niú nǎi tā bù xǐ huān xué xiào měi cì qù xué xiào dōu huì kū tā xǐ huān wǎn shàng yīn wèi wǎn shàng kě yǐ tīng wǒ jiǎng gù shì wǒ ài wǒ de nǚ ér', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis year \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今年</span><span class=\"tr\">今年</span><rt>jīn nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfive (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyears old (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nher \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她的</span><span class=\"tr\">她的</span><rt>tā de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nname (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">名字</span><span class=\"tr\">名字</span><rt>míng zì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncalled (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎo Bǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiao Bao \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小宝</span><span class=\"tr\">小寶</span><rt>Xiǎo Bǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlovely (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可爱</span><span class=\"tr\">可愛</span><rt>kě ài</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cōng míng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclever (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">聪明</span><span class=\"tr\">聰明</span><rt>cōng míng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nseven (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">七</span><span class=\"tr\">七</span><rt>qī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ chuáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nget up (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">起床</span><span class=\"tr\">起床</span><rt>qǐ chuáng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwear (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">穿</span><span class=\"tr\">穿</span><rt>chuān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī fú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclothes (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yī fú</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwash (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">洗</span><span class=\"tr\">洗</span><rt>xǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nface (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">脸</span><span class=\"tr\">臉</span><rt>liǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōng xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōng xī</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmost (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最</span><span class=\"tr\">最</span><rt>zuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī dàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neggs (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">鸡蛋</span><span class=\"tr\">鶏蛋</span><rt>jī dàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"niú nǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmilk (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">牛奶</span><span class=\"tr\">牛奶</span><rt>niú nǎi</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nschool (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nschool (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncry (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哭</span><span class=\"tr\">哭</span><rt>kū</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn wèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecause (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因爲</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlisten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntell (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">讲</span><span class=\"tr\">講</span><rt>jiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gù shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstories (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">故事</span><span class=\"tr\">故事</span><rt>gù shì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlove (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爱</span><span class=\"tr\">愛</span><rt>ài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(24, 'my-friend', 'My friend', '我的朋友', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2136.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2136-ra8dr70thcuvt98qdnudyjj8o0uk2csx4un01k98pe.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/my-friend/', '我有一个好朋友他叫李明他是我的大学同学现在二十二岁我们认识四年了李明很高也很胖他喜欢运动更喜欢吃东西我们经常一起上课吃饭我们也会一起跑步看电影但是有一天他说他喜欢我的女朋友我很不高兴我们还能做朋友吗我不知道怎么办', 'wǒ yǒu yī gè hǎo péng yǒu tā jiào Lǐ Míng tā shì wǒ de dà xué tóng xué xiàn zài èr shí èr suì wǒ men rèn shí sì nián le Lǐ Míng hěn gāo yě hěn pàng tā xǐ huān yùn dòng gèng xǐ huān chī dōngxi wǒ men jīng cháng yī qǐ shàng kè chī fàn wǒ men yě huì yī qǐ pǎo bù kàn diàn yǐng dàn shì yǒu yī tiān tā shuō tā xǐ huān wǒ de nǚ péng yǒu wǒ hěn bù gāo xìng wǒ men hái néng zuò péng yǒu ma wǒ bù zhī dào zěn me bàn', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;I, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;have, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;one (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;good, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;friend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;he, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiào:&lt;br /&gt;called (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lǐ Míng:&lt;br /&gt;Li Ming \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李明</span><span class=\"tr\">李明</span><rt>Lǐ Míng</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;he, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;my, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà xué:&lt;br /&gt;university \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大学</span><span class=\"tr\">大學</span><rt>dà xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóng xué:&lt;br /&gt;classmate (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">同学</span><span class=\"tr\">同學</span><rt>tóng xué</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;now (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"èr shí èr:&lt;br /&gt;twenty-two \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">二十二</span><span class=\"tr\">二十二</span><rt>èr shí èr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suì:&lt;br /&gt;years old (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;we, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn shí:&lt;br /&gt;know (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">认识</span><span class=\"tr\">認識</span><rt>rèn shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sì:&lt;br /&gt;four (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">四</span><span class=\"tr\">四</span><rt>sì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;years (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lǐ Míng:&lt;br /&gt;Li Ming \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李明</span><span class=\"tr\">李明</span><rt>Lǐ Míng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;very (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo:&lt;br /&gt;tall (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高</span><span class=\"tr\">高</span><rt>gāo</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;also (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;very (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pàng:&lt;br /&gt;fat (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">胖</span><span class=\"tr\">胖</span><rt>pàng</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;he, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;likes (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yùn dòng:&lt;br /&gt;sports, movement (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">运动</span><span class=\"tr\">運動</span><rt>yùn dòng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng:&lt;br /&gt;more (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更</span><span class=\"tr\">更</span><rt>gèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;eating (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōngxi:&lt;br /&gt;thing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōngxi</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;we, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;often (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;together (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng kè:&lt;br /&gt;attend class \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上课</span><span class=\"tr\">上課</span><rt>shàng kè</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī fàn:&lt;br /&gt;have meal \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃饭</span><span class=\"tr\">吃飯</span><rt>chī fàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;we, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;also (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;would (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;together (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pǎo bù:&lt;br /&gt;run (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">跑步</span><span class=\"tr\">跑步</span><rt>pǎo bù</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn:&lt;br /&gt;watch (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn yǐng:&lt;br /&gt;movies (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">电影</span><span class=\"tr\">電影</span><rt>diàn yǐng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;But (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;have, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;one (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;day \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;he, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;say \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;he, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;my, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ:&lt;br /&gt;girl \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女</span><span class=\"tr\">女</span><rt>nǚ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;friend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;I, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;very (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;no, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo xìng:&lt;br /&gt;happy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高兴</span><span class=\"tr\">高興</span><rt>gāo xìng</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;we, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái:&lt;br /&gt;still (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">还</span><span class=\"tr\">還</span><rt>hái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;can (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;do, make (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;friend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;I, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;no, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī dào:&lt;br /&gt;know (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me bàn:&lt;br /&gt;what to do \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么办</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽辦</span><rt>zěn me bàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。 </p>\r\n<p></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(25, 'music', 'Music', '音乐', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2135.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2135-r8jht8gua32kwad14ebvj726spzw0xqdct8t1cu9qs.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/music/', '我喜欢音乐每天我都听很多音乐早上我在车里听音乐晚上我在家听音乐音乐是我的好朋友我的妈妈喜欢听慢的音乐爸爸喜欢听老的音乐姐姐喜欢听快的音乐这些我都喜欢因为喜欢听音乐所以我也喜欢唱歌我会唱很多歌我和我的好朋友经常一起唱我不会跳舞但是我觉得不会跳也没关系', 'wǒ xǐ huān yīn yuè měi tiān wǒ dōu tīng hěn duō yīn yuè zǎo shàng wǒ zài chē lǐ tīng yīn yuè wǎn shàng wǒ zài jiā tīng yīn yuè yīn yuè shì wǒ de hǎo péng yǒu wǒ de māma xǐ huān tīng màn de yīn yuè bàba xǐ huān tīng lǎo de yīn yuè jiějie xǐ huān tīng kuài de yīn yuè zhè xiē wǒ dōu xǐ huān yīn wèi xǐ huān tīng yīn yuè suǒ yǐ wǒ yě xǐ huān chàng gē wǒ huì chàng hěn duō gē wǒ hé wǒ de hǎo péng yǒu jīng cháng yī qǐ chàng wǒ bù huì tiào wǔ dàn shì wǒ jué de bù huì tiào yě méi guān xì', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlisten to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe car \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">车</span><span class=\"tr\">車</span><rt>chē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裏</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlisten to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>； <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevening (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlisten to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abb