an class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfast (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快</span><span class=\"tr\">快</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthese \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这些</span><span class=\"tr\">這些</span><rt>zhè xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn wèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBecause (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因爲</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlove (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto listen to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusic (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音乐</span><span class=\"tr\">音樂</span><rt>yīn yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suǒ yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">所以</span><span class=\"tr\">所以</span><rt>suǒ yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlove (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chàng gē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto sing (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">唱歌</span><span class=\"tr\">唱歌</span><rt>chàng gē</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsing \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">唱</span><span class=\"tr\">唱</span><rt>chàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsongs \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">歌</span><span class=\"tr\">歌</span><rt>gē</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriends (HS