p\" title=\"méi guān xì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nit doesn\'t matter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没关系</span><span class=\"tr\">沒關係</span><rt>méi guān xì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(26, 'mothers-day-2', 'Mother’s Day', '母亲节', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2134.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2134-r73q3tdlhb8lk9aokecg1hiu8ux4e8ibv7wvqix784.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/mothers-day-2/', '今天是母亲节早上女儿和儿子对妈妈说妈妈母亲节快乐我们爱你妈妈笑了女儿给妈妈买了一件衣服儿子给妈妈买了花这些都是妈妈喜欢的东西妈妈非常高兴', 'jīn tiān shì Mǔqīn jié zǎo shàng nǚ ér hé ér zi duì māma shuō māma Mǔqīn jié kuài lè wǒ men ài nǐ māma xiào le nǚ ér gěi māma mǎi le yī jiàn yīfu ér zi gěi māma mǎi le huā zhè xiē dōu shì māma xǐ huān de dōngxi māma fēi cháng gāo xìng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Mǔqīn jié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmother\'s day \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">母亲节</span><span class=\"tr\">母親節</span><rt>Mǔqīn jié</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>： “ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Mǔqīn jié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmother\'s day \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">母亲节</span><span class=\"tr\">母親節</span><rt>Mǔqīn jié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài lè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhappy (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快乐</span><span class=\"tr\">快樂</span><rt>kuài lè</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爱</span><span class=\"tr\">愛</span><rt>ài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>！ ” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlaugh (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">笑</span><span class=\"tr\">笑</span><rt>xiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase, buy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">件</span><span class=\"tr\">件</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīfu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclothing (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">衣服</span><span class=\"tr\">衣服</span><rt>yīfu</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase, buy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflower (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthese \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这些</span><span class=\"tr\">這些</span><rt>zhè xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōngxi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōngxi</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nVery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">非常</span><span class=\"tr\">非常</span><rt>fēi cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo xìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHappy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高兴</span><span class=\"tr\">高興</span><rt>gāo xìng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(27, 'have-meeting', 'Have meeting', '开会', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2133.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2133-r5kyc2vgqfusgh4tqad8azh01cpy1dzvucg0iv7r9w.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/have-meeting/', '今天下午我要开会这个会很重要但是我没准备好中午我没时间吃东西就在办公室里一边喝咖啡吃面包一边准备开会的东西终于在开会前我准备好了', 'jīn tiān xià wǔ wǒ yào kāi huì zhè gè huì hěn zhòng yào dàn shì wǒ méi zhǔn bèi hǎo zhōng wǔ wǒ méi shí jiān chī dōng xī jiù zài bàn gōng shì lǐ yī biān hē kā fēi chī miàn bāo yī biān zhǔn bèi kāi huì de dōng xī zhōng yú zài kāi huì qián wǒ zhǔn bèi hǎo le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafternoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下午</span><span class=\"tr\">下午</span><rt>xià wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave meeting \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开会</span><span class=\"tr\">開會</span><rt>kāi huì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhòng yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nimportant (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">重要</span><span class=\"tr\">重要</span><rt>zhòng yào</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǔn bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPrepare (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">准备</span><span class=\"tr\">準備</span><rt>zhǔn bèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中午</span><span class=\"tr\">中午</span><rt>zhōng wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时间</span><span class=\"tr\">時間</span><rt>shí jiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōng xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōng xī</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn gōng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noffice (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">办公室</span><span class=\"tr\">辦公室</span><rt>bàn gōng shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裏</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī biān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n一边……一边…… two actions going on at the same time (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一边</span><span class=\"tr\">一邊</span><rt>yī biān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kā fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncoffee (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tr\">咖啡</span><rt>kā fēi</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn bāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbread (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面包</span><span class=\"tr\">麵包</span><rt>miàn bāo</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī biān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n一边……一边…… two actions going on at the same time (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一边</span><span class=\"tr\">一邊</span><rt>yī biān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǔn bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPrepare (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">准备</span><span class=\"tr\">準備</span><rt>zhǔn bèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeeting \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开会</span><span class=\"tr\">開會</span><rt>kāi huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōng xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōng xī</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfinally (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">终于</span><span class=\"tr\">終于</span><rt>zhōng yú</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeeting \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开会</span><span class=\"tr\">開會</span><rt>kāi huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbefore \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǔn bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPrepare (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">准备</span><span class=\"tr\">準備</span><rt>zhǔn bèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(28, 'its-hot-today', 'It’s hot today', '今天很热', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2132.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2132-r43ut92ptdjkwyidzp7bz60z948wttwfckl2cbn9w4.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/its-hot-today/', '今天天气很热早上中文老师上了三节课非常渴她去超市买了一瓶水又回办公室喝了两杯茶舒服多了', 'jīn tiān tiān qì hěn rè zǎo shàng Zhōngwén lǎo shī shàng le sān jié kè fēi cháng kě tā qù chāo shì mǎi le yī píng shuǐ yòu huí bàn gōng shì hē le liǎng bēi chá shūfu duō le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天气</span><span class=\"tr\">天氣</span><rt>tiān qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhot (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">热</span><span class=\"tr\">熱</span><rt>rè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngwén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中文</span><span class=\"tr\">中文</span><rt>Zhōngwén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninstruct (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">节</span><span class=\"tr\">節</span><rt>jié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclass (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">课</span><span class=\"tr\">課</span><rt>kè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nVery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">非常</span><span class=\"tr\">非常</span><rt>fēi cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthirsty (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">渴</span><span class=\"tr\">渴</span><rt>kě</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chāo shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsupermarket (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">超市</span><span class=\"tr\">超市</span><rt>chāo shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase, buy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"píng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbottle (measure word) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">瓶</span><span class=\"tr\">瓶</span><rt>píng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwater (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">水</span><span class=\"tr\">水</span><rt>shuǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nagain (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">又</span><span class=\"tr\">又</span><rt>yòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn gōng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noffice (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">办公室</span><span class=\"tr\">辦公室</span><rt>bàn gōng shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncup (measure word) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杯</span><span class=\"tr\">杯</span><rt>bēi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTea (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">茶</span><span class=\"tr\">茶</span><rt>chá</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shūfu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nComfortable (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">舒服</span><span class=\"tr\">舒服</span><rt>shūfu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(29, 'what-to-eat-today', 'What to eat today?', '今天吃什么？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2031.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2131-r1fzbveszw18ovh6ghr682p4ylc8gglhffxwyzdcnm.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-to-eat-today/', '今天早上我说妈妈早餐我想吃面包汉堡和可乐妈妈说不行你只能吃面包鸡蛋和热牛奶我说中午能吃汉堡和可乐吗妈妈说中午可以吃汉堡不可以喝可乐我说好吧', 'jīn tiān zǎo shàng wǒ shuō māma zǎo cān wǒ xiǎng chī miàn bāo hàn bǎo hé kě lè māma shuō bù xíng nǐ zhǐ néng chī miàn bāo jī dàn hé rè niú nǎi wǒ shuō zhōng wǔ néng chī hàn bǎo hé kě lè ma māma shuō zhōng wǔ kě yǐ chī hàn bǎo bù kě yǐ hē kě lè wǒ shuō hǎo ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo cān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbreakfast \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早餐</span><span class=\"tr\">早餐</span><rt>zǎo cān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn bāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbread (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面包</span><span class=\"tr\">麵包</span><rt>miàn bāo</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn bǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHamburger \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉堡</span><span class=\"tr\">漢堡</span><rt>hàn bǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě lè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCola \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可乐</span><span class=\"tr\">可樂</span><rt>kě lè</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù xíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不行</span><span class=\"tr\">不行</span><rt>bù xíng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nonly (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn bāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbread (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面包</span><span class=\"tr\">麵包</span><rt>miàn bāo</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī dàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\negg (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">鸡蛋</span><span class=\"tr\">鶏蛋</span><rt>jī dàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhot (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">热</span><span class=\"tr\">熱</span><rt>rè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"niú nǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmilk (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">牛奶</span><span class=\"tr\">牛奶</span><rt>niú nǎi</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中午</span><span class=\"tr\">中午</span><rt>zhōng wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn bǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHamburger \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉堡</span><span class=\"tr\">漢堡</span><rt>hàn bǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě lè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCola \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可乐</span><span class=\"tr\">可樂</span><rt>kě lè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中午</span><span class=\"tr\">中午</span><rt>zhōng wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn bǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHamburger \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉堡</span><span class=\"tr\">漢堡</span><rt>hàn bǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě lè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCola \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可乐</span><span class=\"tr\">可樂</span><rt>kě lè</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(30, 'today-is-my-birthday', 'Today is my birthday', '今天是我的生日', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2130.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2130-r04kr8tdxjx7z1lu7o82cw6jlsno6cfz0da0sa2k42.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/today-is-my-birthday/', '今天是我的生日我送给自己的礼物是一双鞋那双鞋有点儿贵但是我喜欢很久了朋友们送给我一束花一瓶香水一个大蛋糕这些东西我都很喜欢我的爸爸妈妈给我发了一个红包里面有八百块钱我想用这些钱请朋友们吃饭然后去唱歌这就是我的生日', 'jīn tiān shì wǒ de shēng rì wǒ sòng gěi zì jǐ de lǐ wù shì yī shuāng xié nà shuāng xié yǒu diǎnr guì dàn shì wǒ xǐ huān hěn jiǔ le péng yǒu men sòng gěi wǒ yī shù huā yī píng xiāng shuǐ yī gè dà dàn gāo zhè xiē dōng xī wǒ dōu hěn xǐ huān wǒ de bàba māma gěi wǒ fā le yī gè hóng bāo lǐ miàn yǒu bā bǎi kuài qián wǒ xiǎng yòng zhè xiē qián qǐng péng yǒu men chī fàn rán hòu qù chàng gē zhè jiù shì wǒ de shēng rì', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBirthday (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生日</span><span class=\"tr\">生日</span><rt>shēng rì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend as gift (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zì jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noneself (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">自己</span><span class=\"tr\">自己</span><rt>zì jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGift (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">礼物</span><span class=\"tr\">禮物</span><rt>lǐ wù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) pair (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">双</span><span class=\"tr\">雙</span><rt>shuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshoe (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">鞋</span><span class=\"tr\">鞋</span><rt>xié</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) pair (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">双</span><span class=\"tr\">雙</span><rt>shuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshoe (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">鞋</span><span class=\"tr\">鞋</span><rt>xié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu diǎnr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nkind of \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有点儿</span><span class=\"tr\">有點兒</span><rt>yǒu diǎnr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexpensive (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">贵</span><span class=\"tr\">貴</span><rt>guì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLong (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">久</span><span class=\"tr\">久</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. plural) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">们</span><span class=\"tr\">們</span><rt>men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend as gift (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbundle \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">束</spa