\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ huān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlike (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喜欢</span><span class=\"tr\">喜歡</span><rt>xǐ huān</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">发</span><span class=\"tr\">發</span><rt>fā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hóng bāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nRed envelope (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">红包</span><span class=\"tr\">紅包</span><rt>hóng bāo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ miàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里面</span><span class=\"tr\">裏面</span><rt>lǐ miàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neight (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">八</span><span class=\"tr\">八</span><rt>bā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHundred (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">百</span><span class=\"tr\">百</span><rt>bǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">块</span><span class=\"tr\">塊</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmoney (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱</span><span class=\"tr\">錢</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuse (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">用</span><span class=\"tr\">用</span><rt>yòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthese \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这些</span><span class=\"tr\">這些</span><rt>zhè xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmoney (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱</span><span class=\"tr\">錢</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninvite (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. plural) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">们</span><span class=\"tr\">們</span><rt>men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī fàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave a meal \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃饭</span><span class=\"tr\">吃飯</span><rt>chī fàn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chàng gē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSing (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">唱歌</span><span class=\"tr\">唱歌</span><rt>chàng gē</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBirthday (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生日</span><span class=\"tr\">生日</span><rt>shēng rì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(31, 'lily-learns-chinese', 'Lily learns Chinese', '李丽学汉语', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2129.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2129-qyjigf6ctvcf3743fskjsmw9e0kgnbx65z8lbdmhqq.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/lily-learns-chinese/', '是一个法国人李丽是她的中文名字她在法国学习中文她有两个来自中国的中文老师一个是男老师一个是女老师他们一起上课一起说汉语也一起喝咖啡看电影变成了很好的朋友', 'shì yī gè Fǎguó rén Lǐ Lì shì tā de zhōng wén míng zì tā zài Fǎguó xué xí zhōng wén tā yǒu liǎng gè lái zì Zhōngguó de zhōng wén lǎo shī yī gè shì nán lǎo shī yī gè shì nǚ lǎo shī tā men yī qǐ shàng kè yī qǐ shuō hàn yǔ yě yī qǐ hē kā fēi kàn diàn yǐng biàn chéng le hěn hǎo de péng yǒu', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>Lily<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Fǎguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFrance \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">法国</span><span class=\"tr\">法國</span><rt>Fǎguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lǐ Lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLi Li \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李丽</span><span class=\"tr\">李麗</span><rt>Lǐ Lì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nher \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她的</span><span class=\"tr\">她的</span><rt>tā de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng wén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中文</span><span class=\"tr\">中文</span><rt>zhōng wén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nname (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">名字</span><span class=\"tr\">名字</span><rt>míng zì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Fǎguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFrance \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">法国</span><span class=\"tr\">法國</span><rt>Fǎguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng wén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中文</span><span class=\"tr\">中文</span><rt>zhōng wén</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来自</sp