\"si\">女</span><span class=\"tr\">女</span><rt>nǚ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAttend class \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上课</span><span class=\"tr\">上課</span><rt>shàng kè</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kā fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncoffee (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tr\">咖啡</span><rt>kā fēi</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwatch (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn yǐng:&lt;