(32, 'do-you-know', 'Do you know?', '你知道吗？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2128.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2128-qxc1axr6r4miba2mhnc32q0i0uabmz97pq5pibmvki.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/do-you-know/', '你知道吗我家旁边有一所大学这所大学有三万个学生两千多名老师是这个城市最好的学校也因为我家在大学旁边所以吃东西买东西都很方便周围有很多商店和饭馆云南菜四川菜广东菜你想吃什么就有什么这个大学后面有一座山很有名很多人来这儿旅游中国人外国人都喜欢来这里爬山因为我很喜欢爬山也喜欢和不同的人聊天所以我成为了一名导游每天都很快乐', 'nǐ zhī dào ma wǒ jiā páng biān yǒu yī suǒ dà xué zhè suǒ dà xué yǒu sān wàn gè xué shēng liǎng qiān duō míng lǎo shī shì zhè gè chéng shì zuì hǎo de xué xiào yě yīn wèi wǒ jiā zài dà xué páng biān suǒ yǐ chī dōngxi mǎi dōngxi dōu hěn fāng biàn zhōu wéi yǒu hěn duō shāng diàn hé fàn guǎn Yúnnán cài Sìchuān cài Guǎngdōng cài nǐ xiǎng chī shén me jiù yǒu shén me zhè gè dà xué hòu miàn yǒu yī zuò shān hěn yǒu míng hěn duō rén lái zhèr lǚ yóu Zhōngguó rén wài guó rén dōu xǐ huān lái zhè lǐ pá shān yīn wèi wǒ hěn xǐ huān pá shān yě xǐ huān hé bù tóng de rén liáo tiān suǒ yǐ wǒ chéng wéi le yī míng dǎo yóu měi tiān dōu hěn kuài lè', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nKnow (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"páng biān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbeside (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旁边</span><span class=\"tr\">旁邊</span><rt>páng biān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">所</span><span class=\"tr\">所</span><rt>suǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nUniversity \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大学</span><span class=\"tr\">大學</span><rt>dà xué</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">所</span><span class=\"tr\">所</span><rt>suǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nUniversity \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大学</span><span class=\"tr\">大學</span><rt>dà xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTen thousand (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">万</span><span class=\"tr\">萬</span><rt>wàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr r