(35, 'hometown', 'Hometown', '家乡', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2125.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2125-qnp9kxfyt0q74aztngxpka5u6sqck3skowq8u49kjs.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/hometown/', '我有一个朋友他的家乡不是这个城市他经常说他的家乡和这个城市很不一样我以为他会不开心因为家人都不在这儿但是他告诉我无论在哪儿只要有好邻居好朋友就像在家一样他也经常说家乡话我觉得太有趣了我一定要学几句', 'wǒ yǒu yī gè péng yǒu tā de jiā xiāng bù shì zhè gè chéng shì tā jīng cháng shuō tā de jiā xiāng hé zhè gè chéng shì hěn bù yī yàng wǒ yǐ wéi tā huì bù kāi xīn yīn wèi jiā rén dōu bù zài zhè ér dàn shì tā gào sù wǒ wú lùn zài nǎ ér zhǐ yào yǒu hǎo lín jū hǎo péng yǒu jiù xiàng zài jiā yī yàng tā yě jīng cháng shuō jiā xiāng huà wǒ jué de tài yǒu qù le wǒ yī dìng yào xué jǐ jù', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhis\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他的</span><span class=\"tr\">他的</span><rt>tā de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā xiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhometown (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家乡</span><span class=\"tr\">家鄉</span><rt>jiā xiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCity (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">城市</span><span class=\"tr\">城市</span><rt>chéng shì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhis\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他的</span><span class=\"tr\">他的</span><rt>tā de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā xiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhometown (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家乡</span><span class=\"tr\">家鄉</span><rt>jiā xiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCity (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">城市</span><span class=\"tr\">城市</span><rt>chéng shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSame (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一样</span><span class=\"tr\">一樣</span><rt>yī yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐ wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthought (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">以为</span><span class=\"tr\">以爲</span><rt>yǐ wéi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi xīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhappy (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开心</span><span class=\"tr\">開心</span><rt>kāi xīn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn wèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecause (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因爲</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfamily\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家人</span><span class=\"tr\">家人</span><rt>jiā rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这儿</span><span class=\"tr\">這兒</span><rt>zhè ér</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gào sù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTell (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">告诉</span><span class=\"tr\">告訴</span><rt>gào sù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wú lùn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nregardless of, no matter what, how, etc. (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">无论</span><span class=\"tr\">無論</span><rt>wú lùn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǎ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哪儿</span><span class=\"tr\">哪兒</span><rt>nǎ ér</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nif only (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只要</span><span class=\"tr\">只要</span><rt>zhǐ yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lín jū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNeighbor (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">邻居</span><span class=\"tr\">鄰居</span><rt>lín jū</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n像……一样 like (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">像</span><span class=\"tr\">像</span><rt>xiàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n像……一样 like (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一样</span><span class=\"tr\">一樣</span><rt>yī yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā xiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhometown (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家乡</span><span class=\"tr\">家鄉</span><rt>jiā xiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntalk, dialect, language\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">话</span><span class=\"tr\">話</span><rt>huà</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jué de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto think, to feel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">觉得</span><span class=\"tr\">覺得</span><rt>jué de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"tr\">太</span><rt>tài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninteresting (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有趣</span><span class=\"tr\">有趣</span><rt>yǒu qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī dìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmust (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一定</span><span class=\"tr\">一定</span><rt>yī dìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSeveral (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsentence\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">句</span><span class=\"tr\">句</span><rt>jù</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(36, 'i-have-been-in-china-for-three-years', 'I have been in China for three years', '我来中国三年了', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2124.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2124-qmeqzjme9sky54vmya4xkl7939prsdzxvyncrs07ag.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/i-have-been-in-china-for-three-years/', '我来中国学习和工作三年了五年前我第一次来中国旅游爱上了这里吃的东西回国后我开始在网上学习汉语一开始自己学习后来又在网上找了一位汉语老师帮助我我考过了级考试以后就想来中国继续学习到了中国以后我先在北京学习汉语后来找到了上海的工作就来上海生活了三年了我越来越了解中国文化也交了很多中国朋友我想明年去广东工作广东是个暖和的地方还有很多好吃的东西我应该会很快乐', 'wǒ lái zhōng guó xué xí hé gōng zuò sān nián le wǔ nián qián wǒ dì yī cì lái Zhōngguó lǚ yóu ài shàng le zhè lǐ chī de dōngxi huí guó hòu wǒ kāi shǐ zài wǎng shàng xué xí hàn yǔ yī kāi shǐ zì jǐ xué xí hòu lái yòu zài wǎng shàng zhǎo le yī wèi hàn yǔ lǎo shī bāng zhù wǒ wǒ kǎo guò le jí kǎo shì yǐ hòu jiù xiǎng lái Zhōngguó jì xù xué xí dào le Zhōngguó yǐ hòu wǒ xiān zài Běijīng xué xí hàn yǔ hòu lái zhǎo dào le Shànghǎi de gōng zuò jiù lái Shànghǎi shēng huó le sān nián le wǒ yuè lái yuè liǎo jiě Zhōngguó wén huà yě jiāo le hěn duō Zhōngguó péng yǒu wǒ xiǎng míng nián qù Guǎngdōng gōng zuò Guǎngdōng shì gè nuǎnhuo de dì fāng hái yǒu hěn duō hǎo chī de dōngxi wǒ yīng gāi huì hěn kuài lè', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>zhōng guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfive (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbefore\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFirst (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">第一</span><span class=\"tr\">第一</span><rt>dì yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;