(37, 'dad-cried', 'Dad cried', '爸爸哭了', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2123.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2123-qkevqyns7w59sirrj937fsgeh5sgh3cckvrmouh42w.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/dad-cried/', '爸爸的工作很忙每天我还没起床他就走了晚上我要睡觉了他才回家昨天我生日我就打电话问爸爸他一个小时可以赚多少钱他有点儿不高兴我说爸爸我现在有二十块钱想买你一个小时可以吗今天我想和你一起吃生日蛋糕然后爸爸在电话里哭了', 'bàba de gōng zuò hěn máng měi tiān wǒ hái méi qǐ chuáng tā jiù zǒu le wǎn shàng wǒ yào shuì jiào le tā cái huí jiā zuó tiān wǒ shēng rì wǒ jiù dǎ diàn huà wèn bàba tā yī gè xiǎo shí kě yǐ zhuàn duō shǎo qián tā yǒu diǎn ér bù gāo xìng wǒ shuō bàba wǒ xiàn zài yǒu èr shí kuài qián xiǎng mǎi nǐ yī gè xiǎo shí kě yǐ ma jīn tiān wǒ xiǎng hé nǐ yī qǐ chī shēng rì dàn gāo rán hòu bàba zài diàn huà lǐ kū le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"máng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbusy (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">忙</span><span class=\"tr\">忙</span><rt>máng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEvery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstill (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">还</span><span class=\"tr\">還</span><rt>hái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ chuáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nget up (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">起床</span><span class=\"tr\">起床</span><rt>qǐ chuáng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo, leave (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">走</span><span class=\"tr\">走</span><rt>zǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>；<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe going to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuì jiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsleep (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">睡觉</span><span class=\"tr\">睡覺</span><rt>shuì jiào</rt></ruby></abbr><a