SK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHour (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小时</span><span class=\"tr\">小時</span><rt>xiǎo shí</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBirthday (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生日</span><span class=\"tr\">生日</span><rt>shēng rì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn gāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">蛋糕</span><span class=\"tr\">蛋糕</span><rt>dàn gāo</rt></ruby></abbr>。”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTelephone\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">电话</span><span class=\"tr\">電話</span><rt>diàn huà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裏</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncry (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哭</span><span class=\"tr\">哭</span><rt>kū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
