(42, 'drunk-story', 'Drunk', '喝醉了', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2118.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2118-qd457z6hw7r4905z68g2ajintldpro7ojs54v7krpu.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/drunk-story/', '一天和朋友吃完饭的爸爸回家后他看见孩子正在学习写字非常高兴他问孩子你在学什么字孩子说这个醉是什么意思爸爸说你看这里有两个杯子但是如果我说这里有四个杯子我就喝醉了孩子说爸爸这里只有一个杯子', 'yī tiān hé péng yǒu chī wán fàn de bàba huí jiā hòu tā kàn jiàn hái zi zhèng zài xué xí xiě zì fēi cháng gāo xìng tā wèn hái zi nǐ zài xué shén me zì hái zi shuō zhè gè zuì shì shén me yì sī bàba shuō nǐ kàn zhè lǐ yǒu liǎng gè bēi zi dàn shì rú guǒ wǒ shuō zhè lǐ yǒu sì gè bēi zi wǒ jiù hē zuì le hái zi shuō bàba zhè lǐ zhǐ yǒu yī gè bēi zi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFinish (complement) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完</span><span class=\"tr\">完</span><rt>wán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeal\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">饭</span><span class=\"