(43, 'counting-stars', 'Counting stars', '数星星', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2117.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2117-qbpmdusnp152h6sheyfa5pupc6pirwlwt62y3kn2he.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/counting-stars/', '这天晚上姐姐一直看着天妹妹觉得很奇怪问姐姐你在做什么姐姐回答说今天晚上有很多星星我在数星星妹妹说晚上太黑了你为什么不明天早上再数呢白天数就容易多了', 'zhè tiān wǎn shàng jiějie yī zhí kàn zhe tiān mèimei jué de hěn qí guài wèn jiějie nǐ zài zuò shén me jiějie huí dá shuō jīn tiān wǎn shàng yǒu hěn duō xīngxing wǒ zài shǔ xīngxing mèimei shuō wǎn shàng tài hēi le nǐ wèi shén me bù míng tiān zǎo shàng zài shǔ ne bái tiān shǔ jiù róng yì duō le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiějie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姐姐</span><span class=\"tr\">姐姐</span><rt>jiějie</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī zhí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nall the time (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一直</span><span class=\"tr\">一直</span><rt>yī zhí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLook (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhe:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsky\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mèimei:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妹妹</span><span class=\"tr\">妹妹</span><rt>mèimei</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jué de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto think, to feel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">觉得</span><span class=\"tr\">覺得</span><rt>jué de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qí guài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstrange (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">奇怪</span><span class=\"tr\">奇怪</span><rt>qí guài</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nask (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">问</span><span class=\"tr\">問</span><rt>wèn</rt></ruby></abbr>：“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiějie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姐姐</span><span class=\"tr\">姐姐</span><rt>jiějie</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？”</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiějie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姐姐</span><span class=\"tr\">姐姐</span><rt>jiějie</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí dá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nReply (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回答</span><span class=\"tr\">回答</span><rt>huí dá</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nToday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīngxing:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nStar\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星星</span><span class=\"tr\">星星</span><rt>xīngxing</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncount (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">数</span><span class=\"tr\">數</span><rt>shǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīngxing:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nStar\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星星</span><span class=\"tr\">星星</span><rt>xīngxing</rt></ruby></abbr>。”</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mèimei:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妹妹</span><span class=\"tr\">妹妹</span><rt>mèimei</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"tr\">太</span><rt>tài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndark (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">黑</span><span class=\"tr\">黑</span><rt>hēi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèi shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhy (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">为什么</span><span class=\"tr\">爲什麽</span><rt>wèi shén me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAgain (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">再</span><span class=\"tr\">再</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncount (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">数</span><span class=\"tr\">數</span><rt>shǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bái tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaytime\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">白天</span><span class=\"tr\">白天</span><rt>bái tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncount (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">数</span><span class=\"tr\">數</span><rt>shǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"róng yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neasy (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">容易</span><span class=\"tr\">容易</span><rt>róng yì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。”</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53'),
(44, 'eat-cake', 'Eat cake', '吃蛋糕', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2116.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2116-qa5vmex3t9bdykf4dbxhu3k38tfmpz5llc2384plci.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/eat-cake/', '妈妈买了两块蛋糕对哥哥和妹妹说你们两个人每人吃一块蛋糕哥哥不高兴说我是哥哥我更高年纪更大我要吃两块妈妈说好的然后妈妈用刀切蛋糕哥哥的蛋糕就从一块变成了两块妈妈说现在你有两块蛋糕了吃吧', 'māma mǎi le liǎng kuài dàn gāo duì gēge hé mèimei shuō nǐ men liǎng gè rén měi rén chī yī kuài dàn gāo gēge bù gāo xìng shuō wǒ shì gēge wǒ gèng gāo nián jì gèng dà wǒ yào chī liǎng kuài māma shuō hǎo de rán hòu māma yòng dāo qiē dàn gāo gēge de dàn gāo jiù cóng yī kuài biàn chéng le liǎng kuài māma shuō xiàn zài nǐ yǒu liǎng kuài dàn gāo le chī ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">块</span><span class=\"tr\">塊</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn gāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">蛋糕</span><span class=\"tr\">蛋糕</span><rt>dàn gāo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gēge</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mèimei:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妹妹</span><span class=\"tr\">妹妹</span><rt>mèimei</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neach, every (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">块</span><span class=\"tr\">塊</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn gāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">蛋糕</span><span class=\"tr\">蛋糕</span><rt>dàn gāo</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gēge</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo xìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHappy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高兴</span><span class=\"tr\">高興</span><rt>gāo xìng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gēge</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmore (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更</span><span class=\"tr\">更</span><rt>gèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhigh (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高</span><span class=\"tr\">高</span><rt>gāo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián jì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年纪</span><span class=\"tr\">年紀</span><rt>nián jì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng:&lt;br /&gt