(45, 'the-elder-brother-and-the-younger-brother', 'The elder brother and the younger brother', '哥哥和弟弟', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2115.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2115-q8eyrarxh5w236q26busq78nr9mzc8eevzff9pmzwy.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/the-elder-brother-and-the-younger-brother/', '哥哥和弟弟是双胞胎长得一模一样他们的爸爸妈妈经常都不知道谁是哥哥谁是弟弟这一天爸爸妈妈和孩子们去饭馆吃饭服务员问谁是哥哥谁是弟弟他们想了一下说哥哥旁边的是弟弟弟弟旁边的是哥哥', 'gēge hé dìdi shì shuāng bāo tāi zhǎng de yī mú yī yàng tā men de bàba māma jīng cháng dōu bù zhī dào shéi shì gēge shéi shì dìdi zhè yī tiān bàba māma hé hái zi men qù fàn guǎn chī fàn fú wù yuán wèn shéi shì gēge shéi shì dìdi tā men xiǎng le yī xià shuō gēge páng biān de shì dìdi dìdi páng biān de shì gēge', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gēge</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dìdi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">弟弟</span><span class=\"tr\">弟弟</span><rt>dìdi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuāng bāo tāi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwin (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">双胞胎</span><span class=\"tr\">雙胞胎</span><rt>shuāng bāo tāi</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngrow, develop (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">长</span><span class=\"tr\">長</span><rt>zhǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle, used after a verb or an adjective to introduce a complement of result or degree) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">得</span><span class=\"tr\">得</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī mú yī yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexactly the same\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一模一样</span><span class=\"tr\">一模一樣</span><rt>yī mú yī yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nKnow (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWho (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谁</span><span class=\"tr\">誰</span><rt>shéi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēg