(46, 'bird-nest-and-hair', 'Bird nest and hair', '鸟窝和头发', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2114.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2114-q6u8f8m8e6ztu2iu1ne9u8p1yeddbnz8loanbuhu1e.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/bird-nest-and-hair/', '哥哥看到树上有一个鸟窝就告诉弟弟你知道那是什么吗那个东西叫鸟窝就是鸟的家鸟窝里有鸟也有蛋弟弟高兴地说真的吗我要看你的头发你的头上也有一个鸟窝里面也有鸟和蛋吗', 'gēge kàn dào shù shàng yǒu yī gè niǎo wō jiù gào sù dìdi nǐ zhī dào nà shì shén me ma nà gè dōngxi jiào niǎo wō jiù shì niǎo de jiā niǎo wō lǐ yǒu niǎo yě yǒu dàn dìdi gāo xìng de shuō zhēn de ma wǒ yào kàn nǐ de tóu fà nǐ de tóu shàng yě yǒu yī gè niǎo wō lǐ miàn yě yǒu niǎo hé dàn ma', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gēge</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlook, see (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(complement) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTree (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">树</span><span class=\"tr\">樹</span><rt>shù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\non, in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī