(47, 'see-you-there', 'See you there', '不见不散', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2113.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2113-q5ms7q33awrymu51qorfq97zfinrhj62hjygvs5102.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/see-you-there/', '现在几点差五分两点怎么了我两点半要去咖啡店见朋友你见谁我的小学同学林林你见过她的我知道了那个很爱笑的姑娘你们晚上一起吃饭吗还不知道我们只打算一起喝喝咖啡聊聊天你们喝完来旁边的公园吧下午我会和几个朋友去公园晒太阳然后一起玩飞盘你们也来吧听起来不错你们几个人几点开始玩我们有五个人打算三点一刻在公园门口见面太好了下午我们也来不见不散', 'xiàn zài jǐ diǎn chà wǔ fēn liǎng diǎn zěn me le wǒ liǎng diǎn bàn yào qù kā fēi diàn jiàn péng yǒu nǐ jiàn shéi wǒ de xiǎo xué tóng xué Lín Lín nǐ jiàn guò tā de wǒ zhī dào le nà gè hěn ài xiào de gū niáng nǐ men wǎn shàng yī qǐ chī fàn ma hái bù zhī dào wǒ men zhǐ dǎ suàn yī qǐ hē hē kā fēi liáo liáo tiān nǐ men hē wán lái páng biān de gōng yuán ba xià wǔ wǒ huì hé jǐ gè péng yǒu qù gōng yuán shài tài yáng rán hòu yī qǐ wán fēi pán nǐ men yě lái ba tīng qǐ lái bù cuò nǐ men jǐ gè rén jǐ diǎn kāi shǐ wán wǒ men yǒu wǔ gè rén dǎ suàn sān diǎn yī kè zài gōng yuán mén kǒu jiàn miàn tài hǎo le xià wǔ wǒ men yě lái bù jiàn bù sàn', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshort of (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">差</span><span class=\"tr\">差</span><rt>chà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfive (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMinute (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">分</span><span class=\"tr\">分</span><rt>fēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽</span><rt>zěn me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHalf (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">半</span><span class=\"tr\">半</span><rt>bàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwill (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kā fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncoffee (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tr\">咖啡</span><rt>kā fēi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshop\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">店</span><span class=\"tr\">店</span><rt>diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWho (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谁</span><span class=\"tr\">誰</span><rt>shéi</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nprimary school\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小学</span><span class=\"tr\">小學</span><rt>xiǎo xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóng xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclassmate (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">同学</span><span class=\"tr\">同學</span><rt>tóng xué</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lín Lín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLin Lin\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">林林</span><span class=\"tr\">林林</span><rt>Lín Lín</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSee\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nKnow (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLove (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爱</span><span class=\"tr\">愛</span><rt>ài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlaugh (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">笑</span><span class=\"tr\">笑</span><rt>xiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gū niáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngirl (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姑娘</span><span class=\"tr\">姑娘</span><rt>gū niáng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī fàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHave a meal\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃饭</span><span class=\"tr\">吃飯</span><rt>chī fàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstill (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">还</span><span class=\"tr\">還</span><rt>hái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nKnow (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOnly (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ suàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打算</span><span class=\"tr\">打算</span><rt>dǎ suàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kā fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncoffee (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">咖啡</span><span class=\"tr\">咖啡</span><rt>kā fēi</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liáo liáo tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nchat\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">聊聊天</span><span class=\"tr\">聊聊天</span><rt>liáo liáo tiān</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>B：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFinish (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完</span><span class=\"tr\">完</span><rt>wán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncome to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"páng biān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbeside (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旁边</span><span class=\"tr\">旁邊</span><rt>páng biān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngarden (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公园</span><span class=\"tr\">公園</span><rt>gōng yuán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafternoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下午</span><span class=\"tr\">下午</span><rt>xià wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSeveral (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngarden (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公园</span><span class=\"tr\">公園</span><rt>gōng yuán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbask (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晒</span><span class=\"tr\">曬</span><rt>shài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tài yáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsun (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">太阳</span><span class=\"tr\">太陽</span><rt>tài yáng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class