(48, 'get-married', 'Get married', '结婚', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2112.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2112-q44pbn2opxh2auzpx87ld8mygfwilzc1xqyiyufu4y.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/get-married/', '下个月八号我结婚你来南湖酒店参加我的婚礼吧恭喜恭喜没想到你那么快就要结婚了八号是星期几八号应该是星期六星期六没问题我休息到时候我会准备一个大红包送给你真为你开心谢谢谢谢你呢你准备什么时候结婚我和你分手以后我还没有别的女朋友呢可能有点儿不想再认识其他女孩子了你别这样我们都分手三年了开始新生活吧好吗没事儿你过得幸福就好知道你幸福我就很开心你也要幸福啊', 'xià gè yuè bā hào wǒ jié hūn nǐ lái nán hú jiǔ diàn cān jiā wǒ de hūn lǐ ba gōng xǐ gōng xǐ méi xiǎng dào nǐ nà me kuài jiù yào jié hūn le bā hào shì xīng qī jǐ bā hào yīng gāi shì xīng qī liù xīng qī liù méi wèn tí wǒ xiū xī dào shí hòu wǒ huì zhǔn bèi yī gè dà hóng bāo sòng gěi nǐ zhēn wèi nǐ kāi xīn xiè xie xiè xie nǐ ne nǐ zhǔn bèi shén me shí hòu jié hūn wǒ hé nǐ fēn shǒu yǐ hòu wǒ hái méi yǒu bié de nǚ péng yǒu ne kě néng yǒu diǎnr bù xiǎng zài rèn shí qí tā nǚ hái zi le nǐ bié zhè yàng wǒ men dōu fēn shǒu sān nián le kāi shǐ xīn shēng huó ba hǎo ma méi shìr nǐ guò de xìng fú jiù hǎo zhī dào nǐ xìng fú wǒ jiù hěn kāi xīn nǐ yě yào xìng fú a', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>A：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnext (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEight (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">八</span><span class=\"tr\">八</span><rt>bā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\