(49, 'cut-cake', 'Cut cake', '切蛋糕', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2111.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2111-q345ta7mrxgb7zncgtflkgfjn57uzuxt3n5ylb5c94.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/cut-cake/', '小龙今年岁他的妹妹今年岁今天是妈妈的生日爸爸买了一个大蛋糕吃蛋糕的时候妈妈把刀给了小龙说今天你来切蛋糕你和妹妹一人吃一块小龙非常高兴这是他第一次切蛋糕妈妈又说不过你要像个绅士一样小龙问绅士绅士会怎么做妈妈回答说绅士会把大的那一块给别人自己吃小的那一块小龙想了想对妹妹说妹妹今天你来切蛋糕吧你要像个绅士一样', 'Xiǎolóng jīn nián suì tā de mèi mei jīn nián suì jīn tiān shì mā ma de shēng rì bà ba mǎi le yī gè dà dàn gāo chī dàn gāo de shí hòu mā ma bǎ dāo gěi le Xiǎolóng shuō jīn tiān nǐ lái qiē dàn gāo nǐ hé mèi mei yī rén chī yī kuài Xiǎolóng fēi cháng gāo xìng zhè shì tā dì yī cì qiē dàn gāo mā ma yòu shuō bù guò nǐ yào xiàng gè shēn shì yī yàng Xiǎolóng wèn shēn shì shēn shì huì zěn me zuò mā ma huí dá shuō shēn shì huì bǎ dà de nà yī kuài gěi bié rén zì jǐ chī xiǎo de nà yī kuài Xiǎolóng xiǎng le xiǎng duì mèi mei shuō mèi mei jīn tiān nǐ lái qiē dàn gāo ba nǐ yào xiàng gè shēn shì yī yàng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎolóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaolong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小龙</span><span class=\"tr\">小龍</span><rt>Xiǎolóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThis year\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今年</span><span class=\"tr\">今年</span><rt>jīn nián</rt></ruby></abbr>7<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</sp