(50, 'perfect-son-2', 'Perfect son', '完美儿子', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/2110.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/2110-q1idu26khrfwhnwbjd0gvgty5pdlksm3twe0g1bh3m.jpg', '', 'HSK2', 'https://mandarinbean.com/perfect-son-2/', '两个男人在河边钓鱼他们一边钓鱼一边聊天年纪大的男人说我的儿子真让我担心喝酒抽烟吃不健康的东西每天都很晚才回家还经常和我吵架年轻一些的男人说我的儿子就很完美不喝酒不抽烟吃非常健康的东西也不会很晚回家更不会和我吵架年纪大的男人说啊那你的儿子真的很完美他今年多少岁了年轻男人回答说六个月了', 'liǎng gè nán rén zài hé biān diào yú tā men yī biān diào yú yī biān liáo tiān nián jì dà de nán rén shuō wǒ de ér zi zhēn ràng wǒ dān xīn hē jiǔ chōu yān chī bù jiàn kāng de dōng xi měi tiān dōu hěn wǎn cái huí jiā hái jīng cháng hé wǒ chǎo jià nián qīng yī xiē de nán rén shuō wǒ de ér zi jiù hěn wán měi bù hē jiǔ bù chōu yān chī fēi cháng jiàn kāng de dōng xi yě bù huì hěn wǎn huí jiā gèng bù huì hé wǒ chǎo jià nián jì dà de nán rén shuō a nà nǐ de ér zi zhēn de hěn wán měi tā jīn nián duō shǎo suì le nián qīng nán rén huí dá shuō liù gè yuè le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nán rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nman (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">男人</span><span class=\"tr\">男人</span><rt>nán rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nriver (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">河</span><span class=\"tr\">河</