el=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōng xi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōng xi</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEvery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlate\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚</span><span class=\"tr\">晚</span><rt>wǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">才</span><span class=\"tr\">才</span><rt>cái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nget back (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">还</span><span class=\"tr\">還</span><rt>hái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chǎo jià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquarrel (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吵架</span><span class=\"tr\">吵架</span><rt>chǎo jià</rt></ruby></abbr>。”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián qīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyoung (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年轻</span><span class=\"tr\">年輕</span><rt>nián qīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nán rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nman (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">男人</span><span class=\"tr\">男人</span><rt>nán rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPerfect (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完美</span><span class=\"tr\">完美</span><rt>wán měi</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nliquor\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">酒</span><span class=\"tr\">酒</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chōu yān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsmoke (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">抽烟</span><span class=\"tr\">抽烟</span><rt>chōu yān</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nVery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">非常</span><span class=\"tr\">非常</span><rt>fēi cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn kāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhealthy (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">健康</span><span class=\"tr\">健康</span><rt>jiàn kāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōng xi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōng xi</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWon\'t\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不会</span><span class=\"tr\">不會</span><rt>bù huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlate\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚</span><span class=\"tr\">晚</span><rt>wǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nget back (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEven (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更</span><span class=\"tr\">更</span><rt>gèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWon\'t\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不会</span><span class=\"tr\">不會</span><rt>bù huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chǎo jià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquarrel (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吵架</span><span class=\"tr\">吵架</span><rt>chǎo jià</rt></ruby></abbr>。”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián jì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年纪</span><span class=\"tr\">年紀</span><rt>nián jì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nán rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nman (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">男人</span><span class=\"tr\">男人</span><rt>nán rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyour, yours\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你的</span><span class=\"tr\">你的</span><rt>nǐ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">儿子</span><span class=\"tr\">兒子</span><rt>ér zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真的</span><span class=\"tr\">真的</span><rt>zhēn de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPerfect (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完美</span><span class=\"tr\">完美</span><rt>wán měi</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThis year\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今年</span><span class=\"tr\">今年</span><rt>jīn nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō shǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHow many (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多少</span><span class=\"tr\">多少</span><rt>duō shǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>？”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián qīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyoung (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年轻</span><span class=\"tr\">年輕</span><rt>nián qīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nán rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nman (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">男人</span><span class=\"tr\">男人</span><rt>nán rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí dá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nReply (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回答</span><span class=\"tr\">回答</span><rt>huí dá</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsix (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">六</span><span class=\"tr\">六</span><rt>liù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。”</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(52, 'a-letter-language-class', 'A Letter — Language Class', '一封信 —— 语言课', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3177.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3177-rep9wzxb1w0dbnhzv4o8aaulod512f0yo5h5oatyac.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/a-letter-language-class/', '亲爱的王贝好久不见你最近怎么样这个春天我很忙除了工作以外还要上汉语课我们的汉语课有点儿难因为这个汉语老师只说汉语不说英语开始我们以为她不会说英语后来发现她的英语非常好但是她不说不过上了两个月的汉语课我发现我的汉语进步非常快尤其是听力和口语现在我开始喜欢这个汉语老师了因为她我们不得不每天练习汉语听说你开始学法语了你的法语怎么样了老师教好吗你有多少个同学你们有法语作业吗一个星期上几节课贵不贵我的问题太多了请别笑我期待你的回信祝一切顺利你的朋友林达年月日', 'qīn ài de Wáng Bèi hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn nǐ zuì jìn zěn me yàng zhè gè chūn tiān wǒ hěn máng chú le gōng zuò yǐ wài hái yào shàng Hànyǔ kè wǒ men de Hànyǔ kè yǒu diǎnr nán yīn wèi zhè gè Hànyǔ lǎo shī zhǐ shuō Hànyǔ bù shuō yīng yǔ kāi shǐ wǒ men yǐ wéi tā bù huì shuō yīng yǔ hòu lái fā xiàn tā de yīng yǔ fēi cháng hǎo dàn shì tā bù shuō bù guò shàng le liǎng gè yuè de Hànyǔ kè wǒ fā xiàn wǒ de Hànyǔ jìn bù fēi cháng kuài yóu qí shì tīng lì hé kǒu yǔ xiàn zài wǒ kāi shǐ xǐ huān zhè gè Hànyǔ lǎo shī le yīn wèi tā wǒ men bù dé bù měi tiān liàn xí Hànyǔ tīng shuō nǐ kāi shǐ xué Fǎyǔ le nǐ de Fǎyǔ zěn me yàng le lǎo shī jiāo hǎo ma nǐ yǒu duō shǎo gè tóng xué nǐ men yǒu Fǎyǔ zuò yè ma yī gè xīng qī shàng jǐ jié kè guì bù guì wǒ de wèn tí tài duō le qǐng bié xiào wǒ qī dài nǐ de huí xìn zhù yī qiè shùn lì nǐ de péng yǒu Lín Dá nián yuè rì', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qīn ài de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDear \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">亲爱的</span><span class=\"tr\">親愛的</span><rt>qīn ài de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wáng Bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWang Bei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">王贝</span><span class=\"tr\">王貝</span><rt>Wáng Bèi</rt></ruby></abbr>：</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"too