(53, 'diary-my-day', 'Diary — My Day', '日记 —— 我的一天', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3176.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3176-rd73c813ov2a1d3cvbacxrp1t4efl2f1vl3mv5vhsk.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/diary-my-day/', '年月日星期二晴天今天天气不错不冷也不热早上我七点起床吃了早饭后去学校上课我们学习了中文数学和英语老师们讲很认真但是我有点儿想睡觉好困中午我和朋友一起在学校食堂吃饭食堂的菜虽然便宜但是味道一般我们聊了很多有趣的事情大家都很开心下午又上了三节课放学后我去图书馆借书我借了一本关于动物的书觉得很有意思晚上回家我帮妈妈做晚饭然后写作业今天有点儿忙时间不够了洗澡后准备早点睡觉明天再看那部新电影吧', 'nián yuè rì xīng qī èr qíng tiān jīn tiān tiān qì bù cuò bù lěng yě bù rè zǎo shàng wǒ qī diǎn qǐ chuáng chī le zǎo fàn hòu qù xué xiào shàng kè wǒ men xué xí le zhōng wén shù xué hé yīng yǔ lǎo shī men jiǎng hěn rèn zhēn dàn shì wǒ yǒu diǎnr xiǎng shuì jiào hǎo kùn zhōng wǔ wǒ hé péng yǒu yī qǐ zài xué xiào shí táng chī fàn shí táng de cài suī rán piányi dàn shì wèi dào yī bān wǒ men liáo le hěn duō yǒu qù de shì qíng dà jiā dōu hěn kāi xīn xià wǔ yòu shàng le sān jié kè fàng xué hòu wǒ qù tú shū guǎn jiè shū wǒ jiè le yī běn guān yú dòng wù de shū jué de hěn yǒu yì sī wǎn shàng huí jiā wǒ bāng mā mā zuò wǎn fàn rán hòu xiě zuò yè jīn tiān yǒu diǎnr máng shí jiān bù gòu le xǐ zǎo hòu zhǔn bèi zǎo diǎn shuì jiào míng tiān zài kàn nà bù xīn diàn yǐng ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>2025 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr>5 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>20 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日</span><span class=\"tr\">日</span><rt>rì</rt></ruby></abbr>| <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīng qī èr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTuesday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星期二</span><span class=\"tr\">星期二</span><rt>xīng qī èr</rt></ruby></abbr>| <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qíng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunny \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晴天</span><span class=\"tr\">晴天</span><rt>qíng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nToday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天气</span><span class=\"tr\">天氣</span><rt>tiān qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù cuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot bad \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不错</span><span class=\"tr\">不錯</span><rt>bù cuò</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lěng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncold (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">冷</span><span class=\"tr\">冷</span><rt>lěng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhot (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">热</span><span class=\"tr\">熱</span><rt>rè</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nseven (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">七</span><span class=\"tr\">七</span><rt>q