(54, 'mom-is-missing', 'Mom is missing', '妈妈不见了', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3175.mp3', 'N/A', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/mom-is-missing/', '春节到了女儿和女婿开车带妈妈从广东回湖北过年路上他们在加油站停车加油妈妈想上厕所没有告诉他们就下车了女儿在车里睡觉女婿加完油没有看妈妈在不在车上就开车走了车开了一公里女婿问妈妈你想吃东西吗可是没有人说话这时候他们才发现妈妈不在车里两个人都很着急可是手机没有信号他们不知道怎么办幸好路上有工作人员发现了他们工作人员开车找到妈妈安全地把妈妈送回女儿女婿那里一家人终于又在一起了', 'chūn jié dào le nǚ ér hé nǚ xù kāi chē dài māma cóng Guǎngdōng huí Húběi guò nián lù shàng tā men zài jiā yóu zhàn tíng chē jiā yóu māma xiǎng shàng cè suǒ méi yǒu gào sù tā men jiù xià chē le nǚ ér zài chē lǐ shuì jiào nǚ xù jiā wán yóu méi yǒu kàn māma zài bù zài chē shàng jiù kāi chē zǒu le chē kāi le yī gōng lǐ nǚ xù wèn māma nǐ xiǎng chī dōng xī ma kě shì méi yǒu rén shuō huà zhè shí hòu tā men cái fā xiàn māma bù zài chē lǐ liǎng gè rén dōu hěn zháo jí kě shì shǒu jī méi yǒu xìn hào tā men bù zhī dào zěn me bàn xìng hǎo lù shàng yǒu gōng zuò rén yuán fā xiàn le tā men gōng zuò rén yuán kāi chē zhǎo dào māma ān quán de bǎ māma sòng huí nǚ ér nǚ xù nà lǐ yī jiā rén zhōng yú yòu zài yī qǐ le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chūn jié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSpring Festival \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">春节</span><span class=\"tr\">春節</span><rt>chūn jié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaughter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女儿</span><span class=\"tr\">女兒</span><rt>nǚ ér</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ xù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nson in law \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女婿</span><span class=\"tr\">女婿</span><rt>nǚ xù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi chē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrive \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开车</span><span class=\"tr\">開車</span><rt>kāi chē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Guǎngdōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGuangdong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">广东</span><span class=\"tr\">廣東</span><rt>Guǎngdōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Húběi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHubei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">湖北</span><span class=\"tr\">湖北</span><rt>Húběi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncelebrate the New Year \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过年</span><span class=\"tr\">過年</span><rt>guò nián</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nroad (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">路</span><span class=\"tr\">路</span><rt>lù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\non (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></