(55, 'my-bedroom', 'My bedroom', '我的卧室', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3174.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3174-ra8dr62zaitlhna3j5fre1rs2mz6unp6spzikaamvm.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/my-bedroom/', '我的卧室很小但是我很喜欢卧室中间有一张大床床边有一张书桌书桌前放着一把椅子床的另一边放着一个衣柜和一个书架书架上都是我最喜欢的书每天晚上坐在窗前看书是我最幸福的时候卧室的墙是绿色的窗帘也是绿色的那是我最喜欢的颜色书桌上有我的画和花真是太美了', 'wǒ de wò shì hěn xiǎo dàn shì wǒ hěn xǐ huān wò shì zhōng jiān yǒu yī zhāng dà chuáng chuáng biān yǒu yī zhāng shū zhuō shū zhuō qián fàng zhe yī bǎ yǐ zi chuáng de lìng yī biān fàng zhe yī gè yī guì hé yī gè shū jià shū jià shàng dōu shì wǒ zuì xǐ huān de shū měi tiān wǎn shàng zuò zài chuāng qián kàn shū shì wǒ zuì xìng fú de shí hòu wò shì de qiáng shì lǜ sè de chuāng lián yě shì lǜ sè de nà shì wǒ zuì xǐ huān de yán sè shū zhuō shàng yǒu wǒ de huà hé huā zhēn shì tài měi le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wò shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbedroom (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">卧室</span><span class=\"tr\">臥室</span><rt>wò shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSmall (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span cl