(57, 'age-and-address', 'Age and address', '年龄和称呼', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3172.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3172-r73qpqy0y59ggpfshvn27ya18itfzzkuvrwquyehxu.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/age-and-address/', '中国人经常聊年龄人们也经常根据年龄来选择称呼中国人也常用家庭成员的称呼来叫其他人这是一种礼貌比如比自己年龄大的我们常叫哥姐有时候会加上他们的姓比如张哥王姐不认识的人可以叫大哥大姐如果这个人和自己父母的年龄差不多可以叫他们叔叔阿姨如果这个人的年龄和自己的爷爷奶奶差不多可以叫他们爷爷奶奶和哥哥姐姐一样如果你们认识在称呼前面加上这个人的姓就可以了', 'Zhōngguó rén jīng cháng liáo nián líng rén men yě jīng cháng gēn jù nián líng lái xuǎn zé chēng hū Zhōngguó rén yě cháng yòng jiā tíng chéng yuán de chēng hū lái jiào qí tā rén zhè shì yī zhǒng lǐ mào bǐ rú bǐ zì jǐ nián líng dà de wǒ men cháng jiào gē jiě yǒu shí hòu huì jiā shàng tā men de xìng bǐ rú Zhāng gē Wáng jiě bù rènshi de rén kě yǐ jiào dà gē dà jiě rú guǒ zhè gè rén hé zì jǐ fù mǔ de nián líng chà bù duō kě yǐ jiào tā men shūshu ā yí rú guǒ zhè gè rén de nián líng hé zì jǐ de yéye nǎinai chà bù duō kě yǐ jiào tā men yéye nǎinai hé gēge jiějie yī yàng rú guǒ nǐ men rèn shí zài chēng hū qián miàn jiā shàng zhè gè rén de xìng jiù kě yǐ le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国人</span><span class=\"tr\">中國人</span><rt>Zhōngguó rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经常</span><span class=\"tr\">經常</span><rt>jīng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liáo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nchat, talk about \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">聊</span><span class=\"tr\">聊</span><rt>liáo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián líng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年龄</span><span class=\"tr\">年