p\" title=\"huǒ guō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhot pot \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">火锅</span><span class=\"tr\">火鍋</span><rt>huǒ guō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWang \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">王</span><span class=\"tr\">王</span><rt>Wáng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qìng zhù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncelebrate (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">庆祝</span><span class=\"tr\">慶祝</span><rt>qìng zhù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBirthday (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生日</span><span class=\"tr\">生日</span><rt>shēng rì</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(61, 'the-ambulance-is-coming', 'The ambulance is coming', '救护车来了', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3168.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3168-r2xxbbl1anjdat72p3nvj5wva0pdvm7cozm3b0yus2.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/the-ambulance-is-coming/', '大龙你能帮帮我吗路人你怎么了大龙我被一辆电动车撞了路人你能站起来吗大龙不能我现在感觉背很疼路人你还能动吗大龙我好像动不了了我的腿也很疼路人哎呀你的腿流血了大龙你可以帮我给我的同学打个电话吗我同学叫苏南我手机里有他的电话号码手机在我包里路人我跟他说了可是他赶过来要一个小时大龙那请你帮我打电话叫救护车吧我感觉越来越难受了路人好我现在就打需要我扶你起来吗大龙不行我可能骨折了还是等救护车来吧只是我的腿一直在流血可以请你帮我按住伤口止血吗路人好的救护车来了大龙请你再给我的同学打个电话告诉他我去医院了如果警察来了你能跟警察说你看到的情况吗路人好的你别担心我会跟警察说的大龙谢谢你', 'Dàlóng nǐ néng bāngbang wǒ ma lù rén nǐ zěn me le Dàlóng wǒ bèi yī liàng diàn dòng chē zhuàng le lù rén nǐ néng zhàn qǐ lái ma Dàlóng bù néng wǒ xiàn zài gǎn jué bèi hěn téng lù rén nǐ hái néng dòng ma Dàlóng wǒ hǎo xiàng dòng bù liǎo le wǒ de tuǐ yě hěn téng lù rén āi ya nǐ de tuǐ liú xiě le Dàlóng nǐ kě yǐ bāng wǒ gěi wǒ de tóng xué dǎ gè diàn huà ma wǒ tóng xué jiào sū nán wǒ shǒu jī lǐ yǒu tā de diàn huà hào mǎ shǒu jī zài wǒ bāo lǐ lù rén wǒ gēn tā shuō le kě shì tā gǎn guò lái yào yī gè xiǎo shí Dàlóng nà qǐng nǐ bāng wǒ dǎ diàn huà jiào jiù hù chē ba wǒ gǎn jué yuè lái yuè nán shòu le lù rén hǎo wǒ xiàn zài jiù dǎ xū yào wǒ fú nǐ qǐ lái ma Dàlóng bù xíng wǒ kě néng gǔ zhé le hái shì děng jiù hù chē lái ba zhǐ shì wǒ de tuǐ yī zhí zài liú xuè kě yǐ qǐng nǐ bāng wǒ àn zhù shāng kǒu zhǐ xiě ma lù rén hǎo de jiù hù chē lái le Dàlóng qǐng nǐ zài gěi wǒ de tóng xué dǎ gè diàn huà gào sù tā wǒ qù yī yuàn le rú guǒ jǐng chá lái le nǐ néng gēn jǐng chá shuō nǐ kàn dào de qíng kuàng ma lù rén hǎo de nǐ bié dān xīn wǒ huì gēn jǐng chá shuō de Dàlóng xièxie nǐ', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"