tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlast (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweek \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周</span><span class=\"tr\">周</span><rt>zhōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhomework (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">作业</span><span class=\"tr\">作業</span><rt>zuò yè</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWang \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">王</span><span class=\"tr\">王</span><rt>Wáng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBy the way \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对了</span><span class=\"tr\">對了</span><rt>duì le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu liù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSaturday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周六</span><span