<rt>yī yàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHalf (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">半</span><span class=\"tr\">半</span><rt>bàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu liù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSaturday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周六</span><span class=\"tr\">周六</span><rt>zhōu liù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sūnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苏南</span><span class=\"tr\">蘇南</span><rt>Sūnán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu liù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSaturday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周六</span><span class=\"tr\">周六</span><rt>zhōu liù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:53');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(64, 'what-time-do-you-finish-class-today', 'What time do you finish class today?', '今天几点下课？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3165.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3165-qyjlrbrdde47reeb46vk7mpemqi0cxysii5sthbmmq.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-time-do-you-finish-class-today/', '吴小咪小宇你今天几点下课吴小宇下午四点二十姐你呢吴小咪我下午三点半就下课了我在学校等你吧马芳你们下了课就先回家我和你爸爸在家等你们然后我们一起去饭馆吴小咪哥哥几点下班他也要先回家吗马芳他五点下班直接去饭馆吴小咪那我和小宇也直接去饭馆吧我们从学校过去大概五点一刻到吴大伟那好吧我和你妈妈四点三刻出门五点过十分左右到吴小咪好那就这么定了吴小宇现在几点了马芳现在差一刻八点吴小宇哎呀我八点上课我先走了又要迟到了吴小咪我也走了我要坐八点零五分的公交车', 'Wú Xiǎomī Xiǎoyǔ nǐ jīn tiān jǐ diǎn xià kè Wú Xiǎoyǔ xià wǔ sì diǎn èr shí jiě nǐ ne Wú Xiǎomī wǒ xià wǔ sān diǎn bàn jiù xià kè le wǒ zài xué xiào děng nǐ ba Mǎ Fāng nǐ men xià le kè jiù xiān huí jiā wǒ hé nǐ bàba zài jiā děng nǐ men rán hòu wǒ men yī qǐ qù fàn guǎn Wú Xiǎomī gēge jǐ diǎn xià bān tā yě yào xiān huí jiā ma Mǎ Fāng tā wǔ diǎn xià bān zhí jiē qù fàn guǎn Wú Xiǎomī nà wǒ hé Xiǎoyǔ yě zhí jiē qù fàn guǎn ba wǒ men cóng xué xiào guò qù dà gài wǔ diǎn yī kè dào wú dà wěi nà hǎo ba wǒ hé nǐ māma sì diǎn sān kè chū mén wǔ diǎn guò shí fēn zuǒ yòu dào Wú Xiǎomī hǎo nà jiù zhè me dìng le Wú Xiǎoyǔ xiàn zài jǐ diǎn le Mǎ Fāng xiàn zài chà yī kè bā diǎn Wú Xiǎoyǔ āi ya wǒ bā diǎn shàng kè wǒ xiān zǒu le yòu yào chí dào le Wú Xiǎomī wǒ yě zǒu le wǒ yào zuò bā diǎn líng wǔ fēn de gōng jiāo chē', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">小宇</span><rt>Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow many (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncome off from class \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下课</span><span class=\"tr\">下課</span><rt>xià kè</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小宇</span><rt>Wú Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafternoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下午</span><span class=\"tr\">下午</span><rt>xià wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFour (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">四</span><span class=\"tr\">四</span><rt>sì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"èr shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwenty \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">二十</span><span class=\"tr\">二十</span><rt>èr shí</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsister \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姐</span><span class=\"tr\">姐</span><rt>jiě</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafternoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下午</span><span class=\"tr\">下午</span><rt>xià wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHalf (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">半</span><span class=\"tr\">半</span><rt>bàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncome off from class \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下课</span><span class=\"tr\">下課</span><rt>xià kè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nschool (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwait (HSK2)\"><r