uby><span class=\"si\">八</span><span class=\"tr\">八</span><rt>bā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"líng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nzero (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">零</span><span class=\"tr\">零</span><rt>líng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfive (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">五</span><span class=\"tr\">五</span><rt>wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nminute (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">分</span><span class=\"tr\">分</span><rt>fēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng jiāo chē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe bus \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公交车</span><span class=\"tr\">公交車</span><rt>gōng jiāo chē</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(65, 'living-habit', 'Living habit', '生活习惯', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3164.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3164-qyjizbpi9x80kvnl1yqfxv5zgze7g6yu3jk4rplglu.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/living-habit/', '吴小咪大龙你怎么一直在打哈欠啊大龙为了上课不迟到早上起得太早了吴小咪你几点起床的大龙六点就起了吴小咪早上不是八点才上课吗你怎么起那么早大龙因为我早上既要运动又要洗澡所以我六点就要起来吴小咪你习惯早上运动洗澡吗大龙是啊我一直都是早上运动洗澡吴小咪那你一般什么时候睡觉呢大龙说实话工作以后因为要加班我一般晚上十二点半左右睡第二天早上八点才起床去上班可是现在一边工作一边学习以前的作息习惯还是改不了对我来说学校的上课时间太早了吴小咪那从今天起你试一试每天十点半上床睡觉早上六点起坚持一段时间就习惯了一方面早睡早起对身体好另一方面为了上课不睡觉你也要改变一下你的作息习惯大龙好吧我试试吴小咪你还没吃早饭吧走我们一起去食堂大龙我不去了我不吃早饭并且现在一点儿也不饿吴小咪难道这个也是你的习惯吗大龙以前工作很忙没有时间吃早饭时间一长也就习惯不吃早饭了吴小咪这样不行不吃早饭对身体不好这个习惯一定得改我们去吃你最喜欢的牛肉拉面怎么样大龙好吧可是小咪你有一个习惯也一定得改吴小咪什么习惯大龙不运动的习惯啊你周末不是在家睡懒觉就是看电视这样对身体也不好吴小咪你说得对那这个周末我们一起去打羽毛球吧', 'Wú Xiǎomī Dàlóng nǐ zěn me yī zhí zài dǎ hā qiàn a Dàlóng wèi le shàng kè bù chí dào zǎo shàng qǐ de tài zǎo le Wú Xiǎomī nǐ jǐ diǎn qǐ chuáng de Dàlóng liù diǎn jiù qǐ le Wú Xiǎomī zǎo shàng bù shì bā diǎn cái shàng kè ma nǐ zěn me qǐ nà me zǎo Dàlóng yīn wèi wǒ zǎo shàng jì yào yùn dòng yòu yào xǐ zǎo suǒ yǐ wǒ liù diǎn jiù yào qǐ lái Wú Xiǎomī nǐ xí guàn zǎo shàng yùn dòng xǐ zǎo ma Dàlóng shì a wǒ yī zhí dōu shì zǎo shàng yùn dòng xǐ zǎo Wú Xiǎomī nà nǐ yī bān shén me shí hòu shuì jiào ne Dàlóng shuō shí huà gōng zuò yǐ hòu yīn wèi yào jiā bān wǒ yī bān wǎn shàng shí èr diǎn bàn zuǒ yòu shuì dì èr tiān zǎo shàng bā diǎn cái qǐ chuáng qù shàng bān kě shì xiàn zài yī biān gōng zuò yī biān xué xí yǐ qián de zuò xī xí guàn hái shì gǎi bù liǎo duì wǒ lái shuō xué xiào de shàng kè shí jiān tài zǎo le Wú Xiǎomī nà cóng jīn tiān qǐ nǐ shì yī shì měi tiān shí diǎn bàn shàng chuáng shuì jiào zǎo shàng liù diǎn qǐ jiān chí yī duàn shí jiān jiù xí guàn le yī fāng miàn zǎo shuì zǎo qǐ duì shēn tǐ hǎo lìng yī fāng miàn wèi le shàng kè bù shuì jiào nǐ yě yào gǎi biàn yī xià nǐ de zuò xī xí guàn Dàlóng hǎo ba wǒ shì shì Wú Xiǎomī nǐ hái méi chī zǎo fàn ba zǒu wǒ men yī qǐ qù shí táng Dàlóng wǒ bù qù le wǒ bù chī zǎo fàn bìng qiě xiàn zài yī diǎnr yě bù è Wú Xiǎomī nán dào zhè gè yě shì nǐ de xí guàn ma Dàlóng yǐ qián gōng zuò hěn máng méi yǒu shí jiān chī zǎo fàn shí jiān yī cháng yě jiù xí guàn bù chī zǎo fàn le Wú Xiǎomī zhè yàng bù xíng bù chī zǎo fàn duì shēn tǐ bù hǎo zhè gè xí guàn yī dìng děi gǎi wǒ men qù chī nǐ zuì xǐ huān de niú ròu lā miàn zěn me yàng Dàlóng hǎo ba kě shì Xiǎomī nǐ yǒu yī gè xí guàn yě yī dìng děi gǎi Wú Xiǎomī shén me xí guàn Dàlóng bù yùn dòng de xí guàn a nǐ zhōu mò bù shì zài jiā shuì lǎn jiào jiù shì kàn diàn shì zhè yàng duì shēn tǐ yě bù hǎo Wú Xiǎomī nǐ shuō de duì nà zhè gè zhōu mò wǒ men yī qǐ qù dǎ yǔmáoqiú ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽</span><rt>zěn me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī zhí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nall the time (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一直</span><span class=\"tr\">一直</span><rt>yī zhí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ hā qiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyawn \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打哈欠</span><span class=\"tr\">打哈欠</span><rt>d