\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsleep \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">睡</span><span class=\"tr\">睡</span><rt>shuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎn jiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlazy to sleep \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">懒觉</span><span class=\"tr\">懶覺</span><rt>lǎn jiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwatch (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntelevision (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">电视</span><span class=\"tr\">電視</span><rt>diàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这样</span><span class=\"tr\">這樣</span><rt>zhè yàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēn tǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBody (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">身体</span><span class=\"tr\">身體</span><rt>shēn tǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">得</span><span class=\"tr\">得</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nright (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu mò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweekend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周末</span><span class=\"tr\">周末</span><rt>zhōu mò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打</span><span class=\"tr\">打</span><rt>dǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǔmáoqiú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbadminton (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">羽毛球</span><span class=\"tr\">羽毛球</span><rt>yǔmáoqiú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(66, 'what-is-your-hobby', 'What is your hobby?', '你有什么爱好？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3163.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3163-qxc1tonb26advaub0r27szpgjhvv5nohmikc2zu7gy.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-is-your-hobby/', '铃美周末你打算做什么吴小宇我周末打算去唱歌铃美你喜欢唱歌吴小宇我特别喜欢唱歌就是唱得不好你喜欢唱歌吗铃美我不喜欢唱歌不过喜欢听歌吴小宇你还有别的爱好吗铃美有啊我还喜欢游泳看电影打网球旅游吴小宇你的爱好真多铃美那你呢你喜欢什么运动吴小宇我也喜欢游泳铃美你游泳游得怎么样吴小宇我游得可以下次我们可以一起去游泳铃美好啊我最近还在健身房办了一张卡吴小宇你找了私人健身教练吗铃美没有我在练瑜伽吴小宇瑜伽瑜伽好像很难你练瑜伽练得怎么样铃美如果自己练可能有点儿难不过跟着老师一起练就容易多了我现在练得不错你平时喜欢做什么运动吴小宇我有时候早上跟我爷爷去公园打太极对了听说你会弹钢琴铃美是的我从岁就开始弹钢琴了吴小宇除了钢琴你还会别的乐器吗铃美不会了我只会弹钢琴你呢你学过什么乐器吴小宇我什么乐器都没学过但我正在学习摄影铃美是吗那下个周末我们出去拍照吧最近的天气很好怎么样吴小宇好啊没问题', 'Língměi zhōu mò nǐ dǎ suàn zuò shén me Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ zhōu mò dǎ suàn qù chàng gē Língměi nǐ xǐ huān chàng gē Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ tè bié xǐ huān chàng gē jiù shì chàng de bù hǎo nǐ xǐ huān chàng gē ma Língměi wǒ bù xǐ huān chàng gē bù guò xǐ huān tīng gē Wú Xiǎoyǔ nǐ hái yǒu bié de ài hào ma Língměi yǒu a wǒ hái xǐ huān yóu yǒng kàn diàn yǐng dǎ wǎng qiú lǚ yóu Wú Xiǎoyǔ nǐ de ài hào zhēn duō Língměi nà nǐ ne nǐ xǐ huān shén me yùn dòng Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ yě xǐ huān yóu yǒng Língměi nǐ yóu yǒng yóu de zěn me yàng Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ yóu de kě yǐ xià cì wǒ men kě yǐ yī qǐ qù yóu yǒng Língměi hǎo a wǒ zuì jìn hái zài jiàn shēn fáng bàn le yī zhāng kǎ Wú Xiǎoyǔ nǐ zhǎo le sī rén jiàn shēn jiào liàn ma Língměi méi yǒu wǒ zài liàn yú jiā Wú Xiǎoyǔ yú jiā yú jiā hǎo xiàng hěn nán nǐ liàn yú jiā liàn de zěn me yàng Língměi rú guǒ zì jǐ liàn kě néng yǒu diǎnr nán bù guò gēn zhe lǎo shī yī qǐ liàn jiù róng yì duō le wǒ xiàn zài liàn de bù cuò nǐ píng shí xǐ huān zuò shén me yùn dòng Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ yǒu shí hòu zǎo shàng gēn wǒ yéye qù gōng yuán dǎ tài jí duì le tīng shuō nǐ huì tán gāng qín Língměi shì de wǒ cóng suì jiù kāi shǐ tán gāng qín le Wú Xiǎoyǔ chú le gāng qín nǐ hái huì bié de yuè qì ma Língměi bù huì le wǒ zhǐ huì tán gāng qín nǐ ne nǐ xué guò shén me yuè qì Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ shén me yuè qì dōu méi xué guò dàn wǒ zhèng zài xué xí shè yǐng Língměi shì ma nà xià gè zhōu mò wǒ men chū qù pāi zhào ba zuì jìn de tiān qì hěn hǎo zěn me yàng Wú Xiǎoyǔ hǎo a méi wèn tí', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu mò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweekend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周末</span><span class=\"tr\">周末</span><rt>zhōu mò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ suàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打算</span><span class=\"tr\">打算</span><rt>dǎ suàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndo, make (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小宇</span><rt>Wú Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu mò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweekend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周末</span><span class=\"tr\">周末</span><rt>zhōu mò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ suàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打算</span><span class=\"tr\">打算</span><rt>dǎ suàn</rt></ruby