><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusical instrument \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">乐器</span><span class=\"tr\">樂器</span><rt>yuè qì</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小宇</span><rt>Wú Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhatever (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmusical instrument \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">乐器</span><span class=\"tr\">樂器</span><rt>yuè qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但</span><span class=\"tr\">但</span><rt>dàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèng zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin the process of (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">正在</span><span class=\"tr\">正在</span><rt>zhèng zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学习</span><span class=\"tr\">學習</span><rt>xué xí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shè yǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nphotography (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">摄影</span><span class=\"tr\">攝影</span><rt>shè yǐng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnext (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu mò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweekend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周末</span><span class=\"tr\">周末</span><rt>zhōu mò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nout (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">出</span><span class=\"tr\">出</span><rt>chū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo (complement) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pāi zhào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake photo \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拍照</span><span class=\"tr\">拍照</span><rt>pāi zhào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì jìn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrecently (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天气</span><span class=\"tr\">天氣</span><rt>tiān qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHow about it (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小宇</span><rt>Wú Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèn tí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquestion, problem (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">问题</span><span class=\"tr\">問題</span><rt>wèn tí</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(67, 'family-portrait', 'Family portrait', '全家福', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3162.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3162-qvodhkbpxxht1foj024vni2aithqi4rj0gnj38t0lu.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/family-portrait/', '苏南大龙这是你的全家福吗你家有几口人啊照片上的人真多大龙我数数啊十口我们家有十口人爷爷奶奶我爸妈我哥哥姐姐妹妹我还有我姑姑和叔叔苏南你们家人真多这个头发很长眼睛很大的人是你姐姐吗大龙不是这个是我妹妹苏南她多大了她是学生吗大龙是的她是学生今年二十岁现在在美国上大学苏南这个是你爸爸吧你们长得很像大龙对我跟我爸爸一样鼻子很高头发又卷又多苏南你爸爸做什么工作大龙我爸爸是银行经理不过他很快就要退休了苏南你妈妈呢大龙我妈妈和姑姑都是老师我妈妈是中学老师我姑姑是小学老师你看穿白色衬衫的这个是我姑姑我妈妈穿的是红色的裙子苏南你姑姑个子真高哪个是你叔叔大龙这个头发是金黄色又长又直脸上有胡须的是我叔叔苏南你叔叔留长头发啊大龙哈哈他是钢琴家他留长头发很久了苏南哦是不是喜欢艺术的人都是这样大龙我觉得不是我哥哥是小提琴家但是他的头发很短也不爱留胡子他总说头发长了很麻烦对了苏南你家的全家福呢我能看看吗苏南我手机里有一张在这儿你看大龙这个瘦瘦高高的人是你爷爷苏南不是这是我外公旁边这个有点儿胖的人是我外婆大龙那这两个人是你爸爸和妈妈吧苏南对你看我长得像爸爸还是妈妈大龙我看看你的眼睛很大脸很小嘴也不大啊你长得像你妈妈对吧苏南哈哈对大家都说我长得像妈妈大龙但是你的身材像你爸爸又瘦又高你爸爸妈妈做什么工作苏南我爸爸是警察妈妈是家庭主妇大龙这个人是谁你哥哥吗苏南我没有哥哥这是我弟弟大龙他多大了苏南他今年岁在上高中对了大龙你姐姐呢她做什么工作大龙我姐姐是医生她现在在法国工作苏南你姐姐为什么去法国大龙她两年前结婚了她的丈夫是法国人所以他们一起去法国了', 'Sūnán Dàlóng zhè shì nǐ de quán jiā fú ma nǐ jiā yǒu jǐ kǒu rén a zhào piàn shàng de rén zhēn duō Dàlóng wǒ shǔ shǔ a shí kǒu wǒ men jiā yǒu shí kǒu rén yéye nǎinai wǒ bà mā wǒ gēge jiějie mèimei wǒ hái yǒu wǒ gūgu hé shūshu Sūnán nǐ men jiā rén zhēn duō zhè gè tóu fà hěn cháng yǎn jīng hěn dà de rén shì nǐ jiějie ma Dàlóng bù shì zhè gè shì wǒ mèimei Sūnán tā duō dà le tā shì xué shēng ma Dàlóng shì de tā shì xué shēng jīn nián èr shí suì xiàn zài zài Měiguó shàng dà xué Sūnán zhè gè shì nǐ bàba ba nǐ men zhǎng de hěn xiàng Dàlóng duì wǒ gēn wǒ bàba yī yàng bí zi hěn gāo tóu fà yòu juǎn yòu duō Sūnán nǐ bàba zuò shén me gōng zuò Dàlóng wǒ bàba shì yín háng jīng lǐ bù guò tā hěn kuài jiù yào tuì xiū le Sūnán nǐ māma ne Dàlóng wǒ māma hé gūgu dōu shì lǎo shī wǒ māma shì zhōng xué lǎo shī wǒ gūgu shì xiǎo xué lǎo shī nǐ kàn chuān bái sè chèn shān de zhè gè shì wǒ gūgu wǒ māma chuān de shì hóng sè de qún zi Sūnán nǐ gūgu gè zi zhēn gāo nǎ gè shì nǐ shūshu Dàlóng zhè gè tóu fà shì jīn huáng sè yòu cháng yòu zhí liǎn shàng yǒu hú xū de shì wǒ shūshu Sūnán nǐ shūshu liú cháng tóu fà a Dàlóng hā hā tā shì gāng qín jiā tā liú cháng tóu fà hěn jiǔ le Sūnán ó shì bù shì xǐ huān yì shù de rén dōu shì zhè yàng Dàlóng wǒ jué de bù shì wǒ gēge shì xiǎo tí qín jiā dàn shì tā de tóu fà hěn duǎn yě bù ài liú hú zi tā zǒng shuō tóu fà cháng le hěn má fán duì le Sūnán nǐ jiā de quán jiā fú ne wǒ néng kàn kàn ma Sūnán wǒ shǒu jī lǐ yǒu yī zhāng zài zhèr nǐ kàn Dàlóng zhè gè shòu shòu gāo gāo de rén shì nǐ yéye Sūnán bù shì zhè shì wǒ wài gōng páng biān zhè gè yǒu diǎnr pàng de rén shì wǒ wài pó Dàlóng nà zhè liǎng gè rén shì nǐ bàba hé māma ba Sūnán duì nǐ kàn wǒ zhǎng de xiàng bàba hái shì māma Dàlóng wǒ kàn kàn nǐ de yǎn jīng hěn dà liǎn hěn xiǎo zuǐ yě bù dà a nǐ zhǎng de xiàng nǐ māma duì ba Sūnán hā hā duì dà jiā dōu shuō wǒ zhǎng de xiàng māma Dàlóng dàn shì nǐ de shēn cái xiàng nǐ bàba yòu shòu yòu gāo nǐ bàba māma zuò shén me gōng zuò Sūnán wǒ bàba shì jǐng chá māma shì jiā tíng zhǔ fù Dàlóng zhè gè rén shì shéi nǐ gēge ma Sūnán wǒ méi yǒu gēge zhè shì wǒ dìdi Dàlóng tā duō dà le Sūnán tā jīn nián suì zài shàng gāo zhōng duì le Dàlóng nǐ jiějie ne tā zuò shén me gōng zuò Dàlóng wǒ jiějie shì yī shēng tā xiàn zài zài fǎ guó gōng zuò Sūnán nǐ jiějie wèi shén me qù Fǎguó Dàlóng tā liǎng nián qián jié hūn le tā de zhàng fū shì Fǎguó rén suǒ yǐ tā men yī qǐ qù Fǎguó le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sūnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苏南</span><span class=\"tr\">蘇南</span><rt>Sūnán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span clas