<rt>zhào piàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsuperior (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真</span><span class=\"tr\">真</span><rt>zhēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǔ shǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncount \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">数数</span><span class=\"tr\">數數</span><rt>shǔ shǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>……<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">十</span><span class=\"tr\">十</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhome, family (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">十</span><span class=\"tr\">十</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yéye:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngrandfather (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爷爷</span><span class=\"tr\">爺爺</span><rt>yéye</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǎinai:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngrandmother (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">奶奶</span><span class=\"tr\">奶奶</span><rt>nǎinai</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸</span><rt>bà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmom \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽</span><rt>mā</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēge:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥哥</span><rt>gēge</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiějie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder sister (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姐姐</span><span class=\"tr\">姐姐</span><rt>jiějie</rt></ruby></abbr>、<ab