>站</span><span class=\"tr\">站</span><rt>zhàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǎr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哪儿</span><span class=\"tr\">哪兒</span><rt>nǎr</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lù rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npassers-by \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">路人</span><span class=\"tr\">路人</span><rt>lù rén</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntowards (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">往</span><span class=\"tr\">往</span><rt>wǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nforward \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWalk (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">走</span><span class=\"tr\">走</span><rt>zǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nget across (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎ lù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nroad \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">马路</span><span class=\"tr\">馬路</span><rt>mǎ lù</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián miàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFront (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前面</span><span class=\"tr\">前面</span><rt>qián miàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&