bù cuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不错</span><span class=\"tr\">不錯</span><rt>bù cuò</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\norder \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">订</span><span class=\"tr\">訂</span><rt>dìng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yáng Dádá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYang Dada \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杨达达</span><span class=\"tr\">楊達達</span><rt>Yáng Dádá</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō shǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow many, how much (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多少</span><span class=\"tr\">多少</span><rt>duō shǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmoney (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱</span><span class=\"tr\">錢</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNight \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚</span><span class=\"tr\">晚</span><rt>wǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsingle \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">单</span><span class=\"tr\">單</span><rt>dān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nroom \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">房</span><span class=\"tr\">房</span><rt>fáng</rt></ruby></abbr>899<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYuan (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">元</span><span class=\"tr\">元</span><rt>yuán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNight \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚</span><span class=\"tr\">晚</span><rt>wǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\norder \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">订</span><span class=\"tr\">訂</span><rt>dìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nseven (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">七</span><span class=\"tr\">七</span><rt>qī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnight (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚上</span><span class=\"tr\">晚上</span><rt>wǎn shàng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yáng Dádá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYang Dada \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杨达达</span><span class=\"tr\">楊達達</span><rt>Yáng Dádá</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Suǒfēitè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSofitel \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">索菲特</span><span class=\"tr\">索菲特</span><rt>Suǒfēitè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhotel \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">酒店</span><span class=\"tr\">酒店</span><rt>jiǔ diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFar (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">远</span><span class=\"tr\">遠</span><rt>yuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi chē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrive \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开车</span><span class=\"tr\">開車</span><rt>kāi chē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">十</span><span class=\"tr\">十</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēn zhōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nminute (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">分钟</span><span class=\"tr\">分鐘</span><rt>fēn zhōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī huìr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na while (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一会儿</span><span class=\"tr\">一會兒</span><rt>yī huìr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吃</span><span class=\"tr\">吃</span><rt>chī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nover (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完</span><span class=\"tr\">完</span><rt>wán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeal \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">饭</span><span class=\"tr\">飯</span><rt>fàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndeliver (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(72, 'room-service', 'Room Service', '客房服务', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3157.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3157-qsytd0qjn3eb5ztdm613obmygn4i8qg5lo7cnpj39u.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/room-service/', '前台您好索菲特酒店前台请问有什么可以帮您大龙你好我房间里的电视看不了了你们能来检查一下吗前台请问您是哪个房间大龙前台好的先生请您稍等我们马上安排人去看看大龙喂你好前台先生您好这里是酒店前台很抱歉由于现在工人师傅们都下班了今天没办法给您修理电视了等到明天上班我们第一时间给您安排修理大龙好吧只能这样了对了我需要明天早上八点起床请到时候叫醒我服务员好的这边给您安排了明早八点的叫醒服务您还需要别的服务吗大龙我有些饿了想要一个牛肉汉堡和一盘意大利面前台好的大龙我还有几件衣服需要清洗请你们送餐的时候顺便来取吧前台好的先生我们会尽快将您点的餐食送到', 'qián tái nín hǎo Suǒfēitè jiǔ diàn qián tái qǐng wèn yǒu shén me kě yǐ bāng nín Dàlóng nǐ hǎo wǒ fáng jiān lǐ de diàn shì kàn bù liǎo le nǐ men néng lái jiǎn chá yī xià ma qián tái qǐng wèn nín shì nǎ gè fáng jiān Dàlóng qián tái hǎo de xiānsheng qǐng nín shāo děng wǒ men mǎ shàng ān pái rén qù kàn kàn Dàlóng wèi nǐ hǎo qián tái xiānsheng nín hǎo zhè lǐ shì jiǔ diàn qián tái hěn bào qiàn yóu yú xiàn zài gōng rén shī fù men dōu xià bān le jīn tiān méi bàn fǎ gěi nín xiū lǐ diàn shì le děng dào míng tiān shàng bān wǒ men dì yī shí jiān gěi nín ān pái xiū lǐ Dàlóng hǎo ba zhǐ néng zhè yàng le duì le wǒ xū yào míng tiān zǎo shàng bā diǎn qǐ chuáng qǐng dào shí hòu jiào xǐng wǒ fú wù yuán hǎo de zhè biān gěi nín ān pái le míng zǎo bā diǎn de jiào xǐng fú wù nín hái xū yào bié de fú wù ma Dàlóng wǒ yǒu xiē è le xiǎng yào yī gè niú ròu hàn bǎo hé yī pán yì dà lì miàn qián tái hǎo de Dàlóng wǒ hái yǒu jǐ jiàn yī fú xū yào qīng xǐ qǐng nǐ men sòng cān de shí hòu shùn biàn lái qǔ ba qián tái hǎo de xiānsheng wǒ men huì jìn kuài jiāng nín diǎn de cān shí sòng dào', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><strong>（1）</strong></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián tái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfront desk \"><ruby><span cla