\">哪兒</span><rt>nǎr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yáng Dádá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYang Dada \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杨达达</span><span class=\"tr\">楊達達</span><rt>Yáng Dádá</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这儿</span><span class=\"tr\">這兒</span><rt>zhèr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū :&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo out (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">出</span><span class=\"tr\">出</span><rt>chū </rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo (complement) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafter \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">后</span><span class=\"tr\">後</span><rt>hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLeft \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">左</span><span class=\"tr\">左</span><rt>zuǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nturn around \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拐</span><span class=\"tr\">拐</span><rt>guǎi</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ shǒu jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nToilet (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">洗手间</span><span class=\"tr\">洗手間</span><rt>xǐ shǒu jiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBook (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">书</span><span class=\"tr\">書</span><rt>shū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"t