plement) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xièxie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xièxie</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yáng Dádá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYang Dada \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杨达达</span><span class=\"tr\">楊達達</span><rt>Yáng Dádá</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOK (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">行</span><span class=\"tr\">行</span><rt>xíng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwish (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">祝</span><span class=\"tr\">祝</span><rt>zhù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī lù shùn fēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsafe trip \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一路顺风</span><span class=\"tr\">一路順風</span><rt>yī lù shùn fēng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class