abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Huānhuān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHuanhuan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">欢欢</span><span class=\"tr\">歡歡</span><rt>Huānhuān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr>11<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNumber (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">号</span><span class=\"tr\">號</span><rt>hào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexit (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwait (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yáng Huānhuān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYang Huanhuan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杨欢欢</span><span class=\"tr\">楊歡歡</span><rt>Yáng Huānhuān</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder brother \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哥</span><span class=\"tr\">哥</span><rt>gē</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsee (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看见</span><