n><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiū xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrest (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">休息</span><span class=\"tr\">休息</span><rt>xiū xī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo back (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsee (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLingmei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">玲美</span><span class=\"tr\">玲美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">小咪</span><rt>Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(77, 'rent-a-house', 'Rent a house', '租房', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3152.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3152-qpxgzurm9c8dgqaam3mtwmyeujkdsnvsqf86yt4fgy.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/rent-a-house/', '吴小咪大龙今天你怎么迟到了大龙唉别提了早上起晚了没赶上地铁吴小咪从你家到学校远吗大龙坐地铁一个半小时才能到吴小咪天啊你怎么住那么远大龙开学之前我以为我们要住在老校区开学的时候才发现我们是在新校区吴小咪那你怎么不搬家大龙我已经付了六个月的房租不能退吴小咪你好惨啊那现在还有多久到期大龙谢天谢地这个月底就到期了吴小咪恭喜你赶快在新校区附近找个房子吧大龙我正要麻烦你呢吴小咪我知道了你想请我帮你找房子大龙是啊周末你有空吗吴小咪有啊不过你先说说你有什么要求大龙我想住得近一点吴小咪你想住校内还是校外大龙校内跟校外有什么不一样吴小咪校内的房子比校外的方便啊离教室图书馆和食堂都很近大龙那校外的呢吴小咪校外的比校内的大交通更方便离地铁口近附近大商场比较多大龙我想来想去还是住在校外吧一来房租更便宜二来地方也更大吴小咪那好周六下午我陪你在附近看看大龙太好了两点可以吗吴小咪好我们明天下午两点见大龙太谢谢你了明天见', 'Wú Xiǎomī Dàlóng jīn tiān nǐ zěn me chí dào le Dàlóng ài bié tí le zǎo shàng qǐ wǎn le méi gǎn shàng dì tiě Wú Xiǎomī cóng nǐ jiā dào xué xiào yuǎn ma Dàlóng zuò dì tiě yī gè bàn xiǎo shí cái néng dào Wú Xiǎomī tiān a nǐ zěn me zhù nà me yuǎn Dàlóng kāi xué zhī qián wǒ yǐ wéi wǒ men yào zhù zài lǎo xiào qū kāi xué de shí hòu cái fā xiàn wǒ men shì zài xīn xiào qū Wú Xiǎomī nà nǐ zěn me bù bān jiā Dàlóng wǒ yǐ jīng fù le liù gè yuè de fáng zū bù néng tuì Wú Xiǎomī nǐ hǎo cǎn a nà xiàn zài hái yǒu duō jiǔ dào qī Dàlóng xiè tiān xiè dì zhè gè yuè dǐ jiù dào qī le Wú Xiǎomī gōng xǐ nǐ gǎn kuài zài xīn xiào qū fù jìn zhǎo gè fáng zi ba Dàlóng wǒ zhèng yào má fán nǐ ne Wú Xiǎomī wǒ zhī dào le nǐ xiǎng qǐng wǒ bāng nǐ zhǎo fáng zi Dàlóng shì ā zhōu mò nǐ yǒu kòng ma Wú Xiǎomī yǒu a bù guò nǐ xiān shuō shuō nǐ yǒu shén me yāo qiú Dàlóng wǒ xiǎng zhù de jìn yī diǎn Wú Xiǎomī nǐ xiǎng zhù xiào nèi hái shì xiào wài Dàlóng xiào nèi gēn xiào wài yǒu shén me bù yī yàng Wú Xiǎomī xiào nèi de fáng zi bǐ xiào wài de fāng biàn a lí jiào shì tú shū guǎn hé shí táng dōu hěn jìn Dàlóng nà xiào wài de ne Wú Xiǎomī xiào wài de bǐ xiào nèi de dà jiāo tōng gèng fāng biàn lí dì tiě kǒu jìn fù jìn dà shāng chǎng bǐ jiào duō Dàlóng wǒ xiǎng lái xiǎng qù hái shì zhù zài xiào wài ba yī lái fáng zū gèng pián yí èr lái dì fāng yě gèng dà Wú Xiǎomī nà hǎo zhōu liù xià wǔ wǒ péi nǐ zài fù jìn kàn kàn Dàlóng tài hǎo le liǎng diǎn kě yǐ ma Wú Xiǎomī hǎo wǒ men míng tiān xià wǔ liǎng diǎn jiàn Dàlóng tài xiè xiè nǐ le míng tiān jiàn', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhy (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽</span><rt>zěn me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chí dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe late (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">迟到</span><span class=\"tr\">遲到</span><rt>chí dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwell (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">唉</span><span class=\"tr\">唉</span><rt>ài</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDon\'t (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">别</span><span class=\"tr\">別</span><rt>bié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmention (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">提</span><span class=\"tr\">提</span><rt>tí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nget up \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">起</span><span class=\"tr\">起</span><rt>qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlate \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚</span><span class=\"tr\">晚</span><rt>wǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrush \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">赶</span><span class=\"tr\">趕</span><rt>gǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(complement_ (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì tiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsubway (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地铁</span><span class=\"tr\">地鐵</span><rt>dì tiě</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nschool (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学校</span><span class=\"tr\">學校</span><rt>xué xiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFar (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">远</span><span class=\"tr\">遠</span><rt>yuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坐</span><span class=\"tr\">坐</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì tiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsubway (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地铁</span><span class=\"tr\">地鐵</span><rt>dì tiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHalf (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">半</span><span class=\"tr\">半</span><rt>bàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHour (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小时</span><span class=\"tr\">小時</span><rt>xiǎo shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust (HSK3