ooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià wǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafternoon (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下午</span><span class=\"tr\">下午</span><rt>xià wǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"tr\">太</span><rt>tài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntomorrow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeet \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(78, 'what-to-do-on-the-weekend', 'What to do on the weekend?', '周末做什么？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3151.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3151-qp46sh1h41nhwms90wo8r1bcoz3dpqj38ixmy60img.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-to-do-on-the-weekend/', '大龙周末你们打算做什么玲美我早就想好了打扫打扫房间睡睡懒觉看看书苏南我一般在家休息但是这个周末我不在家吴小咪邀请我去她爷爷家玩大龙听起来很不错玲美她爷爷住在哪儿苏南她爷爷退休了和奶奶一起住在郊区平时养养花种种菜还有一条小狗和一只可爱的小猫大龙那你们去爷爷家做什么苏南那附近有条小河风景很不错可以看看风景钓钓鱼除了钓鱼我们还可以在爷爷的院子里烧烤晚上还能看到漂亮的星星玲美我觉得钓鱼比我在家睡懒觉有意思我可以去吗大龙我还没想好周末做什么我也想跟你们一起去', 'Dàlóng zhōu mò nǐ men dǎ suàn zuò shén me Língměi wǒ zǎo jiù xiǎng hǎo le dǎ sǎo dǎ sǎo fáng jiān shuì shuì lǎn jiào kàn kàn shū Sūnán wǒ yī bān zài jiā xiū xī dàn shì zhè gè zhōu mò wǒ bù zài jiā Wú Xiǎomī yāo qǐng wǒ qù tā yé yé jiā wán Dàlóng tīng qǐ lái hěn bù cuò Língměi tā yé yé zhù zài nǎ ér Sūnán tā yé yé tuì xiū le hé nǎi nǎi yī qǐ zhù zài jiāo qū píng shí yǎng yǎng huā zhòng zhòng cài hái yǒu yī tiáo xiǎo gǒu hé yī zhī kě ài de xiǎo māo Dàlóng nà nǐ men qù yé yé jiā zuò shén me Sūnán nà fù jìn yǒu tiáo xiǎo hé fēng jǐng hěn bù cuò kě yǐ kàn kàn fēng jǐng diào diào yú chú le diào yú wǒ men hái kě yǐ zài yé yé de yuàn zi lǐ shāo kǎo wǎn shàng hái néng kàn dào piào liàng de xīng xīng Língměi wǒ jué de diào yú bǐ wǒ zài jiā shuì lǎn jiào yǒu yì sī wǒ kě yǐ qù ma Dàlóng wǒ hái méi xiǎng hǎo zhōu mò zuò shén me wǒ yě xiǎng gēn nǐ men yī qǐ qù', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu mò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweekend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周末</span><span class=\"tr\">周末</span><rt>zhōu mò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ suàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打算</span><span class=\"tr\">打算</span><rt>dǎ suàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndo, make (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLingmei\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">玲美</span><span class=\"tr\">玲美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nas early as\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早</span><span class=\"tr\">早</span><rt>zǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ sǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclean (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打扫</span><span class=\"tr\">打掃</span><rt>dǎ sǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ sǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclean (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打扫</span><