ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nknow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">认识</span><span class=\"tr\">認識</span><rt>rèn shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>zhōng guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwell\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好好</span><span class=\"tr\">好好</span><rt>hǎo hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liàn xí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npractise (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">练习</span><span class=\"tr\">練習</span><rt>liàn xí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hàn yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChinese (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉语</span><span class=\"tr\">漢語</span><rt>hàn yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentence to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(80, 'how-did-you-do-on-the-exam', 'How did you do on the exam?', '你们考得怎么样？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/3149.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/3149-qnpaj116qneob1goj7kh0odu00npst60poqdlhpetu.jpg', '', 'HSK3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/how-did-you-do-on-the-exam/', '铃美昨天的考试你们考得怎么样大龙这次考试不仅题多而且很难我都没写完苏南尽管我都写完了可是我觉得考得不好铃美你不是都写完了吗苏南就拿阅读题来说大部分汉字我都认识可是放在一起我就看不懂了最后时间来不及了我怕写不完只好随便选了一个答案大龙我觉得听力和阅读考得可以写汉字的时候有几个字我从来没见过写不出来铃美做阅读的时候有个词语我明明学过就是突然想不起来了急死我了大龙我以为只有我考得不好呢原来大家都觉得这次考试很难苏南看来下次我们得好好复习了别难过了大龙我们去看电影吧铃美是啊大龙考试之前你就很紧张现在已经考完了我们就一起放松放松吧我刚才也有点难过但是听起来大家都差不多我们下次继续努力吧大龙你说得对', 'Língměi zuó tiān de kǎo shì nǐ men kǎo de zěn me yàng Dàlóng zhè cì kǎo shì bù jǐn tí duō ér qiě hěn nán wǒ dōu méi xiě wán Sūnán jǐn guǎn wǒ dōu xiě wán le kě shì wǒ jué de kǎo de bù hǎo Língměi nǐ bù shì dōu xiě wán le ma Sūnán jiù ná yuè dú tí lái shuō dà bù fèn hàn zì wǒ dōu rèn shí kě shì fàng zài yī qǐ wǒ jiù kàn bù dǒng le zuì hòu shí jiān lái bù jí le wǒ pà xiě bù wán zhǐ hǎo suí biàn xuǎn le yī gè dá àn Dàlóng wǒ jué de tīng lì hé yuè dú kǎo de kě yǐ xiě hàn zì de shí hòu yǒu jǐ gè zì wǒ cóng lái méi jiàn guò xiě bù chū lái Língměi zuò yuè dú de shí hòu yǒu gè cí yǔ wǒ míng míng xué guò jiù shì tū rán xiǎng bù qǐ lái le jí sǐ wǒ le Dàlóng wǒ yǐ wéi zhǐ yǒu wǒ kǎo de bù hǎo ne yuán lái dà jiā dōu jué de zhè cì kǎo shì hěn nán Sūnán kàn lái xià cì wǒ men de hǎo hǎo fù xí le bié nán guò le Dàlóng wǒ men qù kàn diàn yǐng ba Língměi shì a Dàlóng kǎo shì zhī qián nǐ jiù hěn jǐn zhāng xiàn zài yǐ jīng kǎo wán le wǒ men jiù yī qǐ fàng sōng fàng sōng ba wǒ gāng cái yě yǒu diǎn nán guò dàn shì tīng qǐ lái dà jiā dōu chà bù duō wǒ men xià cì jì xù nǔ lì ba Dàlóng nǐ shuō de duì', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuó tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyesterday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">昨天</span><span class=\"tr\">昨天</span><rt>zuó tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǎo shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexam (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">考试</span><span class=\"tr\">考試</span><rt>kǎo shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTest\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">考</span><span class=\"tr\">考</span><rt>kǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle, used after a verb or an adjective to introduce a complement of result or degree) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">得</span><span class=\"tr\">得</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhow is it (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǎo shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake an exam (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">考试</span><span class=\"tr\">考試</span><rt>kǎo shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù jǐn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot only (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不仅</span><span class=\"tr\">不僅</span><rt>bù jǐn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquestion, problem (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">题</span><span class=\"tr\">題</span><rt>tí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér qiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">而且</span><span class=\"tr\">而且</span><rt>ér qiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndifficult (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">难</span><span class=\"tr\">難</span><rt>nán</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neven (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwithout (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWrite (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">写</span><span class=\"tr\">寫</span><rt>xiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncomplete (completion) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完</span><span class=\"tr\">完</span><rt>wán</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sūnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunan\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苏南</span><span class=\"tr\">蘇南</span><rt>Sūnán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐn guǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalthough (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">尽管</span><span class=\"tr\">儘管</span><rt>jǐn guǎ