;br /&gt;\r\nregardless of, no matter what, how, etc. (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不管</span><span class=\"tr\">不管</span><rt>bù guǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe hotel \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">酒店</span><span class=\"tr\">酒店</span><rt>jiǔ diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot have \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfault (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">错</span><span class=\"tr\">錯</span><rt>cuò</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe hotel \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">酒店</span><span class=\"tr\">酒店</span><rt>jiǔ diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fù zé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe responsible for (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">负责</span><span class=\"tr\">負責</span><rt>fù zé</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(83, 'an-email-commuting-suggestions', 'An Email – Commuting Suggestions', '一封电子邮件 —— 关于通勤方式的建议', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4181.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4181-rbqul438u34umjg3u1jpix7n0u4iggvxcib9spvple.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/an-email-commuting-suggestions/', '寄件人收件人日期年月日星期三晚上主题关于通勤方式的建议亲爱的王阳你还好吗你的邮件我上个星期就收到了但是我最近很忙现在才有空回复你真不好意思你说你不知道应不应该买车我非常理解你的犹豫有自己的车确实既方便又舒服能节省不少时间但是开车对环境不友好并且现在的修理费和停车费都很贵你现在刚开始工作钱不多买车可能不太合适我查了一下你家到公司的路线公司附近没有公交站和地铁站只能走路或者打车如果走路单程就需要分钟太累了如果打车单程只需要分钟但是价钱比较贵而且上下班的高峰期不容易打到车所以我认为骑自行车可能更适合你如果骑自行车你单程只需要半个小时不但便宜还能锻炼身体而且现在到处都是共享单车方便极了我知道你还不会骑自行车不过骑自行车非常简单如果经常练习你会发现学会骑自行车就是小菜一碟再说你的运动能力那么强我相信你用一个周末就能学会我建议你试一试希望我的建议对你有帮助祝好林丹', 'jì jiàn rén shōu jiàn rén rì qī nián yuè rì xīng qī sān wǎn shàng zhǔ tí guān yú tōng qín fāng shì de jiàn yì qīn ài de Wáng Yáng nǐ hái hǎo ma nǐ de yóu jiàn wǒ shàng gè xīng qī jiù shōu dào le dàn shì wǒ zuì jìn hěn máng xiàn zài cái yǒu kòng huí fù nǐ zhēn bù hǎo yìsi nǐ shuō nǐ bù zhī dào yīng bù yīng gāi mǎi chē wǒ fēi cháng lǐ jiě nǐ de yóu yù yǒu zì jǐ de chē què shí jì fāng biàn yòu shū fú néng jié shěng bù shǎo shí jiān dàn shì kāi chē duì huán jìng bù yǒu hǎo bìng qiě xiàn zài de xiū lǐ fèi hé tíng chē fèi dōu hěn guì nǐ xiàn zài gāng kāi shǐ gōng zuò qián bù duō mǎi chē kě néng bù tài hé shì wǒ chá le yī xià nǐ jiā dào gōng sī de lù xiàn gōng sī fù jìn méi yǒu gōng jiāo zhàn hé dì tiě zhàn zhǐ néng zǒu lù huò zhě dǎ chē rú guǒ zǒu lù dān chéng jiù xū yào fēn zhōng tài lèi le rú guǒ dǎ chē dān chéng zhǐ xū yào fēn zhōng dàn shì jià qián bǐ jiào guì ér qiě shàng xià bān de gāo fēng qī bù róng yì dǎ dào chē suǒ yǐ wǒ rèn wéi qí zì xíng chē kě néng gèng shì hé nǐ rú guǒ qí zì xíng chē nǐ dān chéng zhǐ xū yào bàn gè xiǎo shí bù dàn piányi hái néng duàn liàn shēn tǐ ér qiě xiàn zài dào chù dōu shì gòng xiǎng dān chē fāng biàn jí le wǒ zhī dào nǐ hái bù huì qí zì xíng chē bù guò qí zì xíng chē fēi cháng jiǎn dān rú guǒ jīng cháng liàn xí nǐ huì fā xiàn xué huì qí zì xíng chē jiù shì xiǎo cài yī dié zài shuō nǐ de yùn dòng néng lì nà me qiáng wǒ xiāng xìn nǐ yòng yī gè zhōu mò jiù néng xué huì wǒ jiàn yì nǐ shì yī shì xī wàng wǒ de jiàn yì duì nǐ yǒu bāng zhù zhù hǎo Lín Dān', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì jiàn rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSender \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">寄件人</span><span class=\"tr\">寄件人</span><rt>jì jiàn rén</rt></ruby></abbr>： <a class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"5c303532383d321c39313d3530723f3331\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\">[email protected]</a></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shōu jiàn rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nRecipient \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">收件人</span><span class=\"tr\">收件人</span><rt>shōu jiàn rén</rt></ruby></abbr>： <a class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"a4d3c5cac3ddc5cac3e4c1c9c5cdc88ac7cbc9\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\">[email protected]</a></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rì qī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDate (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日期</span><span class=\"tr\">日期</span><rt>rì qī</rt></ruby></abbr>： 2025 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr>7 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>30 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日</span><span class=\"tr\">日</span><rt>rì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīng qī sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWednesday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">星期三</span><span class=\"tr\">星期三</span><rt>xīng qī sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevening (HSK2)\