(85, 'the-story-of-nezha', 'The story of Nezha', '哪吒的故事', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4179.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4179-r8jht6l5wf0092frfdime7j9ly95ljiwojxu2sx1zm.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/the-story-of-nezha/', '很久以前有一个叫李靖的将军他的妻子怀孕三年才生下一个男孩这个男孩出生时是一个会发光的圆球大家都觉得奇怪神仙太乙真人来到他家给男孩取名哪吒并送给他两件武器能喷火的圈和能飞的红布哪吒从小就很调皮好斗七岁时去海边玩用红布搅动海水弄坏了海底龙王的水晶宫龙王的儿子出来骂他哪吒生气地打死了龙王儿子龙王很生气要用水把整个城市淹了哪吒为了不连累父母决定牺牲自己他最后对爸爸妈妈说现在我把我的骨和肉还给你们哪吒死后太乙真人用莲藕和荷叶给他做了一个新身体让他复活了复活后的哪吒变得更厉害了但和父亲李靖的关系变得很糟糕后来当龙王要伤害百姓时哪吒放下过去的矛盾和父亲一起保护大家最终成为人们心中的小英雄', 'hěn jiǔ yǐ qián yǒu yī gè jiào Lǐ Jìng de jiāng jūn tā de qī zi huái yùn sān nián cái shēng xià yī gè nán hái zhè gè nán hái chū shēng shí shì yī gè huì fā guāng de yuán qiú dà jiā dōu jué de qí guài shén xiān Tàiyǐ Zhēnrén lái dào tā jiā gěi nán hái qǔ míng Nézhā bìng sòng gěi tā liǎng jiàn wǔ qì néng pēn huǒ de quān hé néng fēi de hóng bù Nézhā cóng xiǎo jiù hěn tiáo pí hào dòu qī suì shí qù hǎi biān wán yòng hóng bù jiǎo dòng hǎi shuǐ nòng huài le hǎi dǐ lóng wáng de shuǐ jīng gōng lóng wáng de ér zi chū lái mà tā Nézhā shēng qì de dǎ sǐ le lóng wáng ér zi lóng wáng hěn shēng qì yào yòng shuǐ bǎ zhěng gè chéng shì yān le Nézhā wèi le bù lián lèi fù mǔ jué dìng xī shēng zì jǐ tā zuì hòu duì bàba māma shuō xiàn zài wǒ bǎ wǒ de gǔ hé ròu huán gěi nǐ men Nézhā sǐ hòu tài yǐ zhēn rén yòng lián ǒu hé hé yè gěi tā zuò le yī gè xīn shēn tǐ ràng tā fù huó le fù huó hòu de Nézhā biàn de gèng lì hài le dàn hé fù qīn Lǐ Jìng de guān xì biàn de hěn zāo gāo hòu lái dāng lóng wáng yào shāng hài bǎi xìng shí Nézhā fàng xià guò qù de máo dùn hé fù qīn yī qǐ bǎo hù dà jiā zuì zhōng chéng wéi rén men xīn zhōng de xiǎo yīng xióng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLong (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">久</span><span class=\"tr\">久</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐ qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbefore (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">以前</span><span class=\"tr\">以前</span><rt>yǐ qián</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncalled (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">叫</span><span class=\"tr\">叫</span><rt>jiào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lǐ Jìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLi Jing \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李靖</span><span class=\"tr\">李靖</span><rt>Lǐ Jìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiāng jūn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngeneral (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">将军</span><span class=\"tr\">將軍</span><rt>jiāng jūn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhe, him (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他</span><span class=\"tr\">他</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qī zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwife (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妻子</span><span class=\"tr\">妻子</span><rt>qī zi</rt></