(86, 'my-big-family', 'My big family', '我的大家庭', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4178.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4178-r73qvmfpnvaz0ywl6x24aywqw7v13vwgouozu7ox1u.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/my-big-family/', '我有一个大家庭我的爸爸是中学老师妈妈是护士现在他们都已经退休了我没有亲兄弟姐妹是独生女但是我并不孤单因为我有两个堂哥和三个表妹我们一起长大非常快乐我以前是个公务员后来有了孩子我就做了家庭主妇我的爱人是外国人在公司工作是个程序员他有三个兄弟他的大哥非常聪明是个大学教授他的二哥很高是个运动员他的弟弟还是学生现在一边打工一边读大学我的公公是银行职员我的婆婆是超市的营业员现在都七十多岁了还在工作你的家庭怎么样', 'wǒ yǒu yī gè dà jiā tíng wǒ de bàba shì zhōng xué lǎo shī māma shì hù shì xiàn zài tā men dōu yǐ jīng tuì xiū le wǒ méi yǒu qīn xiōng dì jiě mèi shì dú shēng nǚ dàn shì wǒ bìng bù gū dān yīn wèi wǒ yǒu liǎng gè táng gē hé sān gè biǎo mèi wǒ men yī qǐ zhǎng dà fēi cháng kuài lè wǒ yǐ qián shì gè gōng wù yuán hòu lái yǒu le hái zi wǒ jiù zuò le jiā tíng zhǔ fù wǒ de ài rén shì wài guó rén zài gōng sī gōng zuò shì gè chéng xù yuán tā yǒu sān gè xiōng dì tā de dà gē fēi cháng cōng míng shì gè dà xué jiào shòu tā de èr gē hěn gāo shì gè yùn dòng yuán tā de dìdi hái shì xué shēng xiàn zài yī biān dǎ gōng yī biān dú dà xué wǒ de gōnggong shì yín háng zhí yuán wǒ de pópo shì chāo shì de yíng yè yuán xiàn zài dōu qī shí duō suì le hái zài gōng zuò nǐ de jiā tíng zěn me yàng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā tíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfamily (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家庭</span><span class=\"tr\">家庭</span><rt>jiā tíng</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmiddle school \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中学</span><span class=\"tr\">中學</span><rt>zhōng xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"māma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>māma</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hù shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNurse (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">护士</span><span class=\"tr\">護士</span><rt>hù shì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</sp