pan class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">并</span><span class=\"tr\">幷</span><rt>bìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gū dān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalone (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">孤单</span><span class=\"tr\">孤單</span><rt>gū dān</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn wèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecause (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">因为</span><span class=\"tr\">因爲</span><rt>yīn wèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"táng gē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncousin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">堂哥</span><span class=\"tr\">堂哥</span><rt>táng gē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biǎo mèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncousin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">表妹</span><span class=\"tr\">表妹</span><rt>biǎo mèi</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎng dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngrow up \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">长大</span><span class=\"tr\">長大</span><rt>zhǎng dà</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">非常</span><span class=\"tr\">非常</span><rt>fēi cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài lè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhappy (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快乐</span><span class=\"tr\">快樂</span><rt>kuài lè</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐ qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbefore (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">以前</span><span class=\"tr\">以前</span><rt>yǐ qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng wù yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncivil servant \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公务员</span><span class=\"tr\">公務員</span><rt>gōng wù yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hòu lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlater (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">后来</span><span class=\"tr\">後來</span><rt>hòu lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu<