(87, 'my-hometown', 'My hometown', '我的家乡', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4177.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4177-r5kzz0d77iiycdj8m9e74m4cs09dm8y2a0uwodu72q.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/my-hometown/', '我的家乡在农村那里有很多动物和植物我家养了一群羊两匹马三头牛还有四只鸡和六只鸭鱼塘里也有很多条鱼我的弟弟还养了一条蛇我一直很害怕我家的院子很大一半种花一半种菜每到春天花全开了五颜六色每一朵都又香又美如果去朋友家吃饭我们总会送给朋友们一束花我家的院子一年四季都种不同的菜如果有客人来家里总能吃到最新鲜的蔬菜我又开始想念我的家乡和家人了', 'wǒ de jiā xiāng zài nóng cūn nà lǐ yǒu hěn duō dòng wù hé zhí wù wǒ jiā yǎng le yī qún yáng liǎng pǐ mǎ sān tóu niú hái yǒu sì zhī jī hé liù zhī yā yú táng lǐ yě yǒu hěn duō tiáo yú wǒ de dì dì hái yǎng le yī tiáo shé wǒ yī zhí hěn hài pà wǒ jiā de yuàn zi hěn dà yī bàn zhòng huā yī bàn zhòng cài měi dào chūn tiān huā quán kāi le wǔ yán liù sè měi yī duǒ dōu yòu xiāng yòu měi rú guǒ qù péng yǒu jiā chī fàn wǒ men zǒng huì sòng gěi péng yǒu men yī shù huā wǒ jiā de yuàn zi yī nián sì jì dōu zhòng bù tóng de cài rú guǒ yǒu kè rén lái jiā lǐ zǒng néng chī dào zuì xīn xiān de shū cài wǒ yòu kāi shǐ xiǎng niàn wǒ de jiā xiāng hé jiā rén le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā xiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhometown (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家乡</span><span class=\"tr\">家鄉</span><rt>jiā xiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nóng cūn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrural area (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">农村</span><span class=\"tr\">農村</span><rt>nóng cūn</rt><