n><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chā bié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndifference (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">差别</span><span class=\"tr\">差別</span><rt>chā bié</rt></ruby></abbr>； <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsome \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有的</span><span class=\"tr\">有的</span><rt>yǒu de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fāng yán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndialect (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">方言</span><span class=\"tr\">方言</span><rt>fāng yán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pǔ tōng huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmandarin (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">普通话</span><span class=\"tr\">普通話</span><rt>pǔ tōng huà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán quán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompletely (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完全</span><span class=\"tr\">完全</span><rt>wán quán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù tóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndifferent \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不同</span><span class=\"tr\">不同</span><rt>bù tóng</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不过</span><span class=\"tr\">不過</span><rt>bù guò</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nif only (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只要</span><span class=\"tr\">只要</span><rt>zhǐ yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudy \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学</span><span class=\"tr\">學</span><rt>xué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pǔ tōng huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmandarin (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">普通话</span><span class=\"tr\">普通話</span><rt>pǔ tōng huà</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"quán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncomplete \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">全</span><span class=\"tr\">全</span><rt>quán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nable (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlisten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǒng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nUnderstand (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">懂</span><span class=\"tr\">懂</span><rt>dǒng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54'),
(89, 'jobs-that-ai-can-do', 'Jobs that AI can do', 'AI可以做的工作', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4173.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4173-r2xyebvwx4xr48j8wyoi0bjirofrbf2c229iaf4ony.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/jobs-that-ai-can-do/', '技术越来越厉害甚至开始影响人的工作了一些公司发现很多工作也可以做擅长处理数据和语言速度也特别快程序员老师记者律师等相关的工作都可能被影响但是现在不能完全独立工作需要人的帮助才可以更好', 'jì shù yuè lái yuè lì hài shèn zhì kāi shǐ yǐng xiǎng rén de gōng zuò le yī xiē gōng sī fā xiàn hěn duō gōng zuò yě kě yǐ zuò shàn cháng chǔ lǐ shù jù hé yǔ yán sù dù yě tè bié kuài chéng xù yuán lǎo shī jì zhě lǜ shī děng xiāng guān de gōng zuò dōu kě néng bèi yǐng xiǎng dàn shì xiàn zài bù néng wán quán dú lì gōng zuò xū yào rén de bāng zhù cái kě yǐ gèng hǎo', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì shù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntechnology (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">技术</span><span class=\"tr\">技術</span><rt>jì shù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè lái yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMore and more \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越来越</span><span class=\"tr\">越來越</span><rt>yuè lái yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lì hài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nawesome (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">厉害</span><span class=\"tr\">厲害</span><rt>lì hài</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shèn zhì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neven (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">甚至</span><span class=\"tr\">甚至</span><rt>shèn zhì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi shǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstart (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开始</span><span class=\"tr\">開始</span><rt>kāi shǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐng xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninfluence, affect (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">影响</span><span class=\"tr\">影響</span><rt>yǐng xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSome \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompany (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公司</span><span class=\"tr\">公司</span><rt>gōng sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fā xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDiscover (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">发现</span><span class=\"tr\">發現</span><rt>fā xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndo, make (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>。AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàn cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood at (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">擅长</span><span class=\"tr\">擅長</span><rt>shàn cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chǔ lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndeal with (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">处理</span><span class=\"tr\">處理</span><rt>chǔ lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shù jù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndata (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">数据</span><span class=\"tr\">數據</span><rt>shù jù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǔ yán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlanguage (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">语言</span><span class=\"tr\">語言</span><rt>yǔ yán</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sù dù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspeed (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">速度</span><span class=\"tr\">速度</span><rt>sù dù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tè bié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspecial (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">特别</span><span class=\"tr\">特別</span><rt>tè bié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquick (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快</span><span class=\"tr\">快</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng xù yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nprogrammer \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">程序员</span><span class=\"tr\">程序員</span><rt>chéng xù yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǎo shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nteacher (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì zhě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreporter (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">记者</span><span class=\"tr\">記者</span><rt>jì zhě</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǜ shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlawyer (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">律师</span><span class=\"tr\">律師</span><rt>lǜ shī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\netc. (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiāng guān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nRelated (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">相关</span><span class=\"tr\">相關</span><rt>xiāng guān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npossible (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可能</span><span class=\"tr\">可能</span><rt>kě néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nby (indicates passive-voice clauses) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">被</span><span class=\"tr\">被</span><rt>bèi</rt></ruby></abbr>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐng xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninfluence, affect (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">影响</span><span class=\"tr\">影響</span><rt>yǐng xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nable (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán quán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompletely (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完全</span><span class=\"tr\">完全</span><rt>wán quán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dú lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nindependent (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">独立</span><span class=\"tr\">獨立</span><rt>dú lì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xū yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nneed (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">需要</span><span class=\"tr\">需要</span><rt>xū yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bāng zhù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhelp (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">帮助</span><span class=\"tr\">幫助</span><rt>bāng zhù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">才</span><span class=\"tr\">才</span><rt>cái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEven (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更</span><span class=\"tr\">更</span><rt>gèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(90, 'ways-to-improve-reading-speed', 'Ways to improve reading speed', '提高阅读速度的方法', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4172.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4172-r1g0fz6wlexo1x809tu4lyd5efo0vjt6xxzq3zwnag.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/ways-to-improve-reading-speed/', '快速阅读是很多人梦寐以求的一种技能不仅能节省时间而且能提高效率读更多的书那么怎样才能进行有效的阅读练习呢首先在开始阅读前你要准备一支笔和几张纸打开书的目录部分观察这本书的结构了解各部分之间的关系观察每一章的标题和副标题记住这本书的整体布局这样做可以让你了解作者的思维知道作者认为什么最重要接着你要记录你的问题写下你对于每个章节标题的疑问然后你可以开始阅读看详细的内容对这本书进行更深层次的理解但是你得边读边写下测试题这样在读完以后可以帮助自己检测对于这些内容的理解因为在阅读过程中很多时候我们觉得自己看懂了但在回忆内容时才发现并非如此因此在每一章结束时做一做自己的测试题看看自己是否熟悉这一章的内容最后一步是复习为了达到最佳阅读效果可以尝试在阅读完成后的第二天进行复习看看你是否能轻松回答自己的问题复述这一章的内容如果不行那就请从第一步开始带着你的问题再读一遍吧', 'kuài sù yuè dú shì hěn duō rén mèng mèi yǐ qiú de yī zhǒng jì néng bù jǐn néng jié shěng shí jiān ér qiě néng tí gāo xiào lǜ dú gèng duō de shū nà me zěn yàng cái néng jìn xíng yǒu xiào de yuè dú liàn xí ne shǒu xiān zài kāi shǐ yuè dú qián nǐ yào zhǔn bèi yī zhī bǐ hé jǐ zhāng zhǐ dǎ kāi shū de mù lù bù fèn guān chá zhè běn shū de jié gòu liǎo jiě gè bù fèn zhī jiān de guān xì guān chá měi yī zhāng de biāo tí hé fù biāo tí jì zhù zhè běn shū de zhěng tǐ bù jú zhè yàng zuò kě yǐ ràng nǐ liǎo jiě zuò zhě de sī wéi zhī dào zuò zhě rèn wéi shén me zuì zhòng yào jiē zhe nǐ yào jì lù nǐ de wèn tí xiě xià nǐ duì yú měi gè zhāng jié biāo tí de yí wèn rán hòu nǐ kě yǐ kāi shǐ yuè dú kàn xiáng xì de nèi róng duì zhè běn shū jìn xíng gèng shēn céng cì de lǐ jiě dàn shì nǐ děi biān dú biān xiě xià cè shì tí zhè yàng zài dú wán yǐ hòu kě yǐ bāng zhù zì jǐ jiǎn cè duì yú zhè xiē nèi róng de lǐ jiě yīn wèi zài yuè dú guò chéng zhōng hěn duō shí hòu wǒ men jué de zì jǐ kàn dǒng le dàn zài huí yì nèi róng shí cái fā xiàn bìng fēi rú cǐ yīn cǐ zài měi yī zhāng jié shù shí zuò yī zuò zì jǐ de cè shì tí kàn kàn zì jǐ shì fǒu shú xī zhè yī zhāng de nèi róng zuì hòu yī bù shì fù xí wèi le dá dào zuì jiā yuè dú xiào guǒ kě yǐ cháng shì zài yuè dú wán chéng hòu de dì èr tiān jìn xíng fù xí kàn kàn nǐ shì fǒu néng qīng sōng huí dá zì jǐ de wèn tí fù shù zhè yī zhāng de nèi róng rú guǒ bù xíng nà jiù qǐng cóng dì yī bù kāi shǐ dài zhe nǐ de wèn tí zài dú yī biàn ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquick (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快</span><span class=\"tr\">快</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspeed \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">速</span><span class=\"tr\">速</span><rt>sù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè dú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nread (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">阅读</span><span class=\"tr\">閱讀</span><rt>yuè dú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mèng mèi yǐ qiú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na long cherished goal \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">梦寐以求</span><span class=\"tr\">夢寐以求</span><rt>mèng mèi yǐ qiú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǒng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nkind (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">种</span><span class=\"tr\">種</span><rt>zhǒng</rt