uby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"tr\">太</span><rt>tài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sūnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苏南</span><span class=\"tr\">蘇南</span><rt>Sūnán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xièxie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xièxie</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù kè qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYou\'re welcome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不客气</span><span class=\"tr\">不客氣</span><rt>bù kè qì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(93, 'long-time-no-see', 'Long time no see', '好久不见', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4169.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4169-qyjk55iyeihd86wat1mrwb6f4987zb0tuknzkzkrpu.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/long-time-no-see/', '铃美大龙真巧你也在这儿啊你寒假过得怎么样大龙挺好的听说你回日本过寒假了铃美是啊回去看看我爸妈大龙你爸妈身体怎么样铃美他们身体都很好谢谢对了你去哪儿啊大龙我正要去食堂吃饭呢你吃了吗铃美吃了刚吃完食堂新开了家炒菜馆味道不错你吃过吗大龙还没呢那我也去试试铃美那你快去吧大龙行走了改天再聊吴小咪铃美好久不见啊铃美是啊小咪好久不见了你寒假去哪儿了吴小咪我们一直在家哪儿也没去天气太冷了铃美是啊这几天挺冷的吴小咪我看天气预报说后天还要下雨呢会更冷铃美你吃午饭了吗没吃的话你就先去吃饭吧吴小咪我吃了对了你晚上有事吗铃美没有怎么了吴小咪那来我们家吃火锅吧铃美好啊那我先去上课我们晚上见吴小咪晚上见', 'Língměi Dàlóng zhēn qiǎo nǐ yě zài zhèr a nǐ hán jià guò de zěn me yàng Dàlóng tǐng hǎo de tīng shuō nǐ huí Rìběn guò hán jià le Língměi shì a huí qù kàn kàn wǒ bà mā Dàlóng nǐ bà mā shēn tǐ zěn me yàng Língměi tā men shēn tǐ dōu hěn hǎo xièxie duì le nǐ qù nǎr a Dàlóng wǒ zhèng yào qù shí táng chī fàn ne nǐ chī le ma Língměi chī le gāng chī wán shí táng xīn kāi le jiā chǎo cài guǎn wèi dào bù cuò nǐ chī guò ma Dàlóng hái méi ne nà wǒ yě qù shì shì Língměi nà nǐ kuài qù ba Dàlóng xíng zǒu le gǎi tiān zài liáo Wú Xiǎomī Língměi hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn a Língměi shì a Xiǎomī hǎo jiǔ bù jiàn le nǐ hán jià qù nǎr le Wú Xiǎomī wǒ men yī zhí zài jiā nǎr yě méi qù tiān qì tài lěng le Língměi shì a zhè jǐ tiān tǐng lěng de Wú Xiǎomī wǒ kàn tiān qì yù bào shuō hòu tiān hái yào xià yǔ ne huì gèng lěng Língměi nǐ chī wǔ fàn le ma méi chī de huà nǐ jiù xiān qù chī fàn ba Wú Xiǎomī wǒ chī le duì le nǐ wǎn shàng yǒu shì ma Língměi méi yǒu zěn me le Wú Xiǎomī nà lái wǒ men jiā chī huǒ guō ba Língměi hǎo a nà wǒ xiān qù shàng kè wǒ men wǎn shàng jiàn Wú Xiǎomī wǎn shàng jiàn', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><strong>（1）</strong></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真</span><span class=\"tr\">真</span><rt>zhēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncoincident \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">巧</span><span class=\"tr\">巧</span><rt>qiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèr:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这儿</span><span class=\"tr\">這兒</span><rt>zhèr</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hán jià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwinter vacation (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">寒假</span><span class=\"tr\">寒假</span><rt>hán jià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">得</span><span class=\"tr\">得</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHow about it (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquite (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">挺</span><span class=\"tr\">挺</span><rt>tǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIt is said that \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听说</span><span class=\"tr\">聽說</span><rt>tīng shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Rìběn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nJapan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日本</span><span class=\"tr\">日本</span><rt>Rìběn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspend (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hán jià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwinter vacation (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">寒假</span><span class=\"tr\">寒假</span><rt>hán jià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=