(95, 'the-address-of-husband-and-wife', 'The address of husband and wife', '夫妻的称呼', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4176.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4176-qvodzms1ba887lfphvapkxx9lgfqgohs5w3j6q0l02.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/the-address-of-husband-and-wife/', '结婚以后夫妻双方的称呼也会随之变化丈夫和妻子是最普通的可是显得太正式了再说这也只能在介绍时使用不能当面称呼爱人的字面意思是我所爱的人不管男女都可以用浪漫是浪漫可是现在有点儿过时了而且这个词也不适合当面称呼先生和太太严肃有余亲热不足一般在宴会等比较正式的场合才使用男人女人和先生太太正好是两个极端显得随便甚至有些俗气这两个词本来是用来指所有男性和女性的不知道怎么也被用来称呼自己的另一半了文化人一般不太接受另外这两种也都不适合当面称呼要给另一半找一个适合于各种场合可以作为他称又可以当面称呼既亲热又不过时的称呼真不容易老公和老婆就这样开始流行起来了老公老婆本来是方言词随着大量港台电视剧的播放这个称呼也逐渐流行起来了不管你是年轻还是年老有文化还是没文化都可以称另一半为老公老婆但也有些人不那么喜欢觉得还是太随意其实大家有不同的观点很正常使用称呼最重要的是要根据不同的场合和不同的对象进行选择', 'jié hūn yǐ hòu fū qī shuāng fāng de chēng hū yě huì suí zhī biàn huà zhàng fū hé qī zi shì zuì pǔ tōng de kě shì xiǎn de tài zhèng shì le zài shuō zhè yě zhǐ néng zài jiè shào shí shǐ yòng bù néng dāng miàn chēng hū ài rén de zì miàn yì sī shì wǒ suǒ ài de rén bù guǎn nán nǚ dōu kě yǐ yòng làng màn shì làng màn kě shì xiàn zài yǒu diǎn ér guò shí le ér qiě zhè gè cí yě bù shì hé dāng miàn chēng hū xiān shēng hé tài tài yán sù yǒu yú qīn rè bù zú yī bān zài yàn huì děng bǐ jiào zhèng shì de chǎng hé cái shǐ yòng nán rén nǚ rén hé xiān shēng tài tài zhèng hǎo shì liǎng gè jí duān xiǎn de suí biàn shèn zhì yǒu xiē sú qì zhè liǎng gè cí běn lái shì yòng lái zhǐ suǒ yǒu nán xìng hé nǚ xìng de bù zhī dào zěn me yě bèi yòng lái chēng hū zì jǐ de lìng yī bàn le wén huà rén yī bān bù tài jiē shòu lìng wài zhè liǎng zhǒng yě dōu bù shì hé dāng miàn chēng hū yào gěi lìng yī bàn zhǎo yī gè shì hé yú gè zhǒng chǎng hé kě yǐ zuò wéi tā chēng yòu kě yǐ dāng miàn chēng hū jì qīn rè yòu bù guò shí de chēng hū zhēn bù róng yì lǎo gōng hé lǎo pó jiù zhè yàng kāi shǐ liú xíng qǐ lái le lǎo gōng lǎo pó běn lái shì fāng yán cí suí zhe dà liàng gǎng tái diàn shì jù de bō fàng zhè gè chēng hū yě zhú jiàn liú xíng qǐ lái le bù guǎn nǐ shì nián qīng hái shì nián lǎo yǒu wén huà hái shì méi wén huà dōu kě yǐ chēng lìng yī bàn wéi lǎo gōng lǎo pó dàn yě yǒu xiē rén bù nà me xǐ huān jué de hái shì tài suí yì qí shí dà jiā yǒu bù tóng de guān diǎn hěn zhèng cháng shǐ yòng chēng hū zuì zhòng yào de shì yào gēn jù bù tóng de chǎng hé hé bù tóng de duì xiàng jìn xíng xuǎn zé', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jié hūn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmarry (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">结婚</span><span class=\"tr\">結婚</span><rt>jié hūn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐ hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafter (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">以后</span><span class=\"tr\">以後</span><rt>yǐ hòu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fū qī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncouple (husband and wife) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">夫妻</span><span class=\"tr\">夫妻</span><rt>fū qī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">双</span><span class=\"tr\">雙</span><rt>shuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nside (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">方</span><span class=\"tr\">方</span><rt>fāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chēng hū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\naddress (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">称呼</span><span class=\"tr\">稱呼</span><rt>chēng hū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFollow \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">随</span><span class=\"tr\">隨</span><rt>suí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nit (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">之</span><span class=\"tr\">之</span><rt>zhī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biàn huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nchange (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">变化</span><span class=\"tr\">變化</span><rt>biàn huà</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhàng fū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhusband (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">丈夫</span><span class=\"tr\">丈夫</span><rt>zhàng fū</rt></ruby></abbr>”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr>“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qī zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwife (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妻子</span><span class=\"tr\">妻子</span><rt>qī zi</rt></ruby></abbr>”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmost (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最</span><span class=\"tr\">最</span><rt>zuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pǔ tōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nordinary \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">普通</span><span class=\"tr\">普通</span><rt>pǔ tōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBut (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可是</span><span class=\"tr\">可是</span><rt>kě shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎn de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nappear (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">显得</span><span class=\"tr\">顯得</span><rt>xiǎn de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">太</span><span class=\"tr\">太</span><rt>tài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nformal (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">正式</span><span class=\"tr\">正式</span><rt>zhèng shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat\'s more \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">再说</span><span class=\"tr\">再說</span><rt>zài shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOnly (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nable (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiè shào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nintroduce (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">介绍</span><span class=\"tr\">介紹</span><rt>jiè shào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhen \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǐ yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuse (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">使用</span><span class=\"tr\">使用</span><rt>shǐ yòng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncannot \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不能</span><span class=\"tr\">不能</span><rt>bù néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dāng miàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin person (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">当面</span><span class=\"tr\">當面</span><rt>dāng miàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chēng hū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\naddress (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">称呼</span><span class=\"tr\">稱呼</span><rt>chēng hū</rt></ruby></abbr>。“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ài rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspouse \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爱人</span><span class=\"tr\">愛人</span><rt>ài rén</rt></ruby></abbr>”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zì miàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nliteral \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">字面</span><span class=\"tr\">字面</span><rt>zì miàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yì sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeaning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">意思</span><span class=\"tr\">意思</span><rt>yì sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr>“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux.) (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">所</span><span class=\"tr\">所</span><rt>suǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlove (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爱</span><span class=\"tr\">愛</span><rt>ài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr>”，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù guǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nregardless of, no matter what, how, etc. (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不管</span><span class=\"tr\">不管</span><rt>bù guǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" titl