oltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时候</span><span class=\"tr\">時候</span><rt>shí hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTogether (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一起</span><span class=\"tr\">一起</span><rt>yī qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nenjoy, admire \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">赏</span><span class=\"tr\">賞</span><rt>shǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflower (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(98, 'catch-a-train', 'Catch a train', '赶火车', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4165.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4165-qu9rdbk0w96k9pvuzpzw6hh0m9107o83178p7t0daq.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/catch-a-train/', '吴大伟我们去窗口排队取票吧吴小咪爸爸不用去我们在自助取票机上取吴大伟自助取票机怎么取吴小咪很简单您先把身份证放到取票机上然后在屏幕上点击取票您买的票就会在屏幕上显示出来最后点右下角打印车票就可以了车票会从取票机下面打印出来吴大伟现在真是方便啊不但可以在手机上买票还可以在机器上取票连排队都不用了那现在可以去检票口了吧我们在几号口吴小咪车票上有您看车票上不但有检票口还有发车时间九点半吴大伟在吴小咪爸爸看指示牌在三楼往这边走吴大伟哦好的咱们上去吧吴大伟我们几点开始检票啊吴小咪等会儿广播会通知的检票口的屏幕上也会有提示吴大伟行那我们就坐在这里等着吧对了一会儿我们把票拿给检票员就可以上车了是吧吴小咪现在都是自动检票机检票了您看大家排队进站把票放进检票机检票完成后票会从上面的出口出来门打开后您拿了票直接过去就可以了吴大伟好的明白了为什么有的人没拿车票也能过去吴小咪您也可以直接用身份证在检票机上检票不用取票这样既简单又方便吴大伟这个好也很环保我们从上海回来的时候也不取车票了刷身份证上车吴小咪好', 'Wú Dàwěi wǒ men qù chuāng kǒu pái duì qǔ piào ba Wú Xiǎomī bàba bù yòng qù wǒ men zài zì zhù qǔ piào jī shàng qǔ Wú Dàwěi zì zhù qǔ piào jī zěn me qǔ Wú Xiǎomī hěn jiǎn dān nín xiān bǎ shēn fèn zhèng fàng dào qǔ piào jī shàng rán hòu zài píng mù shàng diǎn jī qǔ piào nín mǎi de piào jiù huì zài píng mù shàng xiǎn shì chū lái zuì hòu diǎn yòu xià jiǎo dǎ yìn chē piào jiù kě yǐ le chē piào huì cóng qǔ piào jī xià miàn dǎ yìn chū lái Wú Dàwěi xiàn zài zhēn shì fāng biàn a bù dàn kě yǐ zài shǒu jī shàng mǎi piào hái kě yǐ zài jī qì shàng qǔ piào lián pái duì dōu bù yòng le nà xiàn zài kě yǐ qù jiǎn piào kǒu le ba wǒ men zài jǐ hào kǒu Wú Xiǎomī chē piào shàng yǒu nín kàn chē piào shàng bù dàn yǒu jiǎn piào kǒu hái yǒu fā chē shí jiān jiǔ diǎn bàn Wú Dàwěi zài Wú Xiǎomī bàba kàn zhǐ shì pái zài sān lóu wǎng zhè biān zǒu Wú Dàwěi ò hǎo de zán men shàng qù ba Wú Dàwěi wǒ men jǐ diǎn kāi shǐ jiǎn piào a Wú Xiǎomī děng huì ér guǎng bō huì tōng zhī de jiǎn piào kǒu de píng mù shàng yě huì yǒu tí shì Wú Dàwěi xíng nà wǒ men jiù zuò zài zhè lǐ děng zhe ba duì le yī huìr wǒ men bǎ piào ná gěi jiǎn piào yuán jiù kě yǐ shàng chē le shì ba Wú Xiǎomī xiàn zài dōu shì zì dòng jiǎn piào jī jiǎn piào le nín kàn dà jiā pái duì jìn zhàn bǎ piào fàng jìn jiǎn piào jī jiǎn piào wán chéng hòu piào huì cóng shàng miàn de chū kǒu chū lái mén dǎ kāi hòu nín ná le piào zhí jiē guò qù jiù kě yǐ le Wú Dàwěi hǎo de míng bái le wèi shén me yǒu de rén méi ná chē piào yě néng guò qù Wú Xiǎomī nín yě kě yǐ zhí jiē yòng shēn fèn zhèng zài jiǎn piào jī shàng jiǎn piào bù yòng qǔ piào zhè yàng jì jiǎn dān yòu fāng biàn Wú Dàwěi zhè gè hǎo yě hěn huán bǎo wǒ men cóng Shànghǎi huí lái de shí hòu yě bù qǔ chē piào le shuā shēn fèn zhèng shàng chē Wú Xiǎomī hǎo', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Dàwěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Dawei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴大伟</span><span class=\"tr\">吳大偉</span><rt>Wú Dàwěi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuāng kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwindow \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">窗口</span><span class=\"tr\">窗口</span><rt>chuāng kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pái duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nqueue (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">排队</span><span class=\"tr\">排隊</span><rt>pái duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPick (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">取</span><span class=\"tr\">取</span><rt>qǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"piào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nticket (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">票</span><span class=\"tr\">票</span><rt>piào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno need \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不用</span><span class=\"tr\">不用</span><rt>bù yòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zì zhù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSelf-service \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">自助</span><span class=\"tr\">自助</span><rt>zì zhù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPick (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">取</span><span class=\"tr\">取</span><rt>qǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"piào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nticket (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">票</span><span class=\"tr\">票</span><rt>piào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmachine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机</span><span class=\"tr\">機</span><rt>jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\non (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPick (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">取</span><span class=\"tr\">取</span><rt>qǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú 