(100, 'book-train-tickets', 'Book train tickets', '订火车票', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4163.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4163-qsyu09awln7i6y27x7n2bgj75kl6jcp9gothrz2pg2.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/book-train-tickets/', '吴小咪爸爸我和小宇下周考完试就放暑假了吴大伟哦那你们有什么打算吴小宇我们想去上海玩儿爸爸你觉得怎么样吴大伟上海啊现在正是上海很热的时候吧吴小咪我查了上海最近两周的气温都在度左右跟西安差不多吴小宇爸爸我们去吧再说我们家都还没去过上海呢是吧妈妈马芳我觉得可以我也想去上海看看吴大伟好吧那我们就下周去吧你们看机票了吗吴小咪我看了下周五的航班票价是元一个人有点儿贵我们看看火车票吧吴大伟坐火车要很久吧吴小咪从西安到上海要坐个小时马芳那也太久了坐飞机才三个小时吴小咪没关系我们可以买卧铺票下午点分上车睡一觉第二天下午两点多就到了硬卧块软卧块我们买硬卧票还能省些钱吴小宇我们再看看高铁票吧高铁比普通火车快你们看坐高铁只要个小时我们早上点半出发下午点半就能到马芳多少钱啊吴小宇二等座块一等座块商务座块马芳有什么不同吴小宇商务座和一等座不仅更宽敞舒服人也更少马芳商务座和一等座听起来好是好但是比二等座贵多了买二等座就可以了高铁上有吃的吗吴小宇有盒饭有块的也有块的对了也可以提前订饭马芳挺贵的那我们带点儿东西在高铁上吃下午到了上海再去饭馆吃吴小宇回程的票我们买哪天的吴大伟我们下周五去在上海玩八天够了吧可以买下下个周六的票回来吴小宇好你们把身份证号告诉我我马上订票对了哥哥跟我们一起去吗马芳他要上班去不了吴小宇好那就买我们四个人的票吴小咪你在哪个上买吗吴小宇不我在去哪儿上买我刚好有去哪儿的元优惠券', 'Wú Xiǎomī bàba wǒ hé Xiǎoyǔ xià zhōu kǎo wán shì jiù fàng shǔ jià le Wú Dàwěi ó nà nǐ men yǒu shén me dǎ suàn Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ men xiǎng qù Shànghǎi wán ér bàba nǐ jué de zěn me yàng Wú Dàwěi Shànghǎi a xiàn zài zhèng shì Shànghǎi hěn rè de shí hòu ba Wú Xiǎomī wǒ chá le Shànghǎi zuì jìn liǎng zhōu de qì wēn dōu zài dù zuǒ yòu gēn Xī’ān chà bù duō Wú Xiǎoyǔ bàba wǒ men qù ba zài shuō wǒ men jiā dōu hái méi qù guò Shànghǎi ne shì ba māma Mǎfāng wǒ jué de kě yǐ wǒ yě xiǎng qù Shànghǎi kàn kàn Wú Dàwěi hǎo ba nà wǒ men jiù xià zhōu qù ba nǐ men kàn jī piào le ma Wú Xiǎomī wǒ kàn le xià zhōu wǔ de háng bān piào jià shì yuán yī gè rén yǒu diǎnr guì wǒ men kàn kàn huǒ chē piào ba Wú Dàwěi zuò huǒ chē yào hěn jiǔ ba Wú Xiǎomī cóng Xī’ān dào Shànghǎi yào zuò gè xiǎo shí Mǎfāng nà yě tài jiǔ le zuò fēi jī cái sān gè xiǎo shí Wú Xiǎomī méi guān xì wǒ men kě yǐ mǎi wò pù piào xià wǔ diǎn fēn shàng chē shuì yī jiào dì èr tiān xià wǔ liǎng diǎn duō jiù dào le yìng wò kuài ruǎn wò kuài wǒ men mǎi yìng wò piào hái néng shěng xiē qián Wú Xiǎoyǔ wǒ men zài kàn kàn gāo tiě piào ba gāo tiě bǐ pǔ tōng huǒ chē kuài nǐ men kàn zuò gāo tiě zhǐ yào gè xiǎo shí wǒ men zǎo shàng diǎn bàn chū fā xià wǔ diǎn bàn jiù néng dào Mǎfāng duō shǎo qián a Wú Xiǎoyǔ èr děng zuò kuài yī děng zuò kuài shāng wù zuò kuài Mǎfāng yǒu shén me bù tóng Wú Xiǎoyǔ shāng wù zuò hé yī děng zuò bù jǐn gèng kuān chǎng shū fú rén yě gèng shǎo Mǎfāng shāng wù zuò hé yī děng zuò tīng qǐ lái hǎo shì hǎo dàn shì bǐ èr děng zuò guì duō le mǎi èr děng zuò jiù kě yǐ le gāo tiě shàng yǒu chī de ma Wú Xiǎoyǔ yǒu hé fàn yǒu kuài de yě yǒu kuài de duì le yě kě yǐ tí qián dìng fàn Mǎfāng tǐng guì de nà wǒ men dài diǎn ér dōng xī zài gāo tiě shàng chī xià wǔ dào le Shànghǎi zài qù fàn guǎn chī Wú Xiǎoyǔ huí chéng de piào wǒ men mǎi nǎ tiān de Wú Dàwěi wǒ men xià zhōu wǔ qù zài Shànghǎi wán bā tiān gòu le ba kě yǐ mǎi xià xià gè zhōu liù de piào huí lái Wú Xiǎoyǔ hǎo nǐ men bǎ shēn fèn zhèng hào gào sù wǒ wǒ mǎ shàng dìng piào duì le gē gē gēn wǒ men yī qǐ qù ma Mǎfāng tā yào shàng bān qù bù liǎo Wú Xiǎoyǔ hǎo nà jiù mǎi wǒ men sì gè rén de piào Wú Xiǎomī nǐ zài nǎ gè shàng mǎi ma Wú Xiǎoyǔ bù wǒ zài qù nǎr shàng mǎi wǒ gāng hǎo yǒu qù nǎr de yuán yōu huì quàn', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">小宇</span><rt>Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnext (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweek \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周</span><span class=\"tr\">周</span><rt>zhōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto take a test \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">考</span><span class=\"tr\">考</span><rt>kǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nover (complement) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">完</span><span class=\"tr\">完</span><rt>wán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntest (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">试</span><span class=\"tr\">試</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">放</span><span class=\"tr\">放</span><rt>fàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsummer \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">暑</span><span class=\"tr\">暑</span><rt>shǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvacation (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">假</span><span class=\"tr\">假</span><rt>jià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Dàwěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Dawei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴大伟</span><span class=\"tr\">吳大偉</span><rt>Wú Dàwěi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noh (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哦</span><span class=\"tr\">哦</span><rt>ó</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ suàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打算</span><span class=\"tr\">打算</span><rt>dǎ suàn</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎoyǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaoyu \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小宇</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小宇</span><rt>Wú Xiǎoyǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Shànghǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nShanghai \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上海</span><span class=\"tr\">上海</span><rt>Shànghǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wán ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplay (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">玩儿</span><span class=\"tr\">玩兒</span><rt>wán ér</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndad (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">爸爸</span><span class=\"tr\">爸爸</span><rt>bàba</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jué de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto think, to feel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">觉得</span><span class=\"tr\">覺得</span><rt>jué de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zěn me yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHow about it (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">怎么样</span><span class=\"tr\">怎麽樣</span><rt>zěn me yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Dàwěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Dawei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴大伟</span><span class=\"tr\">吳大偉</span><rt>Wú Dàwěi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Shànghǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nShanghai \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上海</span><span class=\"tr\">上海</span><rt>Shànghǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>……<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">正</span><span class=\"tr\">正</span><rt>zhèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Shànghǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nShanghai \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上海</span><span class=\"tr\">上海</span><rt>Shànghǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhot (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">热</span><span class=\"tr\">熱</span><rt>rè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</spa