(101, 'airport-4-unexpected-meeting', 'Airport (4) – Unexpected meeting', '机场 (4) – ', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4162.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4162-qrwijxoxe3yy2yg8briy5kgzpfzw6dnw4wwmr8xhsi.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/airport-4-unexpected-meeting/', '大龙铃美你怎么在这儿铃美大龙你也来上海了大龙杨达达邀请我来他们家玩儿了几天你呢铃美我来上海工作今天打算回西安你也回西安吗大龙对你也是坐航班吧铃美没错大龙那真是太巧了我们坐同一趟航班回西安机场广播乘坐航班的旅客请注意我们抱歉地通知您由于天气原因您乘坐的航班不能按时起飞起飞时间待定请您在候机厅等候登机时间我们将广播通知谢谢铃美哎呀飞机晚点了大龙最近总是下雨你看外面这会儿雨下得挺大的铃美估计要等一两个小时才能登机大龙那我们去星巴克边喝咖啡边等吧铃美好的', 'Dàlóng Língměi nǐ zěn me zài zhèr Língměi Dàlóng nǐ yě lái Shànghǎi le Dàlóng Yáng Dádá yāo qǐng wǒ lái tā men jiā wánr le jǐ tiān nǐ ne Língměi wǒ lái Shànghǎi gōng zuò jīn tiān dǎ suàn huí Xī’ān nǐ yě huí Xī’ān ma Dàlóng duì nǐ yě shì zuò háng bān ba Língměi méi cuò Dàlóng nà zhēn shì tài qiǎo le wǒ men zuò tóng yī tàng háng bān huí Xī’ān jī chǎng guǎng bō chéng zuò háng bān de lǚ kè qǐng zhù yì wǒ men bào qiàn de tōng zhī nín yóu yú tiān qì yuán yīn nín chéng zuò de háng bān bù néng àn shí qǐ fēi qǐ fēi shí jiān dài dìng qǐng nín zài hòu jī tīng děng hòu dēng jī shí jiān wǒ men jiāng guǎng bō tōng zhī xiè xiè Língměi āi ya fēi jī wǎn diǎn le Dàlóng zuì jìn zǒng shì xià yǔ nǐ kàn wài miàn zhè huì ér yǔ xià de tǐng dà de Língměi gū jì yào děng yī liǎng gè xiǎo shí cái néng dēng jī Dàlóng nà wǒ men qù Xīngbākè biān hē kā fēi biān děng ba Língměi hǎo de', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></