\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Shànghǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nShanghai \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上海</span><span class=\"tr\">上海</span><rt>Shànghǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ suàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIntend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打算</span><span class=\"tr\">打算</span><rt>dǎ suàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xī’ān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXi\'an \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">西安</span><span class=\"tr\">西安</span><rt>Xī’ān</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreturn (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回</span><span class=\"tr\">回</span><rt>huí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xī’ān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXi\'an \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">西安</span><span class=\"tr\">西安</span><rt>Xī’ān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake off (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坐</span><span class=\"tr\">坐</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>CZ3524<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"háng bān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflight (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">航班</span><span class=\"tr\">航班</span><rt>háng bān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi cuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat\'s right \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没错</span><span class=\"tr\">沒錯</span><rt>méi cuò</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真</span>