span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChance (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机会</span><span class=\"tr\">機會</span><rt>jī huì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǔ lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmake effort (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">努力</span><span class=\"tr\">努力</span><rt>nǔ lì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(104, 'online-shopping-returns', 'Online shopping returns', '网购退货', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4159.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4159-qpxhy3zvbz4kl4iykwpcrzr682pybjvmrz58lubwpe.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/online-shopping-returns/', '大龙你好我在你们店买的东西有问题售后您好您有两个订单请问您哪个订单有问题呢大龙两个都有问题衣服太大鞋子太小售后我们是七天无理由退换货的您想退货还是换货呢大龙换货怎么换要几天售后您买了运费险吗大龙我买了售后您已经买了运费险那就不需要付运费您先选择退货再把要退的东西寄回来给我们邮费选择到付就行了我们收到货以后就会给您发新的时间一般一周左右大龙我可以先退了再买吗售后可以那您选择退货吧七天之内把东西寄回来如果不影响二次销售的话我们就给您退款大龙我先选择退货再把东西寄回去然后重新下单就行了售后是的大龙我不需要付运费售后是的大龙好的谢谢售后不客气', 'Dàlóng nǐ hǎo wǒ zài nǐ men diàn mǎi de dōngxi yǒu wèn tí shòu hòu nín hǎo nín yǒu liǎng gè dìng dān qǐng wèn nín nǎ gè dìng dān yǒu wèn tí ne Dàlóng liǎng gè dōu yǒu wèn tí yī fú tài dà xié zi tài xiǎo shòu hòu wǒ men shì qī tiān wú lǐ yóu tuì huàn huò de nín xiǎng tuì huò hái shì huàn huò ne Dàlóng huàn huò zěn me huàn yào jǐ tiān shòu hòu nín mǎi le yùn fèi xiǎn ma Dàlóng wǒ mǎi le shòu hòu nín yǐ jīng mǎi le yùn fèi xiǎn nà jiù bù xū yào fù yùn fèi nín xiān xuǎn zé tuì huò zài bǎ yào tuì de dōngxi jì huí lái gěi wǒ men yóu fèi xuǎn zé dào fù jiù xíng le wǒ men shōu dào huò yǐ hòu jiù huì gěi nín fā xīn de shí jiān yī bān yī zhōu zuǒ yòu Dàlóng wǒ kě yǐ xiān tuì le zài mǎi ma shòu hòu kě yǐ nà nín xuǎn zé tuì huò ba qī tiān zhī nèi bǎ dōngxi jì huí lái rú guǒ bù yǐng xiǎng èr cì xiāo shòu de huà wǒ men jiù gěi nín tuì kuǎn Dàlóng wǒ xiān xuǎn zé tuì huò zài bǎ dōngxi jì huí qù rán hòu chóng xīn xià dān jiù xíng le shòu hòu shì de Dàlóng wǒ bù xū yào fù yùn fèi shòu hòu shì de Dàlóng hǎo de xiè xiè shòu hòu bù kèqi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHello \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你好</span><span class=\"tr\">你好</span><rt>nǐ hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshop, store \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">店</span><span class=\"tr\">店</span><rt>diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōngxi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōngxi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèn tí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nproblem (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">问题</span><span class=\"tr\">問題</span><rt>wèn tí</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shòu hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAfter-sales \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">售后</span><span class=\"tr\">售後</span><rt>shòu hòu</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHello \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您好</span><span class=\"tr\">您好</span><rt>nín hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n