(105, 'after-sales-service', 'After-sales service', '售后服务', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4158.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4158-qp47c8latmpk1g2oly8tojradno8klzwacs78mphsi.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/after-sales-service/', '铃美您好这里是超市服务台吗服务员是的请问有什么可以帮您铃美我在你们超市买了一个吹风机昨天我一打开突然就坏了服务员吹风机您带来了吗让我看看铃美在这儿服务员不好意思女士这个吹风机确实坏了您是什么时候买的铃美上个星期买的服务员您有发票吗铃美我只有购物小票服务员小票也可以我看一下是的您是在我们这儿买的是这样的这款吹风机您可以选择换货或者维修铃美不能退吗服务员您买的是特价商品包装一打开就不能退了只能七天内无条件换货或者维修铃美如果维修的话要几天服务员一般是三到五天一修好我们就给您打电话铃美但是我今天就需要用我想换一个新的服务员没问题您稍等铃美好的服务员不好意思女士您的这款吹风机是特价商品已经卖完了我们给您换了另外一款这款比原来那款贵一点您看可以吗铃美我要多付钱吗服务员不用另外这是元超市优惠券作为我们对您的补偿给您带来了不便我们非常抱歉铃美没关系服务员如果新的吹风机有任何问题您也可以再来一年内免费维修铃美谢谢你我对你们的售后服务很满意', 'Língměi nín hǎo zhè lǐ shì chāo shì fú wù tái ma fú wù yuán shì de qǐng wèn yǒu shén me kě yǐ bāng nín Língměi wǒ zài nǐ men chāo shì mǎi le yī gè chuī fēng jī zuó tiān wǒ yī dǎ kāi tū rán jiù huài le fú wù yuán chuī fēng jī nín dài lái le ma ràng wǒ kàn kàn Língměi zài zhè ér fú wù yuán bù hǎo yì sī nǚ shì zhè gè chuī fēng jī què shí huài le nín shì shén me shí hòu mǎi de Língměi shàng gè xīng qī mǎi de fú wù yuán nín yǒu fā piào ma Língměi wǒ zhǐ yǒu gòu wù xiǎo piào fú wù yuán xiǎo piào yě kě yǐ wǒ kàn yī xià shì de nín shì zài wǒ men zhè ér mǎi de shì zhè yàng de zhè kuǎn chuī fēng jī nín kě yǐ xuǎn zé huàn huò huò zhě wéi xiū Língměi bù néng tuì ma fú wù yuán nín mǎi de shì tè jià shāng pǐn bāo zhuāng yī dǎ kāi jiù bù néng tuì le zhǐ néng qī tiān nèi wú tiáo jiàn huàn huò huò zhě wéi xiū Língměi rú guǒ wéi xiū de huà yào jǐ tiān fú wù yuán yī bān shì sān dào wǔ tiān yī xiū hǎo wǒ men jiù gěi nín dǎ diàn huà Língměi dàn shì wǒ jīn tiān jiù xū yào yòng wǒ xiǎng huàn yī gè xīn de fú wù yuán méi wèn tí nín shāo děng Língměi hǎo de fú wù yuán bù hǎo yì sī nǚ shì nín de zhè kuǎn chuī fēng jī shì tè jià shāng pǐn yǐ jīng mài wán le wǒ men gěi nín huàn le lìng wài yī kuǎn zhè kuǎn bǐ yuán lái nà kuǎn guì yī diǎn nín kàn kě yǐ ma Língměi wǒ yào duō fù qián ma fú wù yuán bù yòng lìng wài zhè shì yuán chāo shì yōu huì quàn zuò wéi wǒ men duì nín de bǔ cháng gěi nín dài lái le bù biàn wǒ men fēi cháng bào qiàn Língměi méi guān xì fú wù yuán rú guǒ xīn de chuī fēng jī yǒu rèn hé wèn tí nín yě kě yǐ zài lái yī nián nèi miǎn fèi wéi xiū Língměi xiè xiè nǐ wǒ duì nǐ men de shòu hòu fú wù hěn mǎn yì', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHello\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您好</span><span class=\"tr\">您好</span><rt>nín hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这里</span><span class=\"tr\">這裏</span><rt>zhè lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chāo shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsupermarket (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">超市</span><span class=\"tr\">超市</span><rt>chāo shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nServe\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">服务</span><span class=\"tr\">服務</span><rt>fú wù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstand (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">台</span><span class=\"tr\">台</span><rt>tái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú wù yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwaiter (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">服务员</span><span class=\"tr\">服務員</span><rt>fú wù yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYes\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是的</span><span class=\"tr\">是的</span><rt>shì de</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng wèn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease may I ask\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请问</span><span class=\"tr\">請問</span><rt>qǐng wèn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhelp\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">帮</span><span class=\"tr\">幫</span><rt>bāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chāo shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsupermarket (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">超市</span><span class=\"tr\">超市</span><rt>chāo shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuī fēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhair dryer\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吹风机</span><span class=\"tr\">吹風機</span><rt>chuī fēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuó tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyesterday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">昨天</span><span class=\"tr\">昨天</span><rt>zuó tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nas soon as (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎ kāi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOpen\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">打开</span><span class=\"tr\">打開</span><rt>dǎ kāi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tū rán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsuddenly (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">突然</span><span class=\"tr\">突然</span><rt>tū rán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbroken (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坏</span><span class=\"tr\">壞</span><rt>huài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú wù yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwaiter (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">服务员</span><span class=\"tr\">服務員</span><rt>fú wù yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuī fēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhair dryer\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吹风机</span><span class=\"tr\">吹風機</span><rt>chuī fēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbring (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncome (complement) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlet (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave a look\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看看</span><span class=\"tr\">看看</span><rt>kàn kàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span c