ì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIt doesn\'t matter (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没关系</span><span class=\"tr\">沒關係</span><rt>méi guān xì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú wù yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwaiter (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">服务员</span><span class=\"tr\">服務員</span><rt>fú wù yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rú guǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nif (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">如果</span><span class=\"tr\">如果</span><rt>rú guǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnew (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">新</span><span class=\"tr\">新</span><rt>xīn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuī fēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhair dryer\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吹风机</span><span class=\"tr\">吹風機</span><rt>chuī fēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nany (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">任何</span><span class=\"tr\">任何</span><rt>rèn hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèn tí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nproblem (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">问题</span><span class=\"tr\">問題</span><rt>wèn tí</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAgain (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">再</span><span class=\"tr\">再</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwithin (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">内</span><span class=\"tr\">內</span><rt>nèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miǎn fèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfree (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">免费</span><span class=\"tr\">免費</span><rt>miǎn fèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wéi xiū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrepair (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">维修</span><span class=\"tr\">維修</span><rt>wéi xiū</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你们</span><span class=\"tr\">你們</span><rt>nǐ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsale\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">售</span><span class=\"tr\">售</span><rt>shòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafter\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">后</span><span class=\"tr\">後</span><rt>hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nservice\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">服务</span><span class=\"tr\">服務</span><rt>fú wù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎn yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsatisfy (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">满意</span><span class=\"tr\">滿意</span><rt>mǎn yì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(106, 'online-shopping-is-cheap-and-convenient', 'Online shopping is cheap and convenient', '网购又便宜又方便', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4157.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4157-qos1km1usuywwtt6r9ky0xoiuuv4bgdgjg4oq7nv4i.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/online-shopping-is-cheap-and-convenient/', '大龙小咪我刚才拿到了银行卡你能教我网购吗吴小咪当然可以你先在手机上下载支付宝注册一个新账号大龙好了然后呢吴小咪你点这里绑定你的银行卡大龙好了吴小咪现在你可以下载淘宝然后登录登录账号跟支付宝的一样大龙现在可以买东西了吗吴小咪跟你们美国的购物网站差不多你先搜索想买的东西再点进去看看具体的内容比如其他人的评价然后你可以点购买或者你点左边加入购物车最后付钱对了不要忘了填写你的地址大龙我怎么才能知道这个东西好不好呢吴小咪你看这里可以选择按照信用从高到低展示产品一般来说信用越高产品质量越好除了看信用你还可以看看其他人的评价大龙让我试试我先搜电动拖把价格就选两三百的吧再选择按照信用排序这个看起来不错然后点进去看看评价评价看起来都不错小咪你觉得呢我就买这个吴小咪哎呀大龙你看这是预售发货时间要半个月以后呢大龙半个月这对我来说太慢了吴小咪你换另外一个看这家有现货上面写着小时内发货而且发货地离我们很近大龙听起来挺快的我来付钱快递几天可以到呢吴小咪一般来说三天左右现在快递比较快经常一两天就到了大龙网购真是又便宜又方便啊其他的购物网站也是这样吗吴小咪跟淘宝一样你也可以从别的地方买东西大龙谢谢你下次我试试别的', 'Dàlóng Xiǎomī wǒ gāng cái ná dào le yín háng kǎ nǐ néng jiāo wǒ wǎng gòu ma Wú Xiǎomī dāng rán kě yǐ nǐ xiān zài shǒu jī shàng xià zài zhī fù bǎo zhù cè yī gè xīn zhàng hào Dàlóng hǎo le rán hòu ne Wú Xiǎomī nǐ diǎn zhè lǐ bǎng dìng nǐ de yín háng kǎ Dàlóng hǎo le Wú Xiǎomī xiàn zài nǐ kě yǐ xià zài táo bǎo rán hòu dēng lù dēng lù zhàng hào gēn zhī fù bǎo de yī yàng Dàlóng xiàn zài kě yǐ mǎi dōng xī le ma Wú Xiǎomī gēn nǐ men měi guó de gòu wù wǎng zhàn chà bù duō nǐ xiān sōu suǒ xiǎng mǎi de dōng xī zài diǎn jìn qù kàn kàn jù tǐ de nèi róng bǐ rú qí tā rén de píng jià rán hòu nǐ kě yǐ diǎn gòu mǎi huò zhě nǐ diǎn zuǒ biān jiā rù gòu wù chē zuì hòu fù qián duì le bù yào wàng le tián xiě nǐ de dì zhǐ Dàlóng wǒ zěn me cái néng zhī dào zhè gè dōngxi hǎo bù hǎo ne Wú Xiǎomī nǐ kàn zhè lǐ kě yǐ xuǎn zé àn zhào xìn yòng cóng gāo dào dī zhǎn shì chǎn pǐn yī bān lái shuō xìn yòng yuè gāo chǎn pǐn zhì liàng yuè hǎo chú le kàn xìn yòng nǐ hái kě yǐ kàn kàn qí tā rén de píng jià Dàlóng ràng wǒ shì shì wǒ xiān sōu diàn dòng tuō bǎ jià gé jiù xuǎn liǎng sān bǎi de ba zài xuǎn zé àn zhào xìn yòng pái xù zhè gè kàn qǐ lái bù cuò rán hòu diǎn jìn qù kàn kàn píng jià píng jià kàn qǐ lái dōu bù cuò Xiǎomī nǐ jué de ne wǒ jiù mǎi zhè gè Wú Xiǎomī āi ya Dàlóng nǐ kàn zhè shì yù shòu fā huò shí jiān yào bàn gè yuè yǐ hòu ne Dàlóng bàn gè yuè zhè duì wǒ lái shuō tài màn le Wú Xiǎomī nǐ huàn lìng wài yī gè kàn zhè jiā yǒu xiàn huò shàng miàn xiě zhe xiǎo shí nèi fā huò ér qiě fā huò dì lí wǒ men hěn jìn Dàlóng tīng qǐ lái tǐng kuài de wǒ lái fù qián kuài dì jǐ tiān kě yǐ dào ne Wú Xiǎomī yī bān lái shuō sān tiān zuǒ yòu xiàn zài kuài dì bǐ jiào kuài jīng cháng yī liǎng tiān jiù dào le Dàlóng wǎng gòu zhēn shì yòu piányi yòu fāng biàn a qí tā de gòu wù wǎng zhàn yě shì zhè yàng ma Wú Xiǎomī gēn táo bǎo yī yàng nǐ yě kě yǐ cóng bié de dì fāng mǎi dōngxi Dàlóng xiè xiè nǐ xià cì wǒ shì shì bié de', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">小咪</span><rt>Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāng cái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nJust now (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">刚才</span><span class=\"tr\">剛才</span><rt>gāng cái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ná:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拿</span><span class=\"tr\">拿</span><rt>ná</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"l