<rt>fù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmoney (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱</span><span class=\"tr\">錢</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài dì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexpress delivery\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快递</span><span class=\"tr\">快遞</span><rt>kuài dì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSeveral (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī bān lái shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGenerally speaking\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一般来说</span><span class=\"tr\">一般來說</span><rt>yī bān lái shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuǒ yòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nabout (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">左右</span><span class=\"tr\">左右</span><rt>zuǒ yòu</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;b