SK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">网站</span><span class=\"tr\">網站</span><rt>wǎng zhàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这样</span><span class=\"tr\">這樣</span><rt>zhè yàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">跟</span><span class=\"tr\">跟</span><rt>gēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"táo bǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTaobao\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">淘宝</span><span class=\"tr\">淘寶</span><rt>táo bǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSame (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一样</span><span class=\"tr\">一樣</span><rt>yī yàng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bié de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOthers\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">别的</span><span class=\"tr\">別的</span><rt>bié de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì fāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplace (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地方</span><span class=\"tr\">地方</span><rt>dì fāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōngxi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthing, stuff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东西</span><span class=\"tr\">東西</span><rt>dōngxi</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnext (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">下</span><span class=\"tr\">下</span><rt>xià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntry\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">试试</span><span class=\"tr\">試試</span><rt>shì shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bié de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOthers\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">别的</span><span class=\"tr\">別的</span><rt>bié de</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(107, 'buying-shoes-2', 'Buying shoes (2)', '买鞋 （2', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4156.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4156-qnpbtw9hi9kd73dvuyvsucm8annkli87hnqy167qko.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/buying-shoes-2/', '铃美小咪这双白色的好看吗吴小咪它是网面的秋天穿有点冷我觉得那双粉色的比这双厚一点铃美我试试哎呀有点小吴小咪麻烦拿双大点儿的售货员您稍等铃美行这双鞋子今天打折吗售货员这是秋季新款不打折吴小咪如果喜欢你就买吧铃美太贵了再试试别的吧吴小咪这双黑的呢看起来也很不错售货员您真有眼光这双鞋子是专门跑步的是今年最受欢迎的跑鞋它使用了高科技面料又保暖又轻便不仅防水还很容易清洗不管您跑多久都不会觉得累铃美我觉得穿着正好价格也合适就要这双吧售货员需要帮您包起来吗铃美我直接穿着吧今天穿高跟鞋走了很久现在脚有点痛穿运动鞋比高跟鞋舒服多了售货员好的那我帮您把高跟鞋包起来您用支付宝还是微信信用卡或者现金也可以铃美微信吧售货员感谢您的消费这是我们送的三小时免费停车券您可以在停车场直接用吴小咪这个停车券地下停车场可以用吗售货员可以的付钱的时候您把停车券放在机器上扫一下就可以了吴小咪铃美谢谢', 'Língměi Xiǎomī zhè shuāng bái sè de hǎo kàn ma Wú Xiǎomī tā shì wǎng miàn de qiū tiān chuān yǒu diǎn lěng wǒ jué de nà shuāng fěn sè de bǐ zhè shuāng hòu yī diǎn Língměi wǒ shì shì āi ya yǒu diǎn xiǎo Wú Xiǎomī má fán ná shuāng dà diǎn ér de shòu huò yuán nín shāo děng Língměi xíng zhè shuāng xié zi jīn tiān dǎ zhé ma shòu huò yuán zhè shì qiū jì xīn kuǎn bù dǎ zhé Wú Xiǎomī rú guǒ xǐ huān nǐ jiù mǎi ba Língměi tài guì le zài shì shì bié de ba Wú Xiǎomī zhè shuāng hēi de ne kàn qǐ lái yě hěn bù cuò shòu huò yuán nín zhēn yǒu yǎn guāng zhè shuāng xié zi shì zhuān mén pǎo bù de shì jīn nián zuì shòu huān yíng de pǎo xié tā shǐ yòng le gāo kē jì miàn liào yòu bǎo nuǎn yòu qīng biàn bù jǐn fáng shuǐ hái hěn róng yì qīng xǐ bù guǎn nín pǎo duō jiǔ dōu bù huì jué de lèi Língměi wǒ jué de chuān zhe zhèng hǎo jià gé yě hé shì jiù yào zhè shuāng ba shòu huò yuán xū yào bāng nín bāo qǐ lái ma Língměi wǒ zhí jiē chuān zhe ba jīn tiān chuān gāo gēn xié zǒu le hěn jiǔ xiàn zài jiǎo yǒu diǎn tòng chuān yùn dòng xié bǐ gāo gēn xié shū fú duō le shòu huò yuán hǎo de nà wǒ bāng nín bǎ gāo gēn xié bāo qǐ lái nín yòng zhī fù bǎo hái shì wēi xìn xìn yòng kǎ huò zhě xiàn jīn yě kě yǐ Língměi wēi xìn ba shòu huò yuán gǎn xiè nín de xiāo fèi zhè shì wǒ men sòng de sān xiǎo shí miǎn fèi tíng chē quàn nín kě yǐ zài tíng chē chǎng zhí jiē yòng Wú Xiǎomī zhè gè tíng chē quàn dì xià tíng chē chǎng kě yǐ yòng ma shòu huò yuán kě yǐ de fù qián de shí hòu nín bǎ tíng chē quàn fàng zài jī qì shàng sǎo yī xià jiù kě yǐ le Wú Xiǎomī Língměi xiè xiè', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><strong>（1）</strong></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">小咪</span><rt>Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) pair (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">双</span><span class=\"tr\">雙</span><rt>shuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bái sè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhite\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">白色</span><span class=\"tr\">白色</span><rt>bái sè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo kàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npretty\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好看</span><span class=\"tr\">好看</span><rt>hǎo kàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nit (H