(108, 'buying-shoes-1', 'Buying shoes (1)', '买鞋 （1', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/4155.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/4155-qn6l62v47pdizeslnfcw6ao5ln7m5za284mofu03m0.jpg', '', 'HSK4', 'https://mandarinbean.com/buying-shoes-1/', '铃美小咪你要买新鞋子吗我打算买双靴子再买双运动鞋吴小咪我上个月买了好几双鞋今天不买了你想买什么靴子布的还是皮的铃美我早想好了买双黑色皮靴百搭又时尚秋天经常下小雨皮的比布的好吴小咪这个牌子的鞋很有名我们进去看看吴小咪铃美你看这双黑靴子看起来不错铃美我也对它一见钟情快让我试试吴小咪你穿上刚好很适合你铃美我看看价格嗯也不贵就买它了吴小咪没想到这么快就买到一双靴子铃美我也没想到我们再看看运动鞋吧', 'Língměi Xiǎomī nǐ yào mǎi xīn xié zi ma wǒ dǎ suàn mǎi shuāng xuē zi zài mǎi shuāng yùn dòng xié Wú Xiǎomī wǒ shàng gè yuè mǎi le hǎo jǐ shuāng xié jīn tiān bù mǎi le nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me xuē zi bù de hái shì pí de Língměi wǒ zǎo xiǎng hǎo le mǎi shuāng hēi sè pí xuē bǎi dā yòu shí shàng qiū tiān jīng cháng xià xiǎo yǔ pí de bǐ bù de hǎo Wú Xiǎomī zhè gè pái zi de xié hěn yǒu míng wǒ men jìn qù kàn kàn Wú Xiǎomī Língměi nǐ kàn zhè shuāng hēi xuē zi kàn qǐ lái bù cuò Língměi wǒ yě duì tā yī jiàn zhōng qíng kuài ràng wǒ shì shì Wú Xiǎomī nǐ chuān shàng gāng hǎo hěn shì hé nǐ Língměi wǒ kàn kàn jià gé ńg yě bù guì jiù mǎi tā le Wú Xiǎomī méi xiǎng dào zhè me kuài jiù mǎi dào yī shuāng xuē zi Língměi wǒ yě méi xiǎng dào wǒ men zài kàn kàn yùn dòng xié ba', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><strong>（1）</strong></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">小咪</span><rt>Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>