tip\" title=\"pí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nleather\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">皮</span><span class=\"tr\">皮</span><rt>pí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nearlier\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早</span><span class=\"tr\">早</span><rt>zǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) pair (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">双</span><span class=\"tr\">雙</span><rt>shuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hēi sè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nblack\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">黑色</span><span class=\"tr\">黑色</span><rt>hēi sè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nleather\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">皮</span><span class=\"tr\">皮</span><rt>pí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xuē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboots\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">靴</span><span class=\"tr\">靴</span><rt>xuē</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr r