/span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú wù yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwaiter (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">服务员</span><span class=\"tr\">服務員</span><rt>fú wù yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMadam (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女士</span><span class=\"tr\">女士</span><rt>nǚ shì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshop\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">店</span><span class=\"tr\">店</span><rt>diàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninside (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裏</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèi shēng jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbathroom (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">卫生间</span><span class=\"tr\">衛生間</span><rt>wèi shēng jiān</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū mén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo out\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">出门</span><span class=\"tr\">出門</span><rt>chū mén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntowards (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">往</span><span class=\"tr\">往</span><rt>wǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLeft\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">左</span><span class=\"tr\">左</span><rt>zuǒ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī zhí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nall the wat (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一直</span><span class=\"tr\">一直</span><rt>yī zhí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwalk (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">走</span><span class=\"tr\">走</span><rt>zǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe end\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">头</span><span class=\"tr\">頭</span><rt>tóu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèi shēng jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbathroom (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">卫生间</span><span class=\"tr\">衛生間</span><rt>wèi shēng jiān</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎ shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nimmediately (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">马上</span><span class=\"tr\">馬上</span><rt>mǎ shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncome back\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回来</span><span class=\"tr\">回來</span><rt>huí lái</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(112, 'the-best-exercise-for-losing-weight', 'The Best Exercise for Losing Weight', '最好的减肥运动', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5166.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5166-rbqul19q9l0znpk7aibttfx98oietdkqc4ctcvzwec.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/the-best-exercise-for-losing-weight/', '据生命时报报道美国有一些运动专家做了一个减肥运动排行榜跳绳是第一名然后是跑步跆拳道骑车等跳绳一小时可以让身体燃烧很多热量如果你每分钟跳下一小时可以减少到千卡跳绳可以让你身体更有力让你走路跑步更好看让你不容易累让心跳更有力跳绳也对骨头有好处可以让骨头更结实不容易生病刚开始跳绳时可以慢慢跳每次跳到秒等你跳得好了就可以跳得快一点时间长一点这样可以让你减少更多热量跳绳要在好的地方跳比如草地木地板泥地不要在水泥地上跳这样对腿不好也容易头晕跳绳前要动动脚腿手让身体热起来跳完后也要做放松运动', 'jù Shēngmìng Shíbào bào dào Měiguó yǒu yī xiē yùn dòng zhuān jiā zuò le yī gè jiǎn féi yùn dòng pái háng bǎng tiào shéng shì dì yī míng rán hòu shì pǎo bù tái quán dào qí chē děng tiào shéng yī xiǎo shí kě yǐ ràng shēn tǐ rán shāo hěn duō rè liàng rú guǒ nǐ měi fēn zhōng tiào xià yī xiǎo shí kě yǐ jiǎn shǎo dào qiān kǎ tiào shéng kě yǐ ràng nǐ shēn tǐ gèng yǒu lì ràng nǐ zǒu lù pǎo bù gèng hǎo kàn ràng nǐ bù róng yì lèi ràng xīn tiào gèng yǒu lì tiào shéng yě duì gǔ tou yǒu hǎo chù kě yǐ ràng gǔ tou gèng jiē shí bù róng yì shēng bìng gāng kāi shǐ tiào shéng shí kě yǐ màn màn tiào měi cì tiào dào miǎo děng nǐ tiào de hǎo le jiù kě yǐ tiào de kuài yī diǎn shí jiān cháng yī diǎn zhè yàng kě yǐ ràng nǐ jiǎn shǎo gèng duō rè liàng tiào shéng yào zài hǎo de dì fāng tiào bǐ rú cǎo dì mù dì bǎn ní dì bù yào zài shuǐ ní dì shàng tiào zhè yàng duì tuǐ bù hǎo yě róng yì tóu yūn tiào shéng qián yào dòng dòng jiǎo tuǐ shǒu ràng shēn tǐ rè qǐ lái tiào wán hòu yě yào zuò fàng sōng yùn dòng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAccording to \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">据</span><span class=\"tr\">據</span><rt>jù</rt></ruby></abbr>《 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Shēngmìng Shíbào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLife Times \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生命时报</span><span class=\"tr\">生命時報</span><rt>Shēngmìng Shíbào</rt></ruby></abbr>》 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bào dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreported (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">报道</span><span class=\"tr\">報道</span><rt>bào dào</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Měiguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAmerica \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">美国</span><span class=\"tr\">美國</span><rt>Měiguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsome \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yùn dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsports, movement (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">运动</span><span class=\"tr\">運動</span><rt>yùn dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhuān jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexperts (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">专家</span><span class=\"tr\">專家</span><rt>zhuān jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndo, make (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎn féi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweight loss (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">减肥</span><span class=\"tr\">减肥</span><rt>jiǎn féi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yùn dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsp