pan class=\"tr\">不好</span><rt>bù hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"róng yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neasy to (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">容易</span><span class=\"tr\">容易</span><rt>róng yì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóu yūn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndizzy \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">头晕</span><span class=\"tr\">頭暈</span><rt>tóu yūn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiào shéng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nRope skipping \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">跳绳</span><span class=\"tr\">跳繩</span><rt>tiào shéng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbefore \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dòng dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmove \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">动动</span><span class=\"tr\">動動</span><rt>dòng dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfeet (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">脚</span><span class=\"tr\">脚</span><rt>jiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tuǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlegs (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">腿</span><span class=\"tr\">腿</span><rt>tuǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhands \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手</span><span class=\"tr\">手</span><rt>shǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlet (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēn tǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbody (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">身体</span><span class=\"tr\">身體</span><rt>shēn tǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwarm