ass=\"si\">想法</span><span class=\"tr\">想法</span><rt>xiǎng fǎ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlet (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"běn dì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlocal \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">本地</span><span class=\"tr\">本地</span><rt>běn dì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tōng guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthought, via (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">通过</span><span class=\"tr\">通過</span><rt>tōng guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cān jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njoin (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">参加</span><span class=\"tr\">參加</span><rt>cān jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bié rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nother people (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">别人</span><span class=\"tr\">別人</span><rt>bié rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hūn lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwedding (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">婚礼</span><span class=\"tr\">婚禮</span><rt>hūn lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rènshi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nknow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">认识</span><span class=\"tr\">認識</span><rt>rènshi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnew (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">新</span><span class=\"tr\">新</span><rt>xīn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péng yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriend (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(114, 'saying-thank-you-to-ai', 'Saying “Thank You” to AI', '对AI说“谢谢”', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5164.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5164-r8jht4phiqxfluihqcpd980cf6if65bg0amv48zufo.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/saying-thank-you-to-ai/', '尽管我们知道在和的交流中的回答是一串被训练出来的字节组合但是很多人依然会说请或者谢谢等词语似乎在和一个真正的人类交流的说用户每一次说请谢谢等词语会让多花千万美元但是这笔钱还是花值得的为什么呢指出往往会模仿你输入内容的专业程度清晰度和细节你越温和礼貌它的回答也可能越全面人性化有的人和聊天会被聊哭因为永远在线从不打断你也不评判你所以面对很多人也愿意做一个温暖的有礼貌的人', 'jǐn guǎn wǒ men zhī dào zài hé de jiāo liú zhōng de huí dá shì yī chuàn bèi xùn liàn chū lái de zì jié zǔ hé dàn shì hěn duō rén yī rán huì shuō qǐng huò zhě xiè xiè děng cí yǔ sì hū zài hé yī gè zhēn zhèng de rén lèi jiāo liú de shuō yòng hù měi yī cì shuō qǐng xiè xiè děng cí yǔ huì ràng duō huā qiān wàn měi yuán dàn shì zhè bǐ qián hái shì huā zhí dé de wèi shén me ne zhǐ chū wǎng wǎng huì mó fǎng nǐ shū rù nèi róng de zhuān yè chéng dù qīng xī dù hé xì jié nǐ yuè wēn hé lǐ mào tā de huí dá yě kě néng yuè quán miàn rén xìng huà yǒu de rén hé liáo tiān huì bèi liáo kū yīn wèi yǒng yuǎn zài xiàn cóng bù dǎ duàn nǐ yě bù píng pàn nǐ suǒ yǐ miàn duì hěn duō rén yě yuàn yì zuò yī gè wēn nuǎn de yǒu lǐ mào de rén', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐn guǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAlthough (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">尽管</span><span class=\"tr\">儘管</span><rt>jǐn guǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nknow (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr>AI <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiāo liú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncommunication (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">交流</span><span class=\"tr\">交流</span><rt>jiāo liú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中</span><span class=\"tr\">中</span><rt>zhōng</rt></ruby></abbr>， AI <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí dá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nresponses (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回答</span><span class=\"tr\">回答</span><rt>huí dá</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">串</span><span class=\"tr\">串</span><rt>chuàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nby (indicates passive-voice clauses) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">被</span><span class=\"tr\">被</span><rt>bèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xùn liàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntrained (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">训练</span><span class=\"tr\">訓練</span><rt>xùn liàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nout \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">出来</span><span class=\"tr\">出來</span><rt>chū lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zì jié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbyte \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">字节</span><span class=\"tr\">字節</span><rt>zì jié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǔ hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncombinations (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">组合</span><span class=\"tr\">組合</span><rt>zǔ hé</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī rán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstill (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">依然</span><span class=\"tr\">依然</span><rt>yī rán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>“ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr>” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huò zhě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nor (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">或者</span><span class=\"tr\">或者</span><rt>huò zhě</rt></ruby></abbr>“ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr>” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\netc. (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cí yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwords (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">词语</span><span class=\"tr\">詞語</span><rt>cí yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sì hū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nas if (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">似乎</span><span class=\"tr\">似乎</span><rt>sì hū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn zhèng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真正</span><span class=\"tr\">真正</span><rt>zhēn zhèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén lèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhuman (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人类</span><span class=\"tr\">人類</span><rt>rén lèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiāo liú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncommunicating (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">交流</span><span class=\"tr\">交流</span><rt>jiāo liú</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p>OpenAI <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>CEO <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòng hù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nusers (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">用户</span><span class=\"tr\">用戶</span><rt>yòng hù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (measure word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">次</span><span class=\"tr\">次</span><rt>cì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>“ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr>” 、 “ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthank (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr>” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\netc. (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cí yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwords (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">词语</span><span class=\"tr\">詞語</span><rt>cí yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmake (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr>OpenAI <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspend (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</