ū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npointed out \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">指出</span><span class=\"tr\">指出</span><rt>zhǐ chū</rt></ruby></abbr>， AI <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎng wǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">往往</span><span class=\"tr\">往往</span><rt>wǎng wǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mó fǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nimitate (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">模仿</span><span class=\"tr\">模仿</span><rt>mó fǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shū rù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninput (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">输入</span><span class=\"tr\">輸入</span><rt>shū rù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nèi róng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncontent (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">内容</span><span class=\"tr\">內容</span><rt>nèi róng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhuān yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nprofessional (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">专业</span><span class=\"tr\">專業</span><rt>zhuān yè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng dù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlevel (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">程度</span><span class=\"tr\">程度</span><rt>chéng dù</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qīng xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclarity (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">清晰</span><span class=\"tr\">清晰</span><rt>qīng xī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndegree \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">度</span><span class=\"tr\">度</span><rt>dù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</