></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"píng pàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njudge \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">评判</span><span class=\"tr\">評判</span><rt>píng pàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suǒ yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">所以</span><span class=\"tr\">所以</span><rt>suǒ yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nface (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面对</span><span class=\"tr\">面對</span><rt>miàn duì</rt></ruby></abbr>AI ， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuàn yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwilling (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">愿意</span><span class=\"tr\">願意</span><rt>yuàn yì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wēn nuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwarm (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">温暖</span><span class=\"tr\">溫暖</span><rt>wēn nuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ mào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmanners (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">礼貌</span><span class=\"tr\">禮貌</span><rt>lǐ mào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(115, 'why-dont-we-like-answering-calls-anymore', 'Why Don’t We Like Answering Calls Anymore?', '为什么我们不喜欢接电话了？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5163.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5163-r73qzxj2zj7a8mnb1a3k8drswsmldy06a6c40vayj6.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/why-dont-we-like-answering-calls-anymore/', '在现代社会越来越多的人不喜欢接电话了这是为什么呢首先很多人觉得电话来的时候很突然会打断他们正在做的事情比如在工作学习或者休息的时候电话铃声响起会让人感到不舒服其次现在有很多其他的交流方式比如短信微信电子邮件等这些方式可以让人有更多的时间思考怎么回答不需要马上回复另外有些人接到电话会感到紧张特别是当他们不知道是谁打来的时候他们担心自己说错话或者不知道怎么回答对方的问题还有现在有很多广告电话和诈骗电话让人们对接电话产生了反感他们害怕接到这样的电话所以面对陌生的号码很多人选择不接总的来说随着科技的发展人们有了更多的交流方式相比之下电话这种方式变得不那么受欢迎了', 'zài xiàn dài shè huì yuè lái yuè duō de rén bù xǐ huān jiē diàn huà le zhè shì wèi shén me ne shǒu xiān hěn duō rén jué de diàn huà lái de shí hòu hěn tū rán huì dǎ duàn tā men zhèng zài zuò de shì qíng bǐ rú zài gōng zuò xué xí huò zhě xiū xī de shí hòu diàn huà líng shēng xiǎng qǐ huì ràng rén gǎn dào bù shū fú qí cì xiàn zài yǒu hěn duō qí tā de jiāo liú fāng shì bǐ rú duǎn xìn wēi xìn diàn zǐ yóu jiàn děng zhè xiē fāng shì kě yǐ ràng rén yǒu gèng duō de shí jiān sī kǎo zěn me huí dá bù xū yào mǎ shàng huí fù lìng wài yǒu xiē rén jiē dào diàn huà huì gǎn dào jǐn zhāng tè bié shì dāng tā men bù zhī dào shì shéi dǎ lái de shí hòu tā men dān xīn zì jǐ shuō cuò huà huò zhě bù zhī dào zěn me huí dá duì fāng de wèn tí hái yǒu xiàn zài yǒu hěn duō guǎng gào diàn huà hé zhà piàn diàn huà ràng rén men duì jiē diàn huà chǎn shēng le fǎn gǎn tā men hài pà jiē dào zhè yàng de diàn huà suǒ yǐ miàn duì mò shēng de hào mǎ hěn duō rén xuǎn zé bù jiē zǒng de lái shuō suí zhe kē jì de fā zhǎn rén men yǒu le gèng duō de jiāo liú fāng shì xiāng bǐ zhī xià diàn huà zhè zhǒng fāng shì biàn de bù nà me shòu huān yíng le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div clas