ooltip\" title=\"huò zhě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nor (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">或者</span><span class=\"tr\">或者</span><rt>huò zhě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiū xī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrest (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">休息</span><span class=\"tr\">休息</span><rt>xiū xī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时候</span><span class=\"tr\">時候</span><rt>shí hòu</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nphone \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">电话</span><span class=\"tr\">電話</span><rt>diàn huà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"líng shēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nringtone \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃声</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴聲</span><rt>líng shēng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nring (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">响</span><span class=\"tr\">響</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nup \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">起</span><span class=\"tr\">起</span><rt>qǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmake (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǎn dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfeel \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">感到</span><span class=\"tr\">感到</span><rt>gǎn dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></