(116, 'jingwei-filling-the-sea', 'Jingwei Filling the Sea', '精卫填海', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5162.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5162-r5l076komnppabnvwakfb1vmplz9jie1qh1vvzpyz6.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/jingwei-filling-the-sea/', '炎帝的小女儿名叫女娃有一天女娃坐船到东海去玩海上的风浪非常大把女娃淹死在海里了女娃的灵魂变成了一只叫精卫的小鸟这只小鸟长着花脑袋白嘴红爪大小有点儿像乌鸦住在北方的发鸠山她恨大海因为大海让她早早地死了为了不让其他年轻的生命也这样死去精卫不停地飞去西山带来小石头或者树枝然后飞到东海把这些东西扔进去想把大海填平大海嘲笑精卫你飞一百万年也不能把我填平精卫说即使是一千万年到世界末日我也要把你填平精卫不停地飞直到今天她还在继续填海', 'Yándì de xiǎo nǚ ér míng jiào Nǚwá yǒu yī tiān Nǚwá zuò chuán dào dōng hǎi qù wán hǎi shàng de fēng làng fēi cháng dà bǎ Nǚwá yān sǐ zài hǎi lǐ le Nǚwá de líng hún biàn chéng le yī zhī jiào Jīngwèi de xiǎo niǎo zhè zhī xiǎo niǎo zhǎng zhe huā nǎo dài bái zuǐ hóng zhuǎ dà xiǎo yǒu diǎnr xiàng wū yā zhù zài běi fāng de Fājiū shān tā hèn dà hǎi yīn wèi dà hǎi ràng tā zǎo zǎo de sǐ le wèi le bù ràng qí tā nián qīng de shēng mìng yě zhè yàng sǐ qù Jīngwèi bù tíng de fēi qù xī shān dài lái xiǎo shí tou huò zhě shù zhī rán hòu fēi dào dōng hǎi bǎ zhè xiē dōngxi rēng jìn qù xiǎng bǎ dà hǎi tián píng dà hǎi cháo xiào Jīngwèi nǐ fēi yī bǎi wàn nián yě bù néng bǎ wǒ tián píng Jīngwèi shuō jí shǐ shì yī qiān wàn nián dào shì jiè mò rì wǒ yě yào bǎ nǐ tián píng Jīngwèi bù tíng de fēi zhí dào jīn tiān tā hái zài jì xù tián hǎi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yándì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEmperor Yan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">炎帝</span><span class=\"tr\">炎帝</span><rt>Yándì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlittle (HSK1)\"><ruby