</abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbring (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nas, by doing something (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来</span><span class=\"tr\">來</span><rt>lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSmall (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí tou:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nStone (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">石头</span><span class=\"tr\">石頭</span><rt>shí tou</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huò zhě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nor (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">或者</span><span class=\"tr\">或者</span><rt>huò zhě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shù zhī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbranches \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">树枝</span><span class=\"tr\">樹枝</span><rt>shù zhī</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfly \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">飞</span><span class=\"tr\">飛</span><rt>fēi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōng hǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEast China Sea \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">东海</span><span class=\"tr\">東海</span><rt>dōng hǎi</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle marking the following noun as a direct object) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthese \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这些</span><span class=\"tr\">這些</span><rt>zhè xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōngxi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\