><span class=\"si\">一千万</span><span class=\"tr\">一千萬</span><rt>yī qiān wàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuntil (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì jiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nworld (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">世界</span><span class=\"tr\">世界</span><rt>shì jiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mò rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nend \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">末日</span><span class=\"tr\">末日</span><rt>mò rì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle marking the following noun as a direct object) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfill \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">填</span><span class=\"tr\">填</span><rt>tián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"píng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflat (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">平</span><span class=\"tr\">平</span><rt>píng</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Jīngwèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nJingwei \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">精卫</span><span class=\"tr\">精衛</span><rt>Jīngwèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstop \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">停</span><span class=\"tr\">停</span><rt>tíng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfly \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">飞</span><span class=\"tr\">飛</span><rt>fēi</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhí dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuntil \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">直到</span><span class=\"tr\">直到</span><rt>zhí dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstill \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">还在</span><span class=\"tr\">還在</span><rt>hái zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì xù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncontinue (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">继续</span><span class=\"tr\">繼續</span><rt>jì xù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfill \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">填</span><span class=\"tr\">填</span><rt>tián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nocean \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">海</span><span class=\"tr\">海</span><rt>hǎi</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(117, 'mahjong-culture-during-the-spring-festival', 'Mahjong culture during the Spring Festival', '春节的麻将文化', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5161.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5161-r43vo0clg7nctlu0dztukelz10napa088t31oa1i6q.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/mahjong-culture-during-the-spring-festival/', '大年初一我到乡下拜年时发现家里特别热闹客厅的旧方桌上摆着麻将妈妈姨妈表姐和表妹正在开心地打牌桌上放着花生瓜子零食电视里放着春晚节目但是没有人看这让我想起了以前过年时麻将桌总是大人们玩的地方小孩只能帮忙倒水或者在旁边看手机现在连后的表妹也开始学习打麻将了一年轻人的新技能不会打麻将过年都没法和家人聊天表妹的话代表了很多年轻人的想法以前她总是一个人玩手机今年她下载了麻将软件练习主动要求参加家庭牌局现在很多年轻人不再只玩手机游戏而是开始学习这项传统活动麻将桌变成了连接不同年龄人的桥梁长辈们耐心教规则年轻人认真学习输赢不重要重要的是大家在一起的热闹气氛通过打麻将年轻人不仅学会游戏还了解了长辈们的想法感受到传统文化的魅力二不同年龄的交流老人和年轻人常常因为想法不同很难聊天但是麻将桌让这种情况改变了打牌时舅舅会教表弟怎么出牌还会讲自己年轻时的故事虽然表弟不太懂麻将规则但听得很开心在麻将桌上老人和年轻人是平等的游戏规则代替了平时的长辈关系年纪大的人分享经验年轻人用新方法出牌这种互动让家人关系变得更亲密很多年轻人通过打麻将找到了和长辈聊天的话题三麻将桌上的聊天麻将桌不仅是玩游戏的地方还是大家交换信息的地方平时不好意思问的问题在打牌时都能轻松说出来比如长辈们会问年轻人什么时候结婚或者讨论家庭关系这些话题平时很难开口但在轻松的游戏环境中变得自然四个人围坐打牌时距离很近容易建立信任关系大家通过观察对方的表情和动作能获得很多信息这种非正式的交流方式有时候比直接问问题更有效四传统游戏的新变化随着时代发展麻将游戏也在改变年轻人给传统麻将增加了新玩法比如输了不用给钱而是表演节目或者回答问题这样既有趣又能让没有收入的学生参加科技发展让麻将有了新形式现在很多人用手机软件打麻将亲戚朋友即使在不同地方也能一起玩这种线上线下结合的方式让传统游戏变得更有意思五除了麻将还需要什么春节的麻将桌像一扇窗户让我们看到传统文化的变化和不同年龄人的交流虽然麻将带来了很多欢乐但我们也要思考除了打麻将还能用什么方式和长辈交流春节结束后麻将桌会被收起来但家人之间的沟通应该一直保持在这个快速发展的时代我们需要更多像麻将这样的桥梁让不同年龄的人更好地互相理解也许我们可以从麻将开始找到更多和家人交流的方法让亲情不只是过年时才出现而是成为日常生活的温暖存在', 'dà nián chū yī wǒ dào xiāng xià bài nián shí fā xiàn jiā lǐ tè bié rè nào kè tīng de jiù fāng zhuō shàng bǎi zhe má jiàng mā mā yí mā biǎo jiě hé biǎo mèi zhèng zài kāi xīn de dǎ pái zhuō shàng fàng zhe huā shēng guā zǐ líng shí diàn shì lǐ fàng zhe chūn wǎn jié mù dàn shì méi yǒu rén kàn zhè ràng wǒ xiǎng qǐ le yǐ qián guò nián shí má jiàng zhuō zǒng shì dà rén men wán de dì fāng xiǎo hái zhǐ néng bāng máng dào shuǐ huò zhě zài páng biān kàn shǒu jī xiàn zài lián hòu de biǎo mèi yě kāi shǐ xué xí dǎ má jiàng le yī nián qīng rén de xīn jì néng bù huì dǎ má jiàng guò nián dōu méi fǎ hé jiā rén liáo tiān biǎo mèi de huà dài biǎo le hěn duō nián qīng rén de xiǎng fǎ yǐ qián tā zǒng shì yī gè rén wán shǒu jī jīn nián tā xià zài le má jiàng ruǎn jiàn liàn xí zhǔ dòng yāo qiú cān jiā jiā tíng pái jú xiàn zài hěn duō nián qīng rén bù zài zhǐ wán shǒu jī yóu xì ér shì kāi shǐ xué xí zhè xiàng chuán tǒng huó dòng má jiàng zhuō biàn chéng le lián jiē bù tóng nián líng rén de qiáo liáng zhǎng bèi men nài xīn jiào guī zé nián qīng rén rèn zhēn xué xí shū yíng bù zhòng yào zhòng yào de shì dà jiā zài yī qǐ de rè nào qì fēn tōng guò dǎ má jiàng nián qīng rén bù jǐn xué huì yóu xì hái liǎo jiě le zhǎng bèi men de xiǎng fǎ gǎn shòu dào chuán tǒng wén huà de mèi lì èr bù tóng nián líng de jiāo liú lǎo rén hé nián qīng rén cháng cháng yīn wèi xiǎng fǎ bù tóng hěn nán liáo tiān dàn shì má jiàng zhuō ràng zhè zhǒng qíng kuàng gǎi biàn le dǎ pái shí jiù jiù huì jiāo biǎo dì zěn me chū pái hái huì jiǎng zì jǐ nián qīng shí de gù shì suī rán biǎo dì bù tài dǒng má jiàng guī zé dàn tīng de hěn kāi xīn zài má jiàng zhuō shàng lǎo rén hé nián qīng rén shì píng děng de yóu xì guī zé dài tì le píng shí de zhǎng bèi guān xì nián jì dà de rén fēn xiǎng jīng yàn nián qīng rén yòng xīn fāng fǎ chū pái zhè zhǒng hù dòng ràng jiā rén guān xì biàn de gèng qīn mì hěn duō nián qīng rén tōng guò dǎ má jiàng zhǎo dào le hé zhǎng bèi liáo tiān de huà tí sān má jiàng zhuō shàng de liáo tiān má jiàng zhuō bù jǐn shì wán yóu xì de dì fāng hái shì dà jiā jiāo huàn xìn xī de dì fāng píng shí bù hǎo yì sī wèn de wèn tí zài dǎ pái shí dōu néng qīng sōng shuō chū lái bǐ rú zhǎng bèi men huì wèn nián qīng rén shén me shí hòu jié hūn huò zhě tǎo lùn jiā tíng guān xì zhè xiē huà tí píng shí hěn nán kāi kǒu dàn zài qīng sōng de yóu xì huán jìng zhōng biàn de zì rán sì gè rén wéi zuò dǎ pái shí jù lí hěn jìn róng yì jiàn lì xìn rèn guān xì dà jiā tōng guò guān chá duì fāng de biǎo qíng hé dòng zuò néng huò dé hěn duō xìn xī zhè zhǒng fēi zhèng shì de jiāo liú fāng shì yǒu shí hòu bǐ zhí jiē wèn wèn tí gèng yǒu xiào sì chuán tǒng yóu xì de xīn biàn huà suí zhe shí dài fā zhǎn má jiàng yóu xì yě zài gǎi biàn nián qīng rén gěi chuán tǒng má jiàng zēng jiā le xīn wán fǎ bǐ rú shū le bù yòng gěi qián ér shì biǎo yǎn jié mù huò zhě huí dá wèn tí zhè yàng jì yǒu qù yòu néng ràng méi yǒu shōu rù de xué shēng cān jiā kē jì fā zhǎn ràng má jiàng yǒu le xīn xíng shì xiàn zài hěn duō rén yòng shǒu jī ruǎn jiàn dǎ má jiàng qīn qī péng yǒu jí shǐ zài bù tóng dì fāng yě néng yī qǐ wán zhè zhǒng xiàn shàng xiàn xià jié hé de fāng shì ràng chuán tǒng yóu xì biàn de gèng yǒu yì sī wǔ chú le má jiàng hái xū yào shén me chūn jié de má jiàng zhuō xiàng yī shàn chuāng hù ràng wǒ men kàn dào chuán tǒng wén huà de biàn huà hé bù tóng nián líng rén de jiāo liú suī rán má jiàng dài lái le hěn duō huān lè dàn wǒ men yě yào sī kǎo chú le dǎ má jiàng hái néng yòng shén me fāng shì hé zhǎng bèi jiāo liú chūn jié jié shù hòu má jiàng zhuō huì bèi shōu qǐ lái dàn jiā rén zhī jiān de gōu tōng yīng gāi yī zhí bǎo chí zài zhè gè kuài sù fā zhǎn de shí dài wǒ men xū yào gèng duō xiàng má jiàng zhè yàng de qiáo liáng ràng bù tóng nián líng de rén gèng hǎo de hù xiāng lǐ jiě yě xǔ wǒ men kě yǐ cóng má jiàng kāi shǐ zhǎo dào gèng duō hé jiā rén jiāo liú de fāng fǎ ràng qīn qíng bù zhǐ shì guò nián shí cái chū xiàn ér shì chéng wéi rì cháng shēng huó de wēn nuǎn cún zài', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà nián chū yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNew Year\'s Day \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大年初一</span><span class=\"tr\">大年初一</span><rt>dà nián chū yī</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiāng xià:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncountryside \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">乡下</span><span class=\"tr\">鄉下</span><rt>xiāng xià</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bài nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npay a New Year call (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">拜年</span><span class=\"tr\">拜年</span><rt>bài nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhen \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fā xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndiscover, find (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">发现</span><span class=\"tr\">發現</span><rt>fā xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninside (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裏</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tè bié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspecial (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">特别</span><span class=\"tr\">特別</span><rt>tè bié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè nào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlively (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">热闹</span><span class=\"tr\">熱鬧</span><rt>rè nào</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kè tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nliving room (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">客厅</span><span class=\"tr\">客廳</span><rt>kè tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nold (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旧</span><span class=\"tr\">舊</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsquare (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">方</span><span class=\"tr\">方</span><rt>fāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntable \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">桌</span><span class=\"tr\">桌</span><rt>zhuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\non (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nput (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">摆</span><span class=\"tr\">擺</span><rt>bǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhe:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"má jiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMahjong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">麻将</span><span class=\"tr\">麻將</span><rt>má jiàng</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mā mā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMother (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妈妈</span><span class=\"tr\">媽媽</span><rt>mā mā</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yí mā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\naunt \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">姨妈</span><span class=\"tr\">姨媽</span><rt>yí mā</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biǎo jiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelder cousin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">表姐</span><span class=\"tr\">表姐</span><rt>biǎo jiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biǎo mèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyounger cousin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">表妹</span><span class=\"tr\">表妹</span><rt>biǎo mèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèng zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin the process of (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">正在</span><span class=\"tr\">正在</span><rt>zhèng zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi xīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhappily (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开心</span><span class=\"tr\">開心</span><rt>kāi xīn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></