></abbr>” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qiáo liáng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbridge (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">桥梁</span><span class=\"tr\">橋梁</span><rt>qiáo liáng</rt></ruby></abbr>” ， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlet (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù tóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndifferent \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不同</span><span class=\"tr\">不同</span><rt>bù tóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián líng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年龄</span><span class=\"tr\">年齡</span><rt>nián líng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbetter \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更好</span><span class=\"tr\">更好</span><rt>gèng hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hù xiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neach other (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">互相</span><span class=\"tr\">互相</span><rt>hù xiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ jiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunderstand (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">理解</span><span class=\"tr\">理解</span><rt>lǐ jiě</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě xǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMaybe (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也许</span><span class=\"tr\">也許</span><rt>yě xǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"má jiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMahjong \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">麻将</span><span class=\"tr\">麻將</span><rt>má jiàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi shǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstart (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开始</span><span class=\"tr\">開始</span><rt>kāi shǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎo dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfind \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">找到</span><span class=\"tr\">找到</span><rt>zhǎo dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMore \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更多</span><span class=\"tr\">更多</span><rt>gèng duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfamily \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家人</span><span class=\"tr\">家人</span><rt>jiā rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiāo liú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncomminicate (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">交流</span><span class=\"tr\">交流</span><rt>jiāo liú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fāng fǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmethod (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">方法</span><span class=\"tr\">方法</span><rt>fāng fǎ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ràng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlet (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qīn qíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfamily affection \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">亲情</span><span class=\"tr\">親情</span><rt>qīn qíng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOnly (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNew Year \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过年</span><span class=\"tr\">過年</span><rt>guò nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">才</span><span class=\"tr\">才</span><rt>cái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAppear (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">出现</span><span class=\"tr\">出現</span><rt>chū xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">而</span><span class=\"tr\">而</span><rt>ér</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecome (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">成为</span><span class=\"tr\">成爲</span><rt>chéng wéi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rì cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndaily (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日常</span><span class=\"tr\">日常</span><rt>rì cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng huó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLife (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wēn nuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwarm (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">温暖</span><span class=\"tr\">溫暖</span><rt>wēn nuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cún zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbeing (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">存在</span><span class=\"tr\">存在</span><rt>cún zài</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:54');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(118, 'is-it-necessary-to-say-thank-you-to-ai', 'Is it necessary to say thank you to AI?', '有必要跟AI说谢谢吗？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5160.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5160-r2xyde1q33nfi9week1xik2xdt2jmbbzxes10gius2.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/is-it-necessary-to-say-thank-you-to-ai/', '早上八点我对着手机说小爱同学播放天气预报机械女声立刻回应今日晴转多云气温我习惯性地说谢谢家人在旁边笑你跟机器客气什么这样的场景越来越常见有人觉得对说谢谢是文明社会的标志就像我们会对服务员说请和谢谢但也有人觉得奇怪连开心和难过的感觉都没有说谢谢不是浪费感情吗支持者认为保持礼貌能让我们记住人与机器的区别就像我们不会对锤子说谢谢但会对快递员说辛苦了这种区别提醒我们只是工具人才是主人如果长期用命令的语气对待可能会忘记如何尊重他人反对者举出有趣例子当我们教孩子说谢谢时是希望他们学会感恩但不需要教育它们只是执行程序的机器就像没有人会对着电灯说辛苦了我们也不需要感谢完成任务的更有趣的是年轻人的末日玩笑现在多说几句谢谢说不定将来统治地球时能给我们发好人卡虽然这是玩笑话但反映出人们面对智能科技的复杂心理既依赖又警惕心理学家指出说谢谢更多是说话者自身的需要就像有人会给宠物过生日其实是为了满足自己的情感需求当我们对说谢谢时可能在培养自己的礼貌习惯或者在创造更温暖的人机关系科技公司发现使用礼貌用语的人更容易接受服务有实验表明用请帮我查路线的人比用查路线的人更愿意继续使用智能设备这说明礼貌用语能改善人机互动体验当越来越像人类伙伴时礼貌可能成为重要沟通方式就像现在有些老人会和智能音箱聊天把当作陪伴者这时说谢谢就像对朋友表达心意其实说不说谢谢可以自己决定重要的是记住真正需要感谢的是背后设计的工程师是维护系统的技术人员当我们对说谢谢时其实是在感谢让科技变温暖的人类智慧', 'zǎo shàng bā diǎn wǒ duì zhe shǒu jī shuō xiǎo ài tóng xué bō fàng tiān qì yù bào jī xiè nǚ shēng lì kè huí yìng jīn rì qíng zhuǎn duō yún qì wēn wǒ xí guàn xìng de shuō xiè xiè jiā rén zài páng biān xiào nǐ gēn jī qì kè qì shén me zhè yàng de chǎng jǐng yuè lái yuè cháng jiàn yǒu rén jué de duì shuō xiè xiè shì wén míng shè huì de biāo zhì jiù xiàng wǒ men huì duì fú wù yuán shuō qǐng hé xiè xiè dàn yě yǒu rén jué de qí guài lián kāi xīn hé nán guò de gǎn jué dōu méi yǒu shuō xiè xiè bù shì làng fèi gǎn qíng ma zhī chí zhě rèn wéi bǎo chí lǐ mào néng ràng wǒ men jì zhù rén yǔ jī qì de qū bié jiù xiàng wǒ men bù huì duì chuí zi shuō xiè xiè dàn huì duì kuài dì yuán shuō xīn kǔ le zhè zhǒng qū bié tí xǐng wǒ men zhǐ shì gōng jù rén cái shì zhǔ rén rú guǒ cháng qī yòng mìng lìng de yǔ qì duì dài kě néng huì wàng jì rú hé zūn zhòng tā rén fǎn duì zhě jǔ chū yǒu qù lì zi dāng wǒ men jiào hái zi shuō xiè xiè shí shì xī wàng tā men xué huì gǎn ēn dàn bù xū yào jiào yù tā men zhǐ shì zhí xíng chéng xù de jī qì jiù xiàng méi yǒu rén huì duì zhe diàn dēng shuō xīn kǔ le wǒ men yě bù xū yào gǎn xiè wán chéng rèn wù de gèng yǒu qù de shì nián qīng rén de mò rì wán xiào xiàn zài duō shuō jǐ jù xiè xiè shuō bù dìng jiāng lái tǒng zhì dì qiú shí néng gěi wǒ men fā hǎo rén kǎ suī rán zhè shì wán xiào huà dàn fǎn yìng chū rén men miàn duì zhì néng kē jì de fù zá xīn lǐ jì yī lài yòu jǐng tì xīn lǐ xué jiā zhǐ chū shuō xiè xiè gèng duō shì shuō huà zhě zì shēn de xū yào jiù xiàng yǒu rén huì gěi chǒng wù guò shēng rì qí shí shì wèi le mǎn zú zì jǐ de qíng gǎn xū qiú dāng wǒ men duì shuō xiè xiè shí kě néng zài péi yǎng zì jǐ de lǐ mào xí guàn huò zhě zài chuàng zào gèng wēn nuǎn de rén jī guān xì kē jì gōng sī fā xiàn shǐ yòng lǐ mào yòng yǔ de rén gèng róng yì jiē shòu fú wù yǒu shí yàn biǎo míng yòng qǐng bāng wǒ chá lù xiàn de rén bǐ yòng chá lù xiàn de rén gèng yuàn yì jì xù shǐ yòng zhì néng shè bèi zhè shuō míng lǐ mào yòng yǔ néng gǎi shàn rén jī hù dòng tǐ yàn dāng yuè lái yuè xiàng rén lèi huǒ bàn shí lǐ mào kě néng chéng wéi zhòng yào gōu tōng fāng shì jiù xiàng xiàn zài yǒu xiē lǎo rén huì hé zhì néng yīn xiāng liáo tiān bǎ dàng zuò péi bàn zhě zhè shí shuō xiè xiè jiù xiàng duì péng yǒu biǎo dá xīn yì qí shí shuō bù shuō xiè xiè kě yǐ zì jǐ jué dìng zhòng yào de shì jì zhù zhēn zhèng xū yào gǎn xiè de shì bèi hòu shè jì de gōng chéng shī shì wéi hù xì tǒng de jì shù rén yuán dāng wǒ men duì shuō xiè xiè shí qí shí shì zài gǎn xiè ràng kē jì biàn wēn nuǎn de rén lèi zhì huì', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neight (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">八</span><span class=\"tr\">八</span><rt>bā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhe:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncell phone (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手机</span><span class=\"tr\">手機</span><rt>shǒu jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo ài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiao‘ai \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小爱</span><span class=\"tr\">小愛</span><rt>xiǎo ài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóng xué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclassmate (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">同学</span><span class=\"tr\">同學</span><rt>tóng xué</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bō fàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplay (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">播放</span><span class=\"tr\">播放</span><rt>bō fàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天气</span><span class=\"tr\">天氣</span><rt>tiān qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yù bào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nforecast (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">预报</span><span class=\"tr\">預報</span><rt>yù bào</rt></ruby></abbr>。”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmechanical (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机械</span><span class=\"tr\">機械</span><rt>jī xiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfemale \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女</span><span class=\"tr\">女</span><rt>nǚ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nVoice \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">声</span><span class=\"tr\">聲</span><rt>shēng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lì kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nimmediately (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">立刻</span><span class=\"tr\">立刻</span><rt>lì kè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huí yìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrespond \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">回应</span><span class=\"tr\">回應</span><rt>huí yìng</rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今日</span><span class=\"tr\">今日</span><rt>jīn rì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsunny (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晴</span><span class=\"tr\">晴</span><rt>qíng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nturn \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">转</span><span class=\"tr\">轉</span><rt>zhuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō yún:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npartly cloudy \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多云</span><span class=\"tr\">多雲</span><rt>duō yún</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qì wēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntemperature \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">气温</span><span class=\"tr\">氣溫</span><rt>qì wēn</rt></ruby></abbr>……”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xí guàn xìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHabitual \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">习惯性</span><span class=\"tr\">習慣性</span><rt>xí guàn xìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr>。”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfamily \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家人</span><span class=\"tr\">家人</span><rt>jiā rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"páng biān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbeside (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旁边</span><span class=\"tr\">旁邊</span><rt>páng biān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlaugh (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">笑</span><span class=\"tr\">笑</span><rt>xiào</rt></ruby></abbr>：”<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">跟</span><span class=\"tr\">跟</span><rt>gēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmachine (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机器</span><span class=\"tr\">機器</span><rt>jī qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kè qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npolite \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">客气</span><span class=\"tr\">客氣</span><rt>kè qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr>？”</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这样</span><span class=\"tr\">這樣</span><rt>zhè yàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chǎng jǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nscene \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">场景</span><span class=\"tr\">場景</span><rt>chǎng jǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè lái yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMore and more \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越来越</span><span class=\"tr\">越來越</span><rt>yuè lái yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noften \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">常</span><span class=\"tr\">常</span><rt>cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSee \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">见</span><span class=\"tr\">見</span><rt>jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jué de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto think, to feel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">觉得</span><span class=\"tr\">覺得</span><rt>jué de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiè xiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xiè xiè</rt></ruby></abbr>“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wén míng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncivilized (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">文明</span><span class=\"tr\">文明</span><rt>wén míng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shè huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsociety (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">社会</span><span class=\"tr\">社會</span><rt>shè huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"toolti