</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">实践</span><span class=\"tr\">實踐</span><rt>shí jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàng mù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nproject (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">项目</span><span class=\"tr\">項目</span><rt>xiàng mù</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiào yù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neducation (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">教育</span><span class=\"tr\">教育</span><rt>jiào yù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī gòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\norganization (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机构</span><span class=\"tr\">機構</span><rt>jī gòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xū yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nneed (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">需要</span><span class=\"tr\">需要</span><rt>xū yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEstablish (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">建立</span><span class=\"tr\">建立</span><rt>jiàn lì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnew (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">新</span><span class=\"tr\">新</span><rt>xīn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biāo zhǔn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstandard (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">标准</span><span class=\"tr\">標準</span><rt>biāo zhǔn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow that \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">既</span><span class=\"tr\">既</span><rt>jì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwant (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fáng zhǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">防止</span><span class=\"tr\">防止</span><rt>fáng zhǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì shù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntechnology (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">技术</span><span class=\"tr\">技術</span><rt>jì shù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī lài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrely (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">依赖</span><span class=\"tr\">依賴</span><rt>yī lài</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fā huī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">发挥</span><span class=\"tr\">發揮</span><rt>fā huī</rt></ruby></abbr>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nof (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fǔ zhù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">辅助</span><span class=\"tr\">輔助</span><rt>fǔ zhù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nauxiliary, assistant (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">作用</span><span class=\"tr\">作用</span><rt>zuò yòng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bāng zhù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhelp (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">帮助</span><span class=\"tr\">幫助</span><rt>bāng zhù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xué shēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstudent (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">学生</span><span class=\"tr\">學生</span><rt>xué shēng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexist (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhì néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">智能</span><span class=\"tr\">智能</span><rt>zhì néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nera (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时代</span><span class=\"tr\">時代</span><rt>shí dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"péi yǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnourish (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">培养</span><span class=\"tr\">培養</span><rt>péi yǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé xīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncore (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">核心</span><span class=\"tr\">核心</span><rt>hé xīn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jìng zhēng lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompetitiveness \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">竞争力</span><span class=\"tr\">競爭力</span><rt>jìng zhēng lì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(120, 'how-did-the-ancient-chinese-give-gifts', 'How did the ancient Chinese give gifts?', '中国古人怎么送礼？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5158.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5158-r04mxpeeepbv39mz235yzleoonxnosxdgpo3wrqiqa.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/how-did-the-ancient-chinese-give-gifts/', '在现代人们送礼通常认为礼物越贵重越好以此体现自己的心意然而中国古人并不这样认为他们讲究礼物与情感相称认为礼物的价值应该反映人与人之间的关系和感情古人把送礼称为挚意思是亲自带着礼物去表达诚意例如先秦时期不同身份的人送礼有严格规定士阶层见面时用野鸡作为礼物冬天是死的野鸡夏天是风干的野鸡大夫之间则用大雁或羔羊礼物的种类和数量都有明确的礼制既能表达情感又不造成经济负担从古人送礼的做法可以看出他们更注重情感与礼物的匹配而不是礼物的价值高低送礼在古代不仅是人际交往的方式更体现了称情而立文的礼仪精神这种追求礼物与感情相符的原则与现代单纯追求贵重礼物的观念有着很大的不同', 'zài xiàn dài rén men sòng lǐ tōng cháng rèn wéi lǐ wù yuè guì zhòng yuè hǎo yǐ cǐ tǐ xiàn zì jǐ de xīn yì rán ér zhōng guó gǔ rén bìng bù zhè yàng rèn wéi tā men jiǎng jiū lǐ wù yǔ qíng gǎn xiāng chèn rèn wéi lǐ wù de jià zhí yīng gāi fǎn yìng rén yǔ rén zhī jiān de guān xì hé gǎn qíng gǔ rén bǎ sòng lǐ chēng wéi zhì yì sī shì qīn zì dài zhe lǐ wù qù biǎo dá chéng yì lì rú xiān qín shí qī bù tóng shēn fèn de rén sòng lǐ yǒu yán gé guī dìng shì jiē céng jiàn miàn shí yòng yě jī zuò wéi lǐ wù dōng tiān shì sǐ de yě jī xià tiān shì fēng gān de yě jī dà fū zhī jiān zé yòng dà yàn huò gāo yáng lǐ wù de zhǒng lèi hé shù liàng dōu yǒu míng què de lǐ zhì jì néng biǎo dá qíng gǎn yòu bù zào chéng jīng jì fù dān cóng gǔ rén sòng lǐ de zuò fǎ kě yǐ kàn chū tā men gèng zhù zhòng qíng gǎn yǔ lǐ wù de pǐ pèi ér bù shì lǐ wù de jià zhí gāo dī sòng lǐ zài gǔ dài bù jǐn shì rén jì jiāo wǎng de fāng shì gèng tǐ xiàn le chēng qíng ér lì wén de lǐ yí jīng shén zhè zhǒng zhuī qiú lǐ wù yǔ gǎn qíng xiāng fú de yuán zé yǔ xiàn dài dān chún zhuī qiú guì zhòng lǐ wù de guān niàn yǒu zhe hěn dà de bù tóng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmodern (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现代</span><span class=\"tr\">現代</span><rt>xiàn dài</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人们</span><span class=\"tr\">人們</span><rt>rén men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend as gift (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npresent \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">礼</span><span class=\"tr\">禮</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tōng cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngenerally (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">通常</span><span class=\"tr\">通常</span><rt>tōng cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthink (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">认为</span><span class=\"tr\">認爲</span><rt>rèn wéi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGift (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">礼物</span><span class=\"tr\">禮物</span><rt>lǐ wù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmore (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越</span><span class=\"tr\">越</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guì zhòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nprecious \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">贵重</span><span class=\"tr\">貴重</span><rt>guì zhòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmore (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越</span><span class=\"tr\">越</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nby (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">以</span><span class=\"tr\">以</span><rt>yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">此</span><span class=\"tr\">此</span><rt>cǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tǐ xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreflect (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">体现</span><span class=\"tr\">體現</span><rt>tǐ xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zì jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noneself (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">自己</span><span class=\"tr\">自己</span><rt>zì jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīn yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmind, intention \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">心意</span><span class=\"tr\">心意</span><rt>xīn yì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHowever (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然而</span><span class=\"tr\">然而</span><rt>rán ér</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>zhōng guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe ancients \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">古人</span><span class=\"tr\">古人</span><rt>gǔ rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">并</span><span class=\"tr\">幷</span><rt>bìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nso \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这样</span><span class=\"tr\">這樣</span><rt>zhè yàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthink (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">认为</span><span class=\"tr\">認爲</span><rt>rèn wéi</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nt