/span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">与</span><span class=\"tr\">與</span><rt>yǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbetween \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">之间</span><span class=\"tr\">之間</span><rt>zhī jiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guān xì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrelation (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">关系</span><span class=\"tr\">關係</span><rt>guān xì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǎn qíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nemotion (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">感情</span><span class=\"tr\">感情</span><rt>gǎn qíng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe ancients \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">古人</span><span class=\"tr\">古人</span><rt>gǔ rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle marking the following noun as a direct object) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend as gift (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npresent \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">礼</span><span class=\"tr\">禮</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\naddress (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">称</span><span class=\"tr\">稱</span><rt>chēng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nas (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">为</span><span class=\"tr\">爲</span><rt>wéi</rt></ruby></abbr>“<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nzhi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">挚</span><span class=\"tr\">摯</span><rt>zhì</rt></ruby></abbr>”，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yì sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeaning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">意思</span><span class=\"tr\">意思</span><rt>yì sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qīn zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npersonally (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">亲自</span><span class=\"tr\">親自</span><rt>qīn zì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbring (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhe:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGift (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">礼物</span><span class=\"tr\">禮物</span><rt>lǐ wù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biǎo dá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nExpress (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">表达</span><span class=\"tr\">表達</span><rt>biǎo dá</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSincerity \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">诚意</span><span class=\"tr\">誠意</span><rt>chéng yì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lì rú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFor example (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">例如</span><span class=\"tr\">例如</span><rt>lì rú</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiān qín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPre-Qin \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">先秦</span><span class=\"tr\">先秦</span><rt>xiān qín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr