\" title=\"kuài jì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAccounting (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会计</span><span class=\"tr\">會計</span><rt>kuài jì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóng shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeanwhile, at the same time (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">同时</span><span class=\"tr\">同時</span><rt>tóng shí</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cháng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntry (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">尝试</span><span class=\"tr\">嘗試</span><rt>cháng shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecome (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">成为</span><span class=\"tr\">成爲</span><rt>chéng wéi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">名</span><span class=\"tr\">名</span><rt>míng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǚ yóu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntravel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旅游</span><span class=\"tr\">旅游</span><rt>lǚ yóu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bó zhǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBlogger \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">博主</span><span class=\"tr\">博主</span><rt>bó zhǔ</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒng zhī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nIn short (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">总之</span><span class=\"tr\">總之</span><rt>zǒng zhī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng huó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLife (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">场</span><span class=\"tr\">場</span><rt>chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǚ chéng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njourney \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旅程</span><span class=\"tr\">旅程</span><rt>lǚ chéng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yóu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDepend on (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">由</span><span class=\"tr\">由</span><rt>yóu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyour, yours \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你的</span><span class=\"tr\">你的</span><rt>nǐ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xū qiú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nneed (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">需求</span><span class=\"tr\">需求</span><rt>xū qiú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuàn wàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndesire (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">愿望</span><span class=\"tr\">願望</span><rt>yuàn wàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǔ chéng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncomposition (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">组成</span><span class=\"tr\">組成</span><rt>zǔ chéng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rú guǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nif (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">如果</span><span class=\"tr\">如果</span><rt>rú guǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kuài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe going to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">快</span><span class=\"tr\">快</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr>30<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nage (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但</span><span class=\"tr\">但</span><rt>dàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǎn jué:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFeel (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">感觉</span><span class=\"tr\">感覺</span><rt>gǎn jué</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyour, yours \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你的</span><span class=\"tr\">你的</span><rt>nǐ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nideal (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">理想</span><span class=\"tr\">理想</span><rt>lǐ xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng huó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLife (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\naccord with, conform to \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">符</span><span class=\"tr\">符</span><rt>fú</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà dǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBold \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大胆</span><span class=\"tr\">大膽</span><rt>dà dǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChange (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">换</span><span class=\"tr\">換</span><rt>huàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ba:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(part. )used at the end of a sentense to indicate consultation, suggestion, request or command (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吧</span><span class=\"tr\">吧</span><rt>ba</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(125, 'pros-and-cons-of-ai-assistants', 'Pros and cons of AI assistants', 'AI助手的利与弊', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5153.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5153-qsywb9fu3yu1fbhs8la200hjlhh1957yjiq2em0642.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/pros-and-cons-of-ai-assistants/', '助手越来越聪明人类对它们的依赖也开始越来越高比如写邮件助手可以提醒我们接下来应该怎么写你只需要输入几个字母它就能猜测你要写的内容会显示建议的词或句子过去我们需要手动输入的常用内容现在助手可以自动为我们完成这样发邮件的速度比以前快了很多内容质量也更好但是这样依赖我们会失去什么吗写作不论是手写还是打字都需要大脑的多种功能进行我们的大脑总是在预测比如在嘈杂的地方即使只听到部分声音我们也能猜测说话者想表达的意思但如果机器帮助我们写作可能会影响我们大脑的工作方式现在不仅是邮件系统很多智能手机也有文本预测功能智能回复功能等这些功能都是为了简化我们的打字任务虽然可以帮助我们快速写作但人们对这种自动完成功能有复杂的看法有些人觉得它很神奇但也有人担心机器代替人类的交流可能会失去人与人之间真实的沟通乐趣也有人担心这会影响我们的语言使用习惯由于是基于我们以前输入的内容学习的这可能会产生错误的建议影响我们的写作方式而且研究发现使用文本预测的学生可能会犯更多的错误现在人们越来越多地使用技术来完成写作任务但我们是否因此而失去了对语言的真实体验和欣赏呢', 'zhù shǒu yuè lái yuè cōng míng rén lèi duì tā men de yī lài yě kāi shǐ yuè lái yuè gāo bǐ rú xiě yóu jiàn zhù shǒu kě yǐ tí xǐng wǒ men jiē xià lái yīng gāi zěn me xiě nǐ zhǐ xū yào shū rù jǐ gè zì mǔ tā jiù néng cāi cè nǐ yào xiě de nèi róng huì xiǎn shì jiàn yì de cí huò jù zi guò qù wǒ men xū yào shǒu dòng shū rù de cháng yòng nèi róng xiàn zài zhù shǒu kě yǐ zì dòng wèi wǒ men wán chéng zhè yàng fā yóu jiàn de sù dù bǐ yǐ qián kuài le hěn duō nèi róng zhì liàng yě gèng hǎo dàn shì zhè yàng yī lài wǒ men huì shī qù shén me ma xiě zuò bù lùn shì shǒu xiě hái shì dǎ zì dōu xū yào dà nǎo de duō zhǒng gōng néng jìn xíng wǒ men de dà nǎo zǒng shì zài yù cè bǐ rú zài cáo zá de dì fāng jí shǐ zhǐ tīng dào bù fèn shēng yīn wǒ men yě néng cāi cè shuō huà zhě xiǎng biǎo dá de yì sī dàn rú guǒ jī qì bāng zhù wǒ men xiě zuò kě néng huì yǐng xiǎng wǒ men dà nǎo de gōng zuò fāng shì xiàn zài bù jǐn shì yóu jiàn xì tǒng hěn duō zhì néng shǒu jī yě yǒu wén běn yù cè gōng néng zhì néng huí fù gōng néng děng zhè xiē gōng néng dōu shì wèi le jiǎn huà wǒ men de dǎ zì rèn wù suī rán kě yǐ bāng zhù wǒ men kuài sù xiě zuò dàn rén men duì zhè zhǒng zì dòng wán chéng gōng néng yǒu fù zá de kàn fǎ yǒu xiē rén jué de tā hěn shén qí dàn yě yǒu rén dān xīn jī qì dài tì rén lèi de jiāo liú kě néng huì shī qù rén yǔ rén zhī jiān zhēn shí de gōu tōng lè qù yě yǒu rén dān xīn zhè huì yǐng xiǎng wǒ men de yǔ yán shǐ yòng xí guàn yóu yú shì jī yú wǒ men yǐ qián shū rù de nèi róng xué xí de zhè kě néng huì chǎn shēng cuò wù de jiàn yì yǐng xiǎng wǒ men de xiě zuò fāng shì ér qiě yán jiū fā xiàn shǐ yòng wén běn yù cè de xué shēng kě néng huì fàn gèng duō de cuò wù xiàn zài rén men yuè lái yuè duō de shǐ yòng jì shù lái wán chéng xiě zuò rèn wù dàn wǒ men shì fǒu yīn cǐ ér shī qù le duì yǔ yán de zhēn shí tǐ yàn hé xīn shǎng ne', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhù shǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nassistant (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">助手</span><span class=\"tr\">助手</span><rt>zhù shǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè lái yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMore and more \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越来越</span><span class=\"tr\">越來越</span><rt>yuè lái yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cōng míng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclever (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">聪明</span><span class=\"tr\">聰明</span><rt>cōng míng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén lèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHumanity (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人类</span><span class=\"tr\">人類</span><rt>rén lèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">它们</span><span class=\"tr\">它們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī lài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrely, dependent (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">依赖</span><span class=\"tr\">依賴</span><rt>yī lài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi shǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstart (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开始</span><span class=\"tr\">開始</span><rt>kāi shǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè lái yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMore and more \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越来越</span><span class=\"tr\">越來越</span><rt>yuè lái yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhigh (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高</span><span class=\"tr\">高</span><rt>gāo</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǐ rú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfor example (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">比如</span><span class=\"tr\">比如</span><rt>bǐ rú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWrite (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">写</span><span class=\"tr\">寫</span><rt>xiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yóu jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmail \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">邮件</span><span class=\"tr\">郵件</span><rt>yóu jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>，AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhù shǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nassistant (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">助手</span><span class=\"tr\">助手</span><rt>zhù shǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tí xǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nremind (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">提醒</span><span class=\"tr\">提醒</span><rt>tí xǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" titl