abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nable (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cāi cè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nguess \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">猜测</span><span class=\"tr\">猜測</span><rt>cāi cè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWrite (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">写</span><span class=\"tr\">寫</span><rt>xiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nèi róng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncontent (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">内容</span><span class=\"tr\">內容</span><rt>nèi róng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshow (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">显示</span><span class=\"tr\">顯示</span><rt>xiǎn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsuggestion (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">建议</span><span class=\"tr\">建議</span><rt>jiàn yì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nword \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">词</span><span class=\"tr\">詞</span><rt>cí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nor \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">或</span><span class=\"tr\">或</span><rt>huò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jù zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsentence (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">句子</span><span class=\"tr\">句子</span><rt>jù zi</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin the past (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过去</span><span class=\"tr\">過去</span><rt>guò qù</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xū yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nneed (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">需要</span><span class=\"tr\">需要</span><rt>xū yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nManual \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手动</span><span class=\"tr\">手動</span><rt>shǒu dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shū rù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nenter (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">输入</span><span class=\"tr\">輸入</span><rt>shū rù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cháng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncommon \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">常</span><span class=\"tr\">常</span><rt>cháng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuse (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">用</span><span class=\"tr\">用</span><rt>yòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nèi róng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncontent (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">内容</span><span class=\"tr\">內容</span><rt>nèi róng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnow (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">现在</span><span class=\"tr\">現在</span><rt>xiàn zài</rt></ruby></abbr>AI<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhù shǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nassistant (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">助手</span><span class=\"tr\">助手</span><rt>zhù shǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able t