oltip\" title=\"xiě zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwriting (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">写作</span><span class=\"tr\">寫作</span><rt>xiě zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTask (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">任务</span><span class=\"tr\">任務</span><rt>rèn wù</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但</span><span class=\"tr\">但</span><rt>dàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì fǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhether (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是否</span><span class=\"tr\">是否</span><rt>shì fǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn cǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntherefore (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">因此</span><span class=\"tr\">因此</span><rt>yīn cǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">而</span><span class=\"tr\">而</span><rt>ér</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shī qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlose (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">失去</span><span class=\"tr\">失去</span><rt>shī qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǔ yán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlanguage (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">语言</span><span class=\"tr\">語言</span><rt>yǔ yán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真实</span><span class=\"tr\">真實</span><rt>zhēn shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tǐ yàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexperience (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">体验</span><span class=\"tr\">體驗</span><rt>tǐ yàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xīn shǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nappreciation (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">欣赏</span><span class=\"tr\">欣賞</span><rt>xīn shǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ne:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">呢</span><span class=\"tr\">呢</span><rt>ne</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(126, 'call-the-police', 'Call the police', '报警', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5152.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5152-qrwixze3iz77l61oau48f0uzaqrd7jfhefvuy43oso.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/call-the-police/', '铃美小咪你看见我的手机和钱包了吗吴小咪没有啊你再找找铃美我找了没有吴小咪是不是被偷了我们先打电话报警喂您好报警中心吴小咪您好我朋友的手机和钱包被偷了你们现在在哪里吴小咪我们在新天地商场层好的我们马上安排民警去新天地商场警察请问是你们报的警吗吴小咪对是我们报的警警察请先出示一下你们的证件吴小咪这是我的身份证铃美我的护照在钱包里也丢了警察手机和钱包是在哪儿丢的铃美就是在商场里警察知道是什么时候丢的吗铃美不知道我们在逛街没注意警察手机是什么品牌的还有颜色和型号铃美手机是白色的华为警察钱包呢铃美钱包是黑色的长方形小包里面还有我的钥匙护照和信用卡警察那先去看看商场的监控吧警察在服装店门口的是你们吧铃美对是我们警察这个跟在你们后面的人在服装店门口偷了你的手机和钱包吴小咪还能找回来吗警察我们会展开调查尽快找到这个人把东西追回来铃美那我们现在去哪里警察你们先跟我回派出所签字留下联系方式就可以回去了如果找到了我们会联系你们的吴小咪好的谢谢您铃美谢谢', 'Língměi Xiǎomī nǐ kàn jiàn wǒ de shǒu jī hé qián bāo le ma Wú Xiǎomī méi yǒu a nǐ zài zhǎo zhǎo Língměi wǒ zhǎo le méi yǒu Wú Xiǎomī shì bù shì bèi tōu le wǒ men xiān dǎ diàn huà bào jǐng wèi nín hǎo bào jǐng zhōng xīn Wú Xiǎomī nín hǎo wǒ péng yǒu de shǒu jī hé qián bāo bèi tōu le nǐ men xiàn zài zài nǎ lǐ Wú Xiǎomī wǒ men zài Xīntiāndì shāng chǎng céng hǎo de wǒ men mǎ shàng ān pái mín jǐng qù Xīntiāndì shāng chǎng jǐng chá qǐng wèn shì nǐ men bào de jǐng ma Wú Xiǎomī duì shì wǒ men bào de jǐng jǐng chá qǐng xiān chū shì yī xià nǐ men de zhèng jiàn Wú Xiǎomī zhè shì wǒ de shēn fèn zhèng Língměi wǒ de hù zhào zài qián bāo lǐ yě diū le jǐng chá shǒu jī hé qián bāo shì zài nǎr diū de Língměi jiù shì zài shāng chǎng lǐ jǐng chá zhī dào shì shén me shí hòu diū de ma Língměi bù zhī dào wǒ men zài guàng jiē méi zhù yì jǐng chá shǒu jī shì shén me pǐn pái de hái yǒu yán sè hé xíng hào Língměi shǒu jī shì bái sè de Huáwéi jǐng chá qián bāo ne Língměi qián bāo shì hēi sè de cháng fāng xíng xiǎo bāo lǐ miàn hái yǒu wǒ de yào shi hù zhào hé xìn yòng kǎ jǐng chá nà xiān qù kàn kàn shāng chǎng de jiān kòng ba jǐng chá zài fú zhuāng diàn mén kǒu de shì nǐ men ba Língměi duì shì wǒ men jǐng chá zhè gè gēn zài nǐ men hòu miàn de rén zài fú zhuāng diàn mén kǒu tōu le nǐ de shǒu jī hé qián bāo Wú Xiǎomī hái néng zhǎo huí lái ma jǐng chá wǒ men huì zhǎn kāi diào chá jǐn kuài zhǎo dào zhè gè rén bǎ dōngxi zhuī huí lái Língměi nà wǒ men xiàn zài qù nǎ lǐ jǐng chá nǐ men xiān gēn wǒ huí pài chū suǒ qiān zì liú xià lián xì fāng shì jiù kě yǐ huí qù le rú guǒ zhǎo dào le wǒ men huì lián xì nǐ men de Wú Xiǎomī hǎo de xièxie nín Língměi xièxie', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><strong>（1）</strong></p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">小咪</span><rt>Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsee (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看见</span><span class=\"tr\">看見</span><rt>kàn jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmy, mine \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我的</span><span class=\"tr\">我的</span><rt>wǒ de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncell phone (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手机</span><span class=\"tr\">手機</span><rt>shǒu jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián bāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwallet \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">钱包</span><span class=\"tr\">錢包</span><rt>qián bāo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNo \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"a:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n（part.）used at the end of a sentence to indicate confirmation or defense (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">啊</span><span class=\"tr\">啊</span><rt>a</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAgain (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">再</span><span class=\"tr\">再</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎo zhǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFind \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">找找</span><span class=\"tr\">找找</span><rt>zhǎo zhǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Língměi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSuzumi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">铃美</span><span class=\"tr\">鈴美</span><rt>Língměi</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfind (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">找</span><span class=\"tr\">找</span><rt>zhǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNo \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby></abb