lass=\"si\">需要</span><span class=\"tr\">需要</span><rt>xū yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tuō yùn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nconsignment (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">托运</span><span class=\"tr\">托運</span><rt>tuō yùn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xíng lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nluggage\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">行李</span><span class=\"tr\">行李</span><rt>xíng lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这儿</span><span class=\"tr\">這兒</span><rt>zhè ér</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstaff (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人员</span><span class=\"tr\">人員</span><rt>rén yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</