itle=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hù zhào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npassport (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">护照</span><span class=\"tr\">護照</span><rt>hù zhào</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboarding\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">登机</span><span class=\"tr\">登機</span><rt>dēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCard\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">牌</span><span class=\"tr\">牌</span><rt>pái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xíng lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nluggage\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">行李</span><span class=\"tr\">行李</span><rt>xíng lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chāo é:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexcess\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">超额</span><span class=\"tr\">超額</span><rt>chāo é</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shōu jù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nReceipt (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">收据</span><span class=\"tr\">收據</span><rt>shōu jù</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboarding\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">登机</span><span class=\"tr\">登機</span><rt>dēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr>214B，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboarding\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">登机</span><span class=\"tr\">登機</span><rt>dēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时间</span><span class=\"tr\">時間</span><rt>shí jiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr>10<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>25<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nminute (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">分</span><span class=\"tr\">分</span><rt>fēn</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoward (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">往</span><span class=\"tr\">往</span><rt>wǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nforward\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī zhí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nall the way (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一直</span><span class=\"tr\">一直</span><rt>yī zhí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWalk (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">走</span><span class=\"tr\">走</span><rt>zǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ān jiǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSecurity check\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">安检</span><span class=\"tr\">安檢</span><rt>ān jiǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xièxie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xièxie</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p>（<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī chǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAirport (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机场</span><span class=\"tr\">機場</span><rt>jī chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guǎng bō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbroadcast (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">广播</span><span class=\"tr\">廣播</span><rt>guǎng bō</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">乘坐</span><span class=\"tr\">乘坐</span><rt>chéng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>CZ3524<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"háng bān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflight (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">航班</span><span class=\"tr\">航班</span><rt>háng bān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǚ kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntravelers\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旅客</span><span class=\"tr\">旅客</span><rt>lǚ kè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhù yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nNotice (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">注意</span><span class=\"tr\">注意</span><rt>zhù yì</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bào qiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFeel sorry (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">抱歉</span><span class=\"tr\">抱歉</span><rt>bào qiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tōng zhī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnotify (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">通知</span><span class=\"tr\">通知</span><rt>tōng zhī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yóu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">由</span><span class=\"tr\">由</span><rt>yóu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng hǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nShanghai\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上海</span><span class=\"tr\">上海</span><rt>shàng hǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfly\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">飞</span><span class=\"tr\">飛</span><rt>fēi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">往</span><span class=\"tr\">往</span><rt>wǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xī ān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXi\'an\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">西安</span><span class=\"tr\">西安</span><rt>xī ān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>CZ3524<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"háng bān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflight (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">航班</span><span class=\"tr\">航班</span><rt>háng bān</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboarding\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">登机</span><span class=\"tr\">登機</span><rt>dēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lín shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntemporary (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">临时</span><span class=\"tr\">臨時</span><rt>lín shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biàn gēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nchange\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">变更</span><span class=\"tr\">變更</span><rt>biàn gēng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbring (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">带</span><span class=\"tr\">帶</span><rt>dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suí shēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTake it with you (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">随身</span><span class=\"tr\">隨身</span><rt>suí shēn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wù pǐn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngoods\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">物品</span><span class=\"tr\">物品</span><rt>wù pǐn</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎ shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nimmediately (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">马上</span><span class=\"tr\">馬上</span><rt>mǎ shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qián wǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGo to\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">前往</span><span class=\"tr\">前往</span><rt>qián wǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboarding\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">登机</span><span class=\"tr\">登機</span><rt>dēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>327A。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xièxie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xièxie</rt></ruby></abbr>！）</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHello\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你好</span><span class=\"tr\">你好</span><rt>nǐ hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng wèn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease may I ask\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请问</span><span class=\"tr\">請問</span><rt>qǐng wèn</rt></ruby></abbr>327A<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dēng jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboarding\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">登机</span><span class=\"tr\">登機</span><rt>dēng jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexit (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">口</span><span class=\"tr\">口</span><rt>kǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǎ ér:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哪儿</span><span class=\"tr\">哪兒</span><rt>nǎ ér</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstaff (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人员</span><span class=\"tr\">人員</span><rt>rén yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：327A<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"céng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlayer (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">层</span><span class=\"tr\">層</span><rt>céng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您</span><span class=\"tr\">您</span><rt>nín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFirst (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">先</span><span class=\"tr\">先</span><rt>xiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坐</span><span class=\"tr\">坐</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diàn tī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nelevator (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">电梯</span><span class=\"tr\">電梯</span><rt>diàn tī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nupper (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"céng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlayer (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">层</span><span class=\"tr\">層</span><rt>céng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rán hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThen (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">然后</span><span class=\"tr\">然後</span><rt>rán hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntake (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">乘坐</span><span class=\"tr\">乘坐</span><rt>chéng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎi dù chē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshuttle bus\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">摆渡车</span><span class=\"tr\">擺渡車</span><rt>bǎi dù chē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto arrive,to reach (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr>327A。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xièxie:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThanks (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">谢谢</span><span class=\"tr\">謝謝</span><rt>xièxie</rt></ruby></abbr>！</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstaff (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人员</span><span class=\"tr\">人員</span><rt>rén yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nno, not (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kè qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncourtesy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">客气</span><span class=\"tr\">客氣</span><rt>kè qì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(129, 'what-kind-of-house-do-you-want-to-rent', 'What kind of house do you want to rent?', '你想租什么样的房子？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5149.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5149-qnpcr6ppk14ydx12gux4ng6xoxkk7ldz2fj0wyus7m.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/what-kind-of-house-do-you-want-to-rent/', '李小姐您好我是如意中介公司的经理李丽请问有什么可以帮您铃美您好我想在陆家嘴附近租个房子李小姐您是几个人住有什么具体要求吗铃美我一个人住我想要自己做饭房间里要有无线网最好离超市和地铁站都很近李小姐您对房子大小有要求吗铃美最少要一室一厅卧室要朝南李小姐了解了我这里有几套房子符合您的要求您什么时间方便我们可以约一下看看房子铃美是这样的我还没到上海您有图片让我先看看吗对了我要精装修的房子直接拎包入住李小姐那我给您发一些图片和视频吧您放心都是真实的图片和视频铃美好的如果我满意的话就直接付钱了李小姐您看第一套房子有一个卧室一个客厅一个厨房和一个卫生间还有一个小阳台家电和家具都有卧室朝南挺大的另外还有一个小小的书房可以办公铃美这个房子有无线网吗李小姐这是精装修的公寓房物业提供无线网不过说实话上网高峰期的时候网速可能有点慢如果您需要很快的网速有时候可能会不太方便铃美我觉得这套不太适合我第二套呢李小姐第二套离陆家嘴地铁站很近走路只要十分钟附近还有两个超市和一个大商场铃美有几个房间家电和家具呢李小姐有两个朝南的卧室都不太大这个也是精装修什么都有厨房和阳台比较大客厅有点小无线网是房东自己开通的网速很快铃美听起来不错这套有电梯吗李小姐这套房子没有电梯在三楼不过房东今年才重新装修房子里面又干净又温馨房东是个退休的奶奶又热情又善良铃美这套房子怎么付房租可以每个月付吗李小姐这套房子最少三个月一付退租的话必须提前一个月告诉房东铃美那我想看看第三套李小姐第三套房子是最近新装修的房子还没有出租过只有一个大卧室但是有一个小卫生间外面还有一个公共卫生间客厅很大有办公区和娱乐区厨房有点小不过阳台很大采光不错而且是电梯房家电家具和无线网都有铃美附近方便吗李小姐离地铁站分钟附近有一个超市和一个市场买菜挺方便的铃美这个怎么付房租李小姐可以一个月一付如果你不想租了就提前半个月告诉公寓管家不过这套房子比前面两套贵块钱物业费需要自己交铃美那我还是租第二套吧我需要现在付钱吗李小姐如果您选好了就给我转账稍后我会给您收据并且请房东打扫好房子房子是密码锁房子的地址和房间密码我也会发给您您到了之后可以直接入住铃美那我直接给你转账吧对了房子的押金交多少我应该给你多少中介费李小姐房子的押金是一个月的房租也就是说一共需要交四个月房租我们收您一个月房租的作为服务费铃美好的我等会儿给您转账李小姐没问题房东和物业的微信我都发给您有任何问题都可以直接跟他们联系退房的时候房东会把押金退给您铃美好的麻烦你了', 'Lǐ xiǎo jiě nín hǎo wǒ shì Rúyì zhōng jiè gōng sī de jīng Lǐ Lǐlì qǐng wèn yǒu shén me kě yǐ bāng nín Língměi nín hǎo wǒ xiǎng zài Lùjiāzuǐ fù jìn zū gè fáng zi Lǐ xiǎo jiě nín shì jǐ gè rén zhù yǒu shén me jù tǐ yāo qiú ma Língměi wǒ yī gè rén zhù wǒ xiǎng yào zì jǐ zuò fàn fáng jiān Lǐ yào yǒu wú xiàn wǎng zuì hǎo lí chāo shì hé dì tiě zhàn dōu hěn jìn Lǐ xiǎo jiě nín duì fáng zi dà xiǎo yǒu yāo qiú ma Língměi zuì shǎo yào yī shì yī tīng wò shì yào cháo nán Lǐ xiǎo jiě liǎo jiě le wǒ zhè Lǐ yǒu jǐ tào fáng zi fú hé nín de yāo qiú nín shén me shí jiān fāng biàn wǒ men kě yǐ yuē yī xià kàn kàn fáng zi Língměi shì zhè yàng de wǒ hái méi dào shàng hǎi nín yǒu tú piàn ràng wǒ xiān kàn kàn ma duì le wǒ yào jīng zhuāng xiū de fáng zi zhí jiē līn bāo rù zhù Lǐ xiǎo jiě nà wǒ gěi nín fā yī xiē tú piàn hé shì pín ba nín fàng xīn dōu shì zhēn shí de tú piàn hé shì pín Língměi hǎo de rú guǒ wǒ mǎn yì de huà jiù zhí jiē fù qián le Lǐ xiǎo jiě nín kàn dì yī tào fáng zi yǒu yī gè wò shì yī gè kè tīng yī gè chú fáng hé yī gè wèi shēng jiān hái yǒu yī gè xiǎo yáng tái jiā diàn hé jiā jù dōu yǒu wò shì cháo nán tǐng dà de lìng wài hái yǒu yī gè xiǎo xiǎo de shū fáng kě yǐ bàn gōng Língměi zhè gè fáng zi yǒu wú xiàn wǎng ma Lǐ xiǎo jiě zhè shì jīng zhuāng xiū de gōng yù fáng wù yè tí gōng wú xiàn wǎng bù guò shuō shí huà shàng wǎng gāo fēng qī de shí hòu wǎng sù kě néng yǒu diǎn màn rú guǒ nín xū yào hěn kuài de wǎng sù yǒu shí hòu kě néng huì bù tài fāng biàn Língměi wǒ jué de zhè tào bù tài shì hé wǒ dì èr tào ne Lǐ xiǎo jiě dì èr tào lí lù jiā zuǐ dì tiě zhàn hěn jìn zǒu lù zhǐ yào shí fēn zhōng fù jìn hái yǒu liǎng gè chāo shì hé yī gè dà shāng chǎng Língměi yǒu jǐ gè fáng jiān jiā diàn hé jiā jù ne Lǐ xiǎo jiě yǒu liǎng gè cháo nán de wò shì dōu bù tài dà zhè gè yě shì jīng zhuāng xiū shén me dōu yǒu chú fáng hé yáng tái bǐ jiào dà kè tīng yǒu diǎn xiǎo wú xiàn wǎng shì fáng dōng zì jǐ kāi tōng de wǎng sù hěn kuài Língměi tīng qǐ lái bù cuò zhè tào yǒu diàn tī ma Lǐ xiǎo jiě zhè tào fáng zi méi yǒu diàn tī zài sān lóu bù guò fáng dōng jīn nián cái chóng xīn zhuāng xiū fáng zi Lǐ miàn yòu gān jìng yòu wēn xīn fáng dōng shì gè tuì xiū de nǎi nǎi yòu rè qíng yòu shàn liáng Língměi zhè tào fáng zi zěn me fù fáng zū kě yǐ měi gè yuè fù ma Lǐ xiǎo jiě zhè tào fáng zi zuì shǎo sān gè yuè yī fù tuì zū de huà bì xū tí qián yī gè yuè gào sù fáng dōng Língměi nà wǒ xiǎng kàn kàn dì sān tào Lǐ xiǎo jiě dì sān tào fáng zi shì zuì jìn xīn zhuāng xiū de fáng zi hái méi yǒu chū zū guò zhǐ yǒu yī gè dà wò shì dàn shì yǒu yī gè xiǎo wèi shēng jiān wài miàn hái yǒu yī gè gōng gòng wèi shēng jiān kè tīng hěn dà yǒu bàn gōng qū hé yú lè qū chú fáng yǒu diǎn xiǎo bù guò yáng tái hěn dà cǎi guāng bù cuò ér qiě shì diàn tī fáng jiā diàn jiā jù hé wú xiàn wǎng dōu yǒu Língměi fù jìn fāng biàn ma Lǐ xiǎo jiě lí dì tiě zhàn fēn zhōng fù jìn yǒu yī gè chāo shì hé yī gè shì chǎng mǎi cài tǐng fāng biàn de Língměi zhè gè zěn me fù fáng zū Lǐ xiǎo jiě kě yǐ yī gè yuè yī fù rú guǒ nǐ bù xiǎng zū le jiù tí qián bàn gè yuè gào sù gōng yù guǎn jiā bù guò zhè tào fáng zi bǐ qián miàn liǎng tào guì kuài qián wù yè fèi xū yào zì jǐ jiāo Língměi nà wǒ hái shì zū dì èr tào ba wǒ xū yào xiàn zài fù qián ma Lǐ xiǎo jiě rú guǒ nín xuǎn hǎo le jiù gěi wǒ zhuǎn zhàng shāo hòu wǒ huì gěi nín shōu jù bìng qiě qǐng fáng dōng dǎ sǎo hǎo fáng zi fáng zi shì mì mǎ suǒ fáng zi de dì zhǐ hé fáng jiān mì mǎ wǒ yě huì fā gěi nín nín dào le zhī hòu kě yǐ zhí jiē rù zhù Língměi nà wǒ zhí jiē gěi nǐ zhuǎn zhàng ba duì le fáng zi de yā jīn jiāo duō shǎo wǒ yīng gāi gěi nǐ duō shǎo zhōng jiè fèi Lǐ xiǎo jiě fáng zi de yā jīn shì yī gè yuè de fáng zū yě jiù shì shuō yī gòng xū yào jiāo sì gè yuè fáng zū wǒ men shōu nín yī gè yuè fáng zū de zuò wéi fú wù fèi Língměi hǎo de wǒ děng huì ér gěi nín zhuǎn zhàng Lǐ xiǎo jiě méi wèn tí fáng dōng hé wù yè de wēi xìn wǒ dōu fā gěi nín yǒu rèn hé wèn tí dōu kě yǐ zhí jiē gēn tā men lián xì tuì fáng de shí hòu fáng dōng huì bǎ yā jīn tuì gěi nín Língměi hǎo de má fán nǐ le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李</span><span class=\"tr\">李</span><rt>Lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo jiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMiss (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小姐</span><span class=\"tr\">小姐</span><rt>xiǎo jiě</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nín hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHello\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">您好</span><span class=\"tr\">您好</span><rt>nín hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Rúyì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nRuyi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">如意</span><span class=\"tr\">如意</span><rt>Rúyì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng jiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nagency (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中介</span><span class=\"tr\">中介</span><rt>zhōng jiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompany (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公司</span><span class=\"tr\">公司</span><rt>gōng sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng Lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmanager (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经理</span><span class=\"tr\">經理</span><rt>jīng Lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lǐlì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLi Li\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">李丽</span><span class=\"tr\">李麗</span><rt>Lǐlì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng wèn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease may I ask\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请问</span><span class=\"tr\">請問</span><rt>qǐng wèn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWhat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽</span><rt>shén me</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</spa