(130, 'please-turn-your-phone-to-silent', 'Please turn your phone to silent', '请把手机调成静音', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5148.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5148-qn47oyjmwp13iwhdvbonksot7lxzozbr5sra9wh93m.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/please-turn-your-phone-to-silent/', '苏南经理说今天早上十点半开会对吗同事是的马上就要开始了经理大家好今天我们要开个工作周会请大家坐好把手机调成静音苏南好了经理今天开会除了要告诉大家上次项目的结果还有一件事我们要讨论新的视频内容苏南经理我们上次的视频怎么样经理上次的视频很受欢迎播放量很高很多观众给我们评论点赞非常喜欢我们做的关于中国传统建筑的视频尤其是苏南你的创意非常好苏南谢谢经理我会继续努力的经理现在我们来讨论下一次的视频内容大家有什么想法都可以站起来说一说苏南我们可以做世界饮食与烹饪方法同事我觉得内容有点多虽然饮食和烹饪关系很密切但是饮食是饮食烹饪是烹饪我们应该分开做经理世界饮食有很多与其简单地推荐饮食不如做一些更有文化内涵的东西苏南经理我有一个想法不如我们做一个视频讨论同一个食材在不同地区的做法和吃法顺便说说为什么会出现这样的不同同事听起来不错我知道中国和西班牙都吃油条这是很有意思的内容经理既然这样我们就讨论面粉的做法和吃法吧在欧洲面粉变成了面包在亚洲面粉变成了饺子包子和馒头我们做一个关于面粉的视频再来讨论一下为什么会变成这样不同的饮食方式苏南好的', 'Sūnán jīng lǐ shuō jīn tiān zǎo shàng shí diǎn bàn kāi huì duì ma tóng shì shì de mǎ shàng jiù yào kāi shǐ le jīng lǐ dà jiā hǎo jīn tiān wǒ men yào kāi gè gōng zuò zhōu huì qǐng dà jiā zuò hǎo bǎ shǒu jī tiáo chéng jìng yīn Sūnán hǎo le jīng lǐ jīn tiān kāi huì chú le yào gào sù dà jiā shàng cì xiàng mù de jié guǒ hái yǒu yī jiàn shì wǒ men yào tǎo lùn xīn de shì pín nèi róng Sūnán jīng lǐ wǒ men shàng cì de shì pín zěn me yàng jīng lǐ shàng cì de shì pín hěn shòu huān yíng bō fàng liàng hěn gāo hěn duō guān zhòng gěi wǒ men píng lùn diǎn zàn fēi cháng xǐ huān wǒ men zuò de guān yú zhōng guó chuán tǒng jiàn zhù de shì pín yóu qí shì Sūnán nǐ de chuàng yì fēi cháng hǎo Sūnán xiè xiè jīng lǐ wǒ huì jì xù nǔ lì de jīng lǐ xiàn zài wǒ men lái tǎo lùn xià yī cì de shì pín nèi róng dà jiā yǒu shén me xiǎng fǎ dōu kě yǐ zhàn qǐ lái shuō yī shuō Sūnán wǒ men kě yǐ zuò shì jiè yǐn shí yǔ pēng rèn fāng fǎ tóng shì wǒ jué de nèi róng yǒu diǎn duō suī rán yǐn shí hé pēng rèn guān xì hěn mì qiè dàn shì yǐn shí shì yǐn shí pēng rèn shì pēng rèn wǒ men yīng gāi fēn kāi zuò jīng lǐ shì jiè yǐn shí yǒu hěn duō yǔ qí jiǎn dān de tuī jiàn yǐn shí bù rú zuò yī xiē gèng yǒu wén huà nèi hán de dōngxi Sūnán jīng lǐ wǒ yǒu yī gè xiǎng fǎ bù rú wǒ men zuò yī gè shì pín tǎo lùn tóng yī gè shí cái zài bù tóng dì qū de zuò fǎ hé chī fǎ shùn biàn shuō shuō wèi shén me huì chū xiàn zhè yàng de bù tóng tóng shì tīng qǐ lái bù cuò wǒ zhī dào zhōng guó hé xī bān yá dōu chī yóu tiáo zhè shì hěn yǒu yìsi de nèi róng jīng lǐ jì rán zhè yàng wǒ men jiù tǎo lùn miàn fěn de zuò fǎ hé chī fǎ ba zài ōu zhōu miàn fěn biàn chéng le miàn bāo zài yà zhōu miàn fěn biàn chéng le jiǎo zi bāo zi hé mán tou wǒ men zuò yī gè guān yú miàn fěn de shì pín zài lái tǎo lùn yī xià wèi shén me huì biàn chéng zhè yàng bù tóng de yǐn shí fāng shì Sūnán hǎo de', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sūnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunan\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苏南</span><span class=\"tr\">蘇南</span><rt>Sūnán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmanager (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经理</span><span class=\"tr\">經理</span><rt>jīng lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMorning (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早上</span><span class=\"tr\">早上</span><rt>zǎo shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">十</span><span class=\"tr\">十</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"diǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\no\'clock (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">点</span><span class=\"tr\">點</span><rt>diǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHalf (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">半</span><span class=\"tr\">半</span><rt>bàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave meeting\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开会</span><span class=\"tr\">開會</span><rt>kāi huì</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nright (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóng shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncolleague (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">同事</span><span class=\"tr\">同事</span><rt>tóng shì</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYes\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是的</span><span class=\"tr\">是的</span><rt>shì de</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎ shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nimmediately (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">马上</span><span class=\"tr\">馬上</span><rt>mǎ shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust, with regard to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe going to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi shǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstart (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开始</span><span class=\"tr\">開始</span><rt>kāi shǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmanager (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经理</span><span class=\"tr\">經理</span><rt>jīng lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEveryone (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大家</span><span class=\"tr\">大家</span><rt>dà jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>！<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe going to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n开会 have meeting (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开</span><span class=\"tr\">開</span><rt>kāi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweek\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">周</span><span class=\"tr\">周</span><rt>zhōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmeeting (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplease (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">请</span><span class=\"tr\">請</span><rt>qǐng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEveryone (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大家</span><span class=\"tr\">大家</span><rt>dà jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsit (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坐</span><span class=\"tr\">坐</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngoog, well (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(particle marking the following noun as a direct object) (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">把</span><span class=\"tr\">把</span><rt>bǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncell phone (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">手机</span><span class=\"tr\">手機</span><rt>shǒu jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiáo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntune\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">调</span><span class=\"tr\">調</span><rt>tiáo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">成</span><span class=\"tr\">成</span><rt>chéng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nquietm silent\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">静</span><span class=\"tr\">靜</span><rt>jìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsound\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">音</span><span class=\"tr\">音</span><rt>yīn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sūnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSunan\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">苏南</span><span class=\"tr\">蘇南</span><rt>Sūnán</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngood (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīng lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmanager (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">经理</span><span class=\"tr\">經理</span><rt>jīng lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jīn tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntoday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">今天</span><span class=\"tr\">今天</span><rt>jīn tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave meeting\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开会