"chéng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">成</span><span class=\"tr\">成</span><rt>chéng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎo zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndumpling (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">饺子</span><span class=\"tr\">餃子</span><rt>jiǎo zi</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bāo zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsteamed stuffed bun (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">包子</span><span class=\"tr\">包子</span><rt>bāo zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mán tou:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSteamed bun (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">馒头</span><span class=\"tr\">饅頭</span><rt>mán tou</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwe, us (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我们</span><span class=\"tr\">我們</span><rt>wǒ men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmake (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guān yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nabout (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">关于</span><span class=\"tr\">關于</span><rt>guān yú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn fěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflour\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面粉</span><span class=\"tr\">麵粉</span><rt>miàn fěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt