class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflowers\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花卉</span><span class=\"tr\">花卉</span><rt>huā huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì chǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmarket (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">市场</span><span class=\"tr\">市場</span><rt>shì chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSell (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">卖</span><span class=\"tr\">賣</span><rt>mài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflower (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nI, me (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnever (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从来</span><span class=\"tr\">從來</span><rt>cóng lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没</span><span class=\"tr\">沒</span><rt>méi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Wú Xiǎomī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWu Xiaomi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吴小咪</span><span class=\"tr\">吳小咪</span><rt>Wú Xiǎomī</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù jǐn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot only (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不仅</span><span class=\"tr\">不僅</span><rt>bù jǐn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSell (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">卖</span><span class=\"tr\">賣</span><rt>mài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflower (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ér qiě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">而且</span><span class=\"tr\">而且</span><rt>ér qiě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSell (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">卖</span><span class=\"tr\">賣</span><rt>mài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bié de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nother\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">别的</span><span class=\"tr\">別的</span><rt>bié de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhí wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplant (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">植物</span><span class=\"tr\">植物</span><rt>zhí wù</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Dàlóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDalong\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大龙</span><span class=\"tr\">大龍</span><rt>Dàlóng</rt></ruby></abbr>：<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlisten (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听</span><span class=\"tr\">聽</span><rt>tīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(complement) (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">