4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">市场</span><span class=\"tr\">市場</span><rt>shì chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhuāng xiū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndecorate\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">装修</span><span class=\"tr\">裝修</span><rt>zhuāng xiū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fáng zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhouse\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">房子</span><span class=\"tr\">房子</span><rt>fáng zi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cái liào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMaterial (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">材料</span><span class=\"tr\">材料</span><rt>cái liào</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ wán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nantique\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">古玩</span><span class=\"tr\">古玩</span><rt>gǔ wán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì chǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmarket (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">市场</span><span class=\"tr\">市場</span><rt>shì chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mǎi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npurchase (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">买</span><span class=\"tr\">買</span><rt>mǎi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ dǒng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nantique (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">古董</span><span class=\"tr\">古董</span><rt>gǔ dǒng</rt>