(135, 'pretend-to-go-to-work', 'Pretend to go to work', '假装上班', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/5143.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/5143-qewy7pncvwmpzjalse88ej2jj8ivltp7sh3qje4hn6.jpg', '', 'HSK5', 'https://mandarinbean.com/pretend-to-go-to-work/', '近几年大公司不断裁员小公司生存艰难失业的人越来越多很多人有工作的时候都想躺平提前退休但是当真的失业时他们又开始假装上班了对于他们来说比失业更难的是告诉家人自己失业了假装上班最直接的原因是来自家人的压力如果你还没结婚那需要隐瞒的对象主要是父母对于父母来说本来平常的事情可能会让他们胡思乱想寝食难安而如果你已经结婚了那需要隐瞒的对象可能还要加上自己的爱人孩子甚至爱人的父母除此之外还要应付亲戚邻居等人总之如果你把失业的痛苦分享出去只会得到更多的痛苦所以很多人选择了隐瞒失业的事实假装上班假装上班不仅考验心态还考验演技如果是独自在外生活就需要应对电话或视频如果是跟家人一起住隐瞒的难度就更高了不但需要长时间撒谎还需要扮演自己上班时早出晚归的生活状态这些假装上班的人们一般会出现在公共图书馆付费自习室咖啡馆快餐店公园等地方安静地度过一整天有车的人会每天开车出门找个地方停车然后在车上玩手机或者睡觉到了下班时间再按时回家虽然看起来很绝望但是他们大部分都还是会积极解决问题有的人重新求职有的人准备考试有的人换行业有的人换城市无论如何总会结束假装上班的日子重新开始', 'jìn jǐ nián dà gōng sī bù duàn cái yuán xiǎo gōng sī shēng cún jiān nán shī yè de rén yuè lái yuè duō hěn duō rén yǒu gōng zuò de shí hòu dōu xiǎng tǎng píng tí qián tuì xiū dàn shì dāng zhēn de shī yè shí tā men yòu kāi shǐ jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān le duì yú tā men lái shuō bǐ shī yè gèng nán de shì gào sù jiā rén zì jǐ shī yè le jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān zuì zhí jiē de yuán yīn shì lái zì jiā rén de yā lì rú guǒ nǐ hái méi jié hūn nà xū yào yǐn mán de duì xiàng zhǔ yào shì fù mǔ duì yú fù mǔ lái shuō běn lái píng cháng de shì qíng kě néng huì ràng tā men hú sī luàn xiǎng qǐn shí nán ān ér rú guǒ nǐ yǐ jīng jié hūn le nà xū yào yǐn mán de duì xiàng kě néng hái yào jiā shàng zì jǐ de ài rén hái zi shèn zhì ài rén de fù mǔ chú cǐ zhī wài hái yào yìng fù qīn qī lín jū děng rén zǒng zhī rú guǒ nǐ bǎ shī yè de tòng kǔ fēn xiǎng chū qù zhǐ huì dé dào gèng duō de tòng kǔ suǒ yǐ hěn duō rén xuǎn zé le yǐn mán shī yè de shì shí jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān bù jǐn kǎo yàn xīn tài hái kǎo yàn yǎn jì rú guǒ shì dú zì zài wài shēng huó jiù xū yào yìng duì diàn huà huò shì pín rú guǒ shì gēn jiā rén yī qǐ zhù yǐn mán de nán dù jiù gèng gāo le bù dàn xū yào cháng shí jiān sā huǎng hái xū yào bàn yǎn zì jǐ shàng bān shí zǎo chū wǎn guī de shēng huó zhuàng tài zhè xiē jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān de rén men yī bān huì chū xiàn zài gōng gòng tú shū guǎn fù fèi zì xí shì kā fēi guǎn kuài cān diàn gōng yuán děng dì fāng ān jìng de dù guò yī zhěng tiān yǒu chē de rén huì měi tiān kāi chē chū mén zhǎo gè dì fāng tíng chē rán hòu zài chē shàng wán shǒu jī huò zhě shuì jiào dào le xià bān shí jiān zài àn shí huí jiā suī rán kàn qǐ lái hěn jué wàng dàn shì tā men dà bù fèn dōu hái shì huì jī jí jiě jué wèn tí yǒu de rén chóng xīn qiú zhí yǒu de rén zhǔn bèi kǎo shì yǒu de rén huàn háng yè yǒu de rén huàn chéng shì wú lùn rú hé zǒng huì jié shù jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān de rì zi chóng xīn kāi shǐ', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jìn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrecent (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">近</span><span class=\"tr\">近</span><rt>jìn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSeveral (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">几</span><span class=\"tr\">幾</span><rt>jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompany (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公司</span><span class=\"tr\">公司</span><rt>gōng sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù duàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncontinuously (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不断</span><span class=\"tr\">不斷</span><rt>bù duàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cái yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndownsizing (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">裁员</span><span class=\"tr\">裁員</span><rt>cái yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSmall (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompany (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公司</span><span class=\"tr\">公司</span><rt>gōng sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng cún:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSurvive (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生存</span><span class=\"tr\">生存</span><rt>shēng cún</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiān nán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndifficult (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">艰难</span><span class=\"tr\">艱難</span><rt>jiān nán</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shī yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunemployment (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">失业</span><span class=\"tr\">失業</span><rt>shī yè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè lái yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmore and more\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">越来越</span><span class=\"tr\">越來越</span><rt>yuè lái yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWork (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工作</span><span class=\"tr\">工作</span><rt>gōng zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhen (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时候</span><span class=\"tr\">時候</span><rt>shí hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlie (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">躺</span><span class=\"tr\">躺</span><rt>tǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"píng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflat (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">平</span><span class=\"tr\">平</span><rt>píng</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tí qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin advance (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">提前</span><span class=\"tr\">提前</span><rt>tí qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tuì xiū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nretire (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">退休</span><span class=\"tr\">退休</span><rt>tuì xiū</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dàn shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhen (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">当</span><span class=\"tr\">當</span><rt>dāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhēn de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreal\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">真的</span><span class=\"tr\">真的</span><rt>zhēn de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shī yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunemployment (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">失业</span><span class=\"tr\">失業</span><rt>shī yè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhen\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nagain (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">又</span><span class=\"tr\">又</span><rt>yòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi shǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstart (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">开始</span><span class=\"tr\">開始</span><rt>kāi shǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎ zhuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npretend (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">假装</span><span class=\"tr\">假裝</span><rt>jiǎ zhuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng bān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwork (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上班</span><span class=\"tr\">上班</span><rt>shàng bān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfor, about, with regard to (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对于</span><span class=\"tr\">對于</span><rt>duì yú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lái shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n对于……来说，as for…..., as regard to……\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">来说</span><span class=\"tr\">來說</span><rt>lái shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthan, used in comparative sentences (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">比</span><span class=\"tr\">比</span><rt>bǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shī yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunemployment (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">失业</span><span class=\"