<ruby><span class=\"si\">不论</span><span class=\"tr\">不論</span><rt>bù lùn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want to, would like to, ask for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shén me yàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhat kind\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">什么样</span><span class=\"tr\">什麽樣</span><rt>shén me yàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huǒ chē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntrain\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">火车</span><span class=\"tr\">火車</span><rt>huǒ chē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǚ xíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntravel\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旅行</span><span class=\"tr\">旅行</span><rt>lǚ xíng</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalways\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">总</span><span class=\"tr\">總</span><rt>zǒng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nable (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">能</span><span class=\"tr\">能</span><rt>néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntry to find (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">找</span><span class=\"tr\">找</span><rt>zhǎo</rt>