腊八节</span><span class=\"tr\">臘八節</span><rt>là bā jié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miǎn fèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfree (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">免费</span><span class=\"tr\">免費</span><rt>miǎn fèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsend as gift (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">送</span><span class=\"tr\">送</span><rt>sòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nporridge \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">粥</span><span class=\"tr\">粥</span><rt>zhōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">给</span><span class=\"tr\">給</span><rt>gěi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neveryone (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大家</span><span class=\"tr\">大家</span><rt>dà jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yìnlè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYinle \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">印乐</span><span class=\"tr\">印樂</span><rt>Yìnlè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMaster \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大师</span><span class=\"tr\">大師</span><rt>dà shī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qīn zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npersonally (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">亲自</span><span class=\"tr\">親自</span><rt>qīn zì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gěi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><sp