chopsticks (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">筷子</span><span class=\"tr\">筷子</span><rt>kuài zi</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHe \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">何</span><span class=\"tr\">何</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǚ shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMs. (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">女士</span><span class=\"tr\">女士</span><rt>nǚ shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">说</span><span class=\"tr\">說</span><rt>shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwould (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会</span><span class=\"tr\">會</span><rt>huì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wēn nuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwarm (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">温暖</span><span class=\"tr\">溫暖</span><rt>wēn nuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī xiē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSome \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一些</span><span class=\"tr\">一些</span><rt>yī xiē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yóu kè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntourists \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">游客</span><span class=\"tr\">游客</span><rt>yóu kè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gào sù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntell (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">告诉</span><span class=\"tr\">告訴</span><rt>gào sù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì zhě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreporters (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">记者</span><span class=\"tr\">記者</span><rt>jì zhě</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthey, them (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们</span><span class=\"tr\">他們</span><rt>tā men</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tīng shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nheard \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">听说</span><span class=\"tr\">聽說</span><rt>tīng shuō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncan, be able to (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可以</span><span class=\"tr\">可以</span><rt>kě yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntemple \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">寺</span><span class=\"tr\">寺</span><rt>sì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninside (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">里</span><span class=\"tr\">裏</span><rt>lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miǎn fèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfree (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">免费</span><span class=\"tr\">免費</span><rt>miǎn fèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hē:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrink (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">喝</span><span class=\"tr\">喝</span><rt>hē</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chá shuǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntea \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">茶水</span><span class=\"tr\">茶水</span><rt>chá shuǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jué de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto think, to feel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">觉得</span><span class=\"tr\">覺得</span><rt>jué de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huó dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nactivity (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">活动</span><span class=\"tr\">活動</span><rt>huó dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tè bié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspecial (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">特别</span><span class=\"tr\">特別</span><rt>tè bié</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nboth,all (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\">都</span><rt>dōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto want, would like (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì yī shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntry it out \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">试一试</span><span class=\"tr\">試一試</span><rt>shì yī shì</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(143, 'pretend-to-work-company', '“Pretend to Work” Company', '假装上班公司', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6143.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6143-rbqukze1vwyf0hmxlhikogec1wrodzd9nv1uec2ogi.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/pretend-to-work-company/', '最近杭州一家名为假装上班无限公司的办公空间引发热议这里的员工每天朝九晚六上班不仅没有工资还要倒付元尽管如此短短两个月已有三十多人前来体验为什么有人愿意花钱假装上班这家公司办公环境标准工位会议室直播间一应俱全还有老板设计的公司前台大三学生小岳是老员工之一他利用暑假每天到公司上班虽然是假装上班但他跟随老板参加商业活动学习企业经验他说这比做家教或实习更有收获这元花得值岁的朱小姐是一位创业者她在家做饰品网店生意但在家效率不高于是选择来这里上班她说这里安静有氛围工作效率高一月元很划算还有人从假上班变成真上班小彭原本是来创业的但生意失败后被创始人陈英健看中成了他的正式员工创意起源帮年轻人适应职场节奏假装上班无限公司的创始人陈英健是一位后创业者做商业地产多年他说这个创意源于朋友孩子的想法先体验上班生活练习面试为未来就业做好准备正好他有空闲的办公场地于是合作试试公司提供标准办公条件如大工位茶水还有时不时的免费午饭陈英健说我们不是为了赚钱而是想为年轻人提供一个过渡空间来这里的人主要有三类想低成本创业的年轻人正在找工作的待业者想提前了解职场生活的大学生也有每天都来上班甚至加班到晚上十点的几位积极分子陈英健表示元天的收费是为了明确法律关系这其实不划算但能避免责任问题他说很多年轻人在迷茫期来到这里不仅找回了节奏结识了志同道合的朋友最终找到了自己的方向', 'zuì jìn Hángzhōu yī jiā míng wéi jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān wú xiàn gōng sī de bàn gōng kōng jiān yǐn fā rè yì zhè lǐ de yuán gōng měi tiān cháo jiǔ wǎn liù shàng bān bù jǐn méi yǒu gōng zī hái yào dào fù yuán jǐn guǎn rú cǐ duǎn duǎn liǎng gè yuè yǐ yǒu sān shí duō rén qián lái tǐ yàn wèi shén me yǒu rén yuàn yì huā qián jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān zhè jiā gōng sī bàn gōng huán jìng biāo zhǔn gōng wèi huì yì shì zhí bō jiān yī yīng jù quán hái yǒu lǎo bǎn shè jì de gōng sī qián tái dà sān xué shēng Xiǎo Yuè shì lǎo yuán gōng zhī yī tā lì yòng shǔ jià měi tiān dào gōng sī shàng bān suī rán shì jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān dàn tā gēn suí lǎo bǎn cān jiā shāng yè huó dòng xué xí qǐ yè jīng yàn tā shuō zhè bǐ zuò jiā jiào huò shí xí gèng yǒu shōu huò zhè yuán huā de zhí suì de Zhū xiǎo jiě shì yī wèi chuàng yè zhě tā zài jiā zuò shì pǐn wǎng diàn shēng yì dàn zài jiā xiào lǜ bù gāo yú shì xuǎn zé lái zhè lǐ shàng bān tā shuō zhè lǐ ān jìng yǒu fēn wéi gōng zuò xiào lǜ gāo yī yuè yuán hěn huá suàn hái yǒu rén cóng jiǎ shàng bān biàn chéng zhēn shàng bān xiǎo Péng yuán běn shì lái chuàng yè de dàn shēng yì shī bài hòu bèi chuàng shǐ rén Chén Yīngjiàn kàn zhòng chéng le tā de zhèng shì yuán gōng chuàng yì qǐ yuán bāng nián qīng rén shì yìng zhí chǎng jié zòu jiǎ zhuāng shàng bān wú xiàn gōng sī de chuàng shǐ rén Chén Yīngjiàn shì yī wèi hòu chuàng yè zhě zuò shāng yè dì chǎn duō nián tā shuō zhè gè chuàng yì yuán yú péng yǒu hái zi de xiǎng fǎ xiān tǐ yàn shàng bān shēng huó liàn xí miàn shì wèi wèi lái jiù yè zuò hǎo zhǔn bèi zhèng hǎo tā yǒu kòng xián de bàn gōng chǎng dì yú shì hé zuò shì shì gōng sī tí gōng biāo zhǔn bàn gōng tiáo jiàn rú dà gōng wèi chá shuǐ hái yǒu shí bù shí de miǎn fèi wǔ fàn Chén Yīngjiàn shuō wǒ men bù shì wèi le zhuàn qián ér shì xiǎng wèi nián qīng rén tí gōng yī gè guò dù kōng jiān lái zhè lǐ de rén zhǔ yào yǒu sān lèi xiǎng dī chéng běn chuàng yè de nián qīng rén zhèng zài zhǎo gōng zuò de dài yè zhě xiǎng tí qián liǎo jiě zhí chǎng shēng huó de dà xué shēng yě yǒu měi tiān dōu lái shàng bān shèn zhì jiā bān dào wǎn shàng shí diǎn de jǐ wèi jī jí fèn zǐ Chén Yīngjiàn biǎo shì yuán tiān de shōu fèi shì wèi le míng què fǎ lǜ guān xì zhè qí shí bù huá suàn dàn néng bì miǎn zé rèn wèn tí tā shuō hěn duō nián qīng rén zài mí máng qī lái dào zhè lǐ bù jǐn zhǎo huí le jié zòu jié shí le zhì tóng dào hé de péng yǒu zuì zhōng zhǎo dào le zì jǐ de fāng xiàng', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì jìn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrecently (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Hángzhōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHangzhou \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">杭州</span><span class=\"tr\">杭州</span><rt>Hángzhōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnamed \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">名</span><span class=\"tr\">名</span><rt>míng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">为</span><span class=\"tr\">爲</span><rt>wéi</rt></ruby></abbr>“ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǎ zhuāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPretend (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">假装</span><span class=\"tr\">假裝</span><rt>jiǎ zhuāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng bān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwork (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上班</span><span class=\"tr\">上班</span><rt>shàng bān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wú xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nunlimited \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">无限</span><span class=\"tr\">無限</span><rt>wú xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompany (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公司</span><span class=\"tr\">公司</span><rt>gōng sī</rt></ruby></abbr>” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bàn gōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwork \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">办公</span><span class=\"tr\">辦公</span><rt>bàn gōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kōng jiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspace (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">空间</span><span class=\"tr\">空間</span><rt>kōng jiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐn fā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsparked \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">引发</span><span class=\"tr\">引發</span><rt>yǐn fā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nheated (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">热</span><span class=\"tr\">熱</span><rt>rè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndiscussion \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">议</span><span class=\"tr\">議</span><rt>yì</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhere \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这里</span><span class=\"tr\">這裏</span><rt>zhè lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr>“ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán gōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nemployee \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">员工</span><span class=\"tr\">員工</span><rt>yuán gōng</rt></ruby></abbr>” <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nevery (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cháo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">朝</span><span class=\"tr\">朝</span><rt>cháo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n9 (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">九</span><span class=\"tr\">九</span><rt>jiǔ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">晚</span><span class=\"tr\">晚</span><rt>wǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n6 (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">六</span><span class=\"tr\">六</span><rt>liù</rt></ruby></abbr>“ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng bān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwork (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上班</span><span class=\"tr\">上班</span><rt>shàng bān</rt></ruby></abbr>” ， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù jǐn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot only (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不仅</span><span class=\"tr\">不僅</span><rt>bù jǐn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"méi yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwithout \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">没有</span><span class=\"tr\">沒有</span><rt>méi yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng zī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsalary (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">工资</span><span class=\"tr\">工資</span><rt>gōng zī</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neven (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">还</span><span class=\"tr\">還</span><rt>hái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nneed (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninverted (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">倒</span><span class=\"tr\">倒</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npay \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">付</span><span class=\"tr\">付</span><rt>fù</rt></ruby></abbr>30 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyuan (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">元</span><span class=\"tr\">元</span><rt>yuán</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐn guǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAlthough (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">尽管</span><span class=\"tr\">儘管</span><rt>jǐn guǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rú cǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">如此</span><span class=\"tr\">如此</span><rt>rú cǐ</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duǎn duǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshort, brief \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">短短</span><span class=\"tr\">短短</span><rt>duǎn duǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalready \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">已</span><span class=\"tr\">已</span><rt>yǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><rub