>朋友</span><rt>péng yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì zhōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nultimately \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最终</span><span class=\"tr\">最終</span><rt>zuì zhōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎo dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfind \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">找到</span><span class=\"tr\">找到</span><rt>zhǎo dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zì jǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noneself (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">自己</span><span class=\"tr\">自己</span><rt>zì jǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fāng xiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndirection (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">方向</span><span class=\"tr\">方向</span><rt>fāng xiàng</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(144, 'the-massaco-tribe-of-the-amazon-rainforest', 'The Massaco Tribe of the Amazon Rainforest', '亚马逊雨林部落——Massaco', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6142.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6142-ra8dr2bmj6og77fk53t942pxp3hpzva9g7dkn6g7ki.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/the-massaco-tribe-of-the-amazon-rainforest/', '巴西的亚马逊雨林深处有很多个原住民部落最近其中一个部落的生活被公布出来他们的生活被巴西的原住民保护基金会用自动相机拍了下来这个部落叫位于亚马逊森林砍伐最严重的州之一外界只能以这个部落生活的河流来命名但是我们对他们真正的名字语言文化信仰等一无所知这个部落的人口约至人会使用弓箭狩猎随着季节变化在森林中迁徙他们的人数比年代增加了至少一倍但是外界的伐木走私毒品等活动仍然威胁着他们的生活', 'Bāxī de Yàmǎxùn yǔ lín shēn chù yǒu hěn duō gè yuán zhù mín bù luò zuì jìn qí zhōng yī gè bù luò de shēng huó bèi gōng bù chū lái tā men de shēng huó bèi Bāxī de yuán zhù mín bǎo hù jī jīn huì yòng zì dòng xiàng jī pāi le xià lái zhè gè bù luò jiào wèi yú Yàmǎxùn sēn lín kǎn fá zuì yán zhòng de zhōu zhī yī wài jiè zhǐ néng yǐ zhè gè bù luò shēng huó de hé liú lái mìng míng dàn shì wǒ men duì tā men zhēn zhèng de míng zì yǔ yán wén huà xìn yǎng děng yī wú suǒ zhī zhè gè bù luò de rén kǒu yuē zhì rén huì shǐ yòng gōng jiàn shòu liè suí zhe jì jié biàn huà zài sēn lín zhōng qiān xǐ tā men de rén shù bǐ nián dài zēng jiā le zhì shǎo yī bèi dàn shì wài jiè de fá mù zǒu sī dú pǐn děng huó dòng réng rán wēi xié zhe tā men de shēng huó', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Bāxī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBrazil \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">巴西</span><span class=\"tr\">巴西</span><rt>Bāxī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yàmǎxùn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAmazon \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">亚马逊</span><span class=\"tr\">亞馬遜</span><rt>Yàmǎxùn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǔ lín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrainforest \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">雨林</span><span class=\"tr\">雨林</span><rt>yǔ lín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēn chù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndepths \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">深处</span><span class=\"tr\">深處</span><rt>shēn chù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán zhù mín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nindigenous \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">原住民</span><span class=\"tr\">原住民</span><rt>yuán zhù mín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù luò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntribes \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">部落</span><span class=\"tr\">部落</span><rt>bù luò</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì jìn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrecently (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qí zhōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\namong (which, them, etc.) (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">其中</span><span class=\"tr\">其中</span><rt>qí zhōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù luò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntribe \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">部落</span><span class=\"tr\">部落</span><rt>bù luò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;