an class=\"tr\">伐木</span><rt>fá mù</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒu sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsmuggle (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">走私</span><span class=\"tr\">走私</span><rt>zǒu sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dú pǐn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndrugs (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">毒品</span><span class=\"tr\">毒品</span><rt>dú pǐn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\netc. (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huó dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nactivities (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">活动</span><span class=\"tr\">活動</span><rt>huó dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"réng rán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstill (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">仍然</span><span class=\"tr\">仍然</span><rt>réng rán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wēi xié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthreaten (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">威胁</span><span class=\"tr\">威脅</span><rt>wēi xié</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhe:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā men de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntheir \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">他们的</span><span class=\"tr\">他們的</span><rt>tā men de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng huó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlife (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55'),
(145, 'china-u-s-talks', 'China-U.S. Talks', '中美会谈', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6141.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6141-r8jht2tt52uuyml81bw448hf8eroqr3zc1bw5p2moi.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/china-u-s-talks/', '年月中国和美国在日内瓦会谈后宣布未来九十天美国对华关税将从降至中国对美关税将从降至会谈结果大超预期市场情绪乐观导致股市大涨订单大增运费上升总的来说紧张的两国关系得到缓和整体商业活动也有希望恢复', 'nián yuè Zhōngguó hé Měiguó zài Rìnèiwǎ huì tán hòu xuān bù wèi lái jiǔ shí tiān Měiguó duì huá guān shuì jiāng cóng jiàng zhì Zhōngguó duì měi guān shuì jiāng cóng jiàng zhì huì tán jié guǒ dà chāo yù qī shì chǎng qíng xù lè guān dǎo zhì gǔ shì dà zhǎng dìng dān dà zēng yùn fèi shàng shēng zǒng de lái shuō jǐn zhāng de liǎng guó guān xì dé dào huǎn hé zhěng tǐ shāng yè huó dòng yě yǒu xī wàng huī fù', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p>2025 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyear (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">年</span><span class=\"tr\">年</span><rt>nián</rt></ruby></abbr>5 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Měiguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAmerica \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">美国</span><span class=\"tr\">美國</span><rt>Měiguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Rìnèiwǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGeneva \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日内瓦</span><span class=\"tr\">日內瓦</span><rt>Rìnèiwǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì tán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntalks \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会谈</span><span class=\"tr\">會談</span><rt>huì tán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nafter \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">后</span><span class=\"tr\">後</span><rt>hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xuān bù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nannounced (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">宣布</span><span class=\"tr\">宣布</span><rt>xuān bù</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wèi lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfuture (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">未来</span><span class=\"tr\">未來</span><rt>wèi lái</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiǔ shí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nninety \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">九十</span><span class=\"tr\">九十</span><rt>jiǔ shí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天</span><span class=\"tr\">天</span><rt>tiān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Měiguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAmerica \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">美国</span><span class=\"tr\">美國</span><rt>Měiguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huá:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">华</span><span class=\"tr\">華</span><rt>huá</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guān shuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntariffs \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">关税</span><span class=\"tr\">關稅</span><rt>guān shuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwill \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">将</span><span class=\"tr\">將</span><rt>jiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr>145% <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreduce \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">降</span><span class=\"tr\">降</span><rt>jiàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">至</span><span class=\"tr\">至</span><rt>zhì</rt></ruby></abbr>30% ， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto, for (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">对</span><span class=\"tr\">對</span><rt>duì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"měi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nAmerica \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">美</span><span class=\"tr\">美</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guān shuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntariffs \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">关税</span><span class=\"tr\">關稅</span><rt>guān shuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwill \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">将</span><span class=\"tr\">將</span><rt>jiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby></abbr>125% <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nreduce \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">降</span><span class=\"tr\">降</span><rt>jiàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">至</span><span class=\"tr\">至</span><rt>zhì</rt></ruby></abbr>10% 。</p>\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huì tán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntalks \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">会谈</span><span class=\"tr\">會談</span><rt>huì tán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jié guǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nresults (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">结果</span><span class=\"tr\">結果</span><rt>jié guǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngreatly (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexceeded \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">超</span><span class=\"tr\">超</span><rt>chāo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yù qī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexpectations (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">预期</span><span class=\"tr\">預期</span><rt>yù qī</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì chǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmarket (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">市场</span><span class=\"tr\">市場</span><rt>shì chǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qíng xù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsentiment (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">情绪</span><span class=\"tr\">情緒</span><rt>qíng xù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lè guān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noptimistic (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">乐观</span><span class=\"tr\">樂觀</span><rt>lè guān</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dǎo zhì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nled to (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">导致</span><span class=\"tr\">導致</span><rt>dǎo zhì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nstock market \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">股市</span><span class=\"tr\">股市</span><rt>gǔ shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngreatly (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrose (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">涨</span><span class=\"tr\">漲</span><rt>zhǎng</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dìng dān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\norders \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">订单</span><span class=\"tr\">訂單</span><rt>dìng dān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngreatly (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nincreased \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">增</span><span class=\"tr\">增</span><rt>zēng</rt></ruby></abbr>、 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yùn fèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfreight rates \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">运费</span><span class=\"tr\">運費</span><rt>yùn fèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng shēng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrose \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上升</span><span class=\"tr\">上升</span><rt>shàng shēng</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǒng de lái shuō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nOverall \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">总的来说</span><span class=\"tr\">總的來說</span><rt>zǒng de lái shuō</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐn zhāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntense (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">紧张</span><span class=\"tr\">緊張</span><rt>jǐn zhāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"liǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntwo (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncountries \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">国</span><span class=\"tr\">國</span><rt>guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guān xì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrelations (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">关系</span><span class=\"tr\">關係</span><rt>guān xì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dé dào:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nobtained \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">得到</span><span class=\"tr\">得到</span><rt>dé dào</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huǎn hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neased (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">缓和</span><span class=\"tr\">緩和</span><rt>huǎn hé</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhěng tǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhole (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">整体</span><span class=\"tr\">整體</span><rt>zhěng tǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shāng yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbusiness (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">商业</span><span class=\"tr\">商業</span><rt>shāng yè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huó dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nactivities (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">活动</span><span class=\"tr\">活動</span><rt>huó dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xī wàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhope (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">希望</span><span class=\"tr\">希望</span><rt>xī wàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huī fù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nrecover (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">恢复</span><span class=\"tr\">恢復</span><rt>huī fù</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(146, 'traditional-festival-march-3', 'Traditional Festival March 3', '传统节日三月三', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6140.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6140-r73r6ydo1ytezqg10te7d3yspg0bwivywxtq4aw21e.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/traditional-festival-march-3/', '农历三月初三是中国多个民族共同的传统节日最早起源于古代汉族的上巳节古人认为三月的第一个巳日适合去水边洗澡用清水洗去坏运气后来这个节日被固定在三月三内容逐渐从祈福发展为春游宴饮等轻松活动人们会在水边喝酒作诗青年男女也借此机会唱歌约会形成了独特的节日文化随着时间推移汉族地区的三月三慢慢变得冷清但在南方少数民族中却焕发了新生命壮族人民把这一天变成盛大的歌会成千上万人聚集对歌未婚青年用抛绣球碰彩蛋的方式表达心意家家户户会制作象征吉祥的五色糯米饭侗族的庆祝活动充满竞技趣味青年们争抢空中落下的彩环姑娘们用精心准备的菜篮传递情意寨子里回荡着芦笙舞的欢快节奏布依族人带着敬畏祭祀山神青年们边撒玉米粒防虫害边唱情歌畲族人吃着黑色糯米饭纪念古代英雄夜晚围着篝火跳起传统舞蹈黎族男女穿戴彩色饰品对歌定情用竹筒饭和米酒表达对祖先的怀念瑶族男子提前进山打猎妇女们染制彩色糯米饭准备家宴苗族青年通过射花比赛选择伴侣有些地方还举办热闹的摔跤大会仡佬族人集体到祖坟前跳舞祭祀也为新生命举办特别的仪式高山族通过夜渔祭祈求丰收不同民族为这个节日注入了独特内涵这个节日既保留着古老传统又充满生活气息虽然各地习俗不同但都包含着对自然的敬畏对丰收的期盼以及青年男女追求幸福的美好愿望五色糯米饭彩色鸡蛋山歌对唱等共同元素见证着各民族文化的交流与融合从水边祈福到春日欢庆三月三就像一条多彩的丝带将中国不同民族的传统智慧和生活热情紧紧联系在一起', 'nóng lì sān yuè chū sān shì Zhōngguó duō gè mín zú gòng tóng de chuán tǒng jié rì zuì zǎo qǐ yuán yú gǔ dài Hàn zú de Shàngsì jié gǔ rén rèn wéi sān yuè de dì yī gè sì rì shì hé qù shuǐ biān xǐ zǎo yòng qīng shuǐ xǐ qù huài yùn qì hòu lái zhè gè jié rì bèi gù dìng zài sān yuè sān nèi róng zhú jiàn cóng qí fú fā zhǎn wéi chūn yóu yàn yǐn děng qīng sōng huó dòng rén men huì zài shuǐ biān hē jiǔ zuò shī qīng nián nán nǚ yě jiè cǐ jī huì chàng gē yuē huì xíng chéng le dú tè de jié rì wén huà suí zhe shí jiān tuī yí hàn zú dì qū de sān yuè sān màn màn biàn de lěng qīng dàn zài nán fāng shǎo shù mín zú zhōng què huàn fā le xīn shēng mìng zhuàng zú rén mín bǎ zhè yī tiān biàn chéng shèng dà de gē huì chéng qiān shàng wàn rén jù jí duì gē wèi hūn qīng nián yòng pāo xiù qiú pèng cǎi dàn de fāng shì biǎo dá xīn yì jiā jiā hù hù huì zhì zuò xiàng zhēng jí xiáng de wǔ sè nuò mǐ fàn dòng zú de qìng zhù huó dòng chōng mǎn jìng jì qù wèi qīng nián men zhēng qiǎng kōng zhōng luò xià de cǎi huán gū niáng men yòng jīng xīn zhǔn bèi de cài lán chuán dì qíng yì zhài zi lǐ huí dàng zhe lú shēng wǔ de huān kuài jié zòu bù yī zú rén dài zhe jìng wèi jì sì shān shén qīng nián men biān sǎ yù mǐ lì fáng chóng hài biān chàng qíng gē shē zú rén chī zhe hēi sè nuò mǐ fàn jì niàn gǔ dài yīng xióng yè wǎn wéi zhe gōu huǒ tiào qǐ chuán tǒng wǔ dǎo lí zú nán nǚ chuān dài cǎi sè shì pǐn duì gē dìng qíng yòng zhú tǒng fàn hé mǐ jiǔ biǎo dá duì zǔ xiān de huái niàn yáo zú nán zǐ tí qián jìn shān dǎ liè fù nǚ men rǎn zhì cǎi sè nuò mǐ fàn zhǔn bèi jiā yàn miáo zú qīng nián tōng guò shè huā bǐ sài xuǎn zé bàn lǚ yǒu xiē dì fāng hái jǔ bàn rè nào de shuāi jiāo dà huì gē lǎo zú rén jí tǐ dào zǔ fén qián tiào wǔ jì sì yě wèi xīn shēng mìng jǔ bàn tè bié de yí shì gāo shān zú tōng guò yè yú jì qí qiú fēng shōu bù tóng mín zú wèi zhè gè jié rì zhù rù le dú tè nèi hán zhè gè jié rì jì bǎo liú zhe gǔ lǎo chuán tǒng yòu chōng mǎn shēng huó qì xī suī rán gè de xí sú bù tóng dàn dōu bāo hán zhe duì zì rán de jìng wèi duì fēng shōu de qī pàn yǐ jí qīng nián nán nǚ zhuī qiú xìng fú de měi hǎo yuàn wàng wǔ sè nuò mǐ fàn cǎi sè jī dàn shān gē duì chàng děng gòng tóng yuán sù jiàn zhèng zhe gè mín zú wén huà de jiāo liú yǔ róng hé cóng shuǐ biān qí fú dào chūn rì huān qìng sān yuè sān jiù xiàng yī tiáo duō cǎi de sī dài jiāng zhōng guó bù tóng mín zú de chuán tǒng zhì huì hé shēng huó rè qíng jǐn jǐn lián xì zài yī qǐ', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nóng lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlunar calendar (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">农历</span><span class=\"tr\">農曆</span><rt>nóng lì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMarch \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三月</span><span class=\"tr\">三月</span><rt>sān yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe third day \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">初三</span><span class=\"tr\">初三</span><rt>chū sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mín zú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnationality (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">民族</span><span class=\"tr\">民族</span><rt>mín zú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gòng tóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncommon (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">共同</span><span class=\"tr\">共同</span><rt>gòng tóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuán tǒng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTraditional (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">传统</span><span class=\"tr\">傳統</span><rt>chuán tǒng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jié rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfestival (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">节日</span><span class=\"tr\">節日</span><rt>jié rì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmost (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最</span><span class=\"tr\">最</span><rt>zuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nearly \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早</span><span class=\"tr\">早</span><rt>zǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noriginated (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">起源</span><span class=\"tr\">起源</span><rt>qǐ yuán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfrom \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">于</span><span class=\"tr\">于</span><rt>yú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ dài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nancient times (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">古代</span><span class=\"tr\">古代</span><rt>gǔ dài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Hàn zú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHan nationality \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">汉族</span><span class=\"tr\">漢族</span><rt>Hàn zú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Shàngsì jié:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nShangsi Festival \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上巳节</span><span class=\"tr\">上巳節</span><rt>Shàngsì jié</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gǔ rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthe ancients \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">古人</span><span class=\"tr\">古人</span><rt>gǔ rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn wéi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthink (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">认为</span><span class=\"tr\">認爲</span><rt>rèn wéi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMarch \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三月</span><span class=\"tr\">三月</span><rt>sān yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nFirst (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">第一</span><span class=\"tr\">第一</span><rt>dì yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSi \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">巳</span><span class=\"tr\">巳</span><rt>sì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nday (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">日</span><span class=\"tr\">日</span><rt>rì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto suit, to fit (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">适合</span><span class=\"tr\">適合</span><rt>shì hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwater (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">水</span><span class=\"tr\">水</span><rt>shuǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nside \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">边</span><span class=\"tr\">邊</span><rt>biān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ zǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbath (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">洗澡</span><span class=\"tr\">洗澡</span><rt>xǐ zǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuse (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">用</span><span class=\"tr\">用</span><rt>yòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qīng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclear \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">清</span><span class=\"tr\">清</span><rt>qīng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shuǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwater (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">水</span><span class=\"tr\">水</span><rt>shuǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwash (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">洗</span><span class=\"tr\">洗</span><rt>xǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\noff (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbad (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">坏</span><span class=\"tr\">壞</span><rt>huài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yùn qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nluck (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">运气</span><span class=\"tr\">運氣</span><rt>yùn qì</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hòu lái:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlater (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">后来</span><span class=\"tr\">後