pan><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThat (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">那</span><span class=\"tr\">那</span><rt>nà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">首</span><span class=\"tr\">首</span><rt>shǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npoetry (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">诗</span><span class=\"tr\">詩</span><rt>shī</rt></ruby></abbr>， “ <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Qīngmíng shí jié yǔ fēn fēn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nA drizzling rain falls like tears on the Mourning Day; \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">清明时节雨纷纷</span><span class=\"tr\">清明時節雨紛紛</span><rt>Qīngmíng shí jié yǔ fēn fēn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lù shàng xíng rén yù duàn hún:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nThe mourner\'s heart is going to break on his way。 \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">路上行人欲断魂</span><span class=\"tr\">路上行人欲斷魂</span><rt>lù shàng xíng rén yù duàn hún</rt></ruby></abbr>” 。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbut (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不过</span><span class=\"tr\">不過</span><rt>bù guò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmost (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">最</span><span class=\"tr\">最</span><rt>zuì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nearly \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">早</span><span class=\"tr\">早</span><rt>zǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Qīngmíng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nQingming \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">清明</span><span class=\"tr\">清明</span><rt>Qīngmíng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">并</span><span class=\"tr\">幷</span><rt>bìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnot \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">不是</span><span class=\"tr\">不是</span><rt>bù shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jì niàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncommemorate (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">纪念</span><span class=\"tr\">紀念</span><rt>jì niàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jié rì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfestival (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">节日</span><span class=\"tr\">節日</span><rt>jié rì</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\njust (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">只</span><rt>zhǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天气</span><span class=\"tr\">天氣</span><rt>tiān qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biàn huà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nchange (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">变化</span><span class=\"tr\">變化</span><rt>biàn huà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"míng zì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nname (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">名字</span><span class=\"tr\">名字</span><rt>míng zì</rt></ruby></abbr>。 <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shí hòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntime (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">时候</span><span class=\"tr\">時候</span><rt>shí hòu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōng guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōng guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"bù fèn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npart (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">部分</span><span class=\"tr\">部分</span><rt>bù fèn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì fāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nplace (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">地方</span><span class=\"tr\">地方</span><rt>dì fāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tiān qì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nweather (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">天气</span><span class=\"tr\">天氣</span><rt>tiān qì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecome \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">变</span><span class=\"tr\">變</span><rt>biàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nuǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwarm \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">暖</span><span class=\"tr\">暖</span><rt>nuǎn</rt></ruby></abbr>， <abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nflower (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">花</span><span class=\"tr\">花</span><rt>huā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"cǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGrass (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">草</span><span class=\"tr\">草</span><rt>cǎo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTree (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">树</span><span class=\"tr\">樹</span><rt>shù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWood \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">木</span><span class=\"tr\">木</span><rt>mù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kāi shǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nst