(151, 'lady-xin-zhui', 'Lady Xin Zhui', '辛追夫人', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6135.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6135-r04nbwqlokruj5084870o0dfu9xc05bcr0k8zaocpe.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/lady-xin-zhui/', '辛追夫人是西汉长沙国丞相利苍的妻子她被发现于长沙的马王堆汉墓辛追夫人之所以有名是因为她的遗体保存非常完整自年至年发掘以来她的湿尸被认为是世界上保存时间最长状态最好的辛追夫人出土时皮肤头发和五官都非常清晰仿佛刚刚入葬不久创造了两千多年不腐的奇迹除了遗体保存完好辛追夫人的墓中出土了大量珍贵的文物包括丝绸乐器竹简等这些文物提供了西汉时期贵族生活的宝贵资料辛追夫人成为研究西汉文化风俗和历史的重要线索湖南博物院发布了辛追夫人的数字人形象这一形象包括岁时的全身坐姿版和岁左右的头部形象还原了辛追夫人的面部细节头发服饰和妆容这个形象将用于博物馆导览教育课程还可能出现在游戏和电影中帮助传播西汉文化这样不仅可以帮助观众更生动地了解西汉历史还可以与现代人进行互动交流辛追夫人不仅是一位连接古今的重要人物更是文化与科技成功结合的例子', 'Xīn Zhuī fū rén shì Xīhàn Chángshā guó chéng xiàng Lì Cāng de qī zi tā bèi fā xiàn yú Chángshā de Mǎwángduī hàn mù Xīn Zhuī fū rén zhī suǒ yǐ yǒu míng shì yīn wèi tā de yí tǐ bǎo cún fēi cháng wán zhěng zì nián zhì nián fā jué yǐ lái tā de shī shī bèi rèn wéi shì shì jiè shàng bǎo cún shí jiān zuì cháng zhuàng tài zuì hǎo de Xīn Zhuī fū rén chū tǔ shí pí fū tóu fà hé wǔ guān dōu fēi cháng qīng xī fǎng fú gāng gāng rù zàng bù jiǔ chuàng zào le liǎng qiān duō nián bù fǔ de qí jì chú le yí tǐ bǎo cún wán hǎo Xīn Zhuī fū rén de mù zhōng chū tǔ le dà liàng zhēn guì de wén wù bāo kuò sī chóu yuè qì zhú jiǎn děng zhè xiē wén wù tí gōng le Xīhàn shí qī guì zú shēng huó de bǎo guì zī liào Xīn Zhuī fū rén chéng wéi yán jiū Xīhàn wén huà fēng sú hé lì shǐ de zhòng yào xiàn suǒ hú nán bó wù yuàn fā bù le Xīn Zhuī fū rén de shù zì rén xíng xiàng zhè yī xíng xiàng bāo kuò suì shí de quán shēn zuò zī bǎn hé suì zuǒ yòu de tóu bù xíng xiàng huán yuán le Xīn Zhuī fū rén de miàn bù xì jié tóu fà fú shì hé zhuāng róng zhè gè xíng xiàng jiāng yòng yú bó wù guǎn dǎo lǎn jiào yù kè chéng hái kě néng chū xiàn zài yóu xì hé diàn yǐng zhōng bāng zhù chuán bō Xīhàn wén huà zhè yàng bù jǐn kě yǐ bāng zhù guān zhòng gèng shēng dòng de liǎo jiě Xīhàn lì shǐ hái kě yǐ yǔ xiàn dài rén jìn xíng hù dòng jiāo liú Xīn Zhuī fū rén bù jǐn shì yī wèi lián jiē gǔ jīn de zhòng yào rén wù gèng shì wén huà yǔ kē jì chéng gōng jié hé de lì zi', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xīn Zhuī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nXin Zhui \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">辛追</span><span class=\"tr\">辛追</span><rt>Xīn Zhuī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fū rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlady (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">夫人</span><span class=\"tr\">夫人</span><rt>fū rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Xīhàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nWestern Han Dynasty \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">西汉</span><span class=\"tr\">西漢</span><rt>Xīhàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Chángshā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChangsha \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">长沙</span><span class=\"tr\">長沙</span><rt>Chángshā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncountry \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">国</span><span class=\"tr\">國</span><rt>guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chéng xiàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nprime minister \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">丞相</span><span class=\"tr\">丞相</span><rt>chéng xiàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lì Cāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLi Cang \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">利苍</span><span class=\"tr\">利蒼</span><rt>Lì Cāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qī zi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwife (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">妻子</span><span class=\"tr\">妻子</span><rt>qī zi</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nshe, her (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si