 /&gt;\r\nenvironment (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">环境</span><span class=\"tr\">環境</span><rt>huán jìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gān jìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nclean (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">干净</span><span class=\"tr\">乾淨</span><rt>gān jìng</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén mín:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人民</span><span class=\"tr\">人民</span><rt>rén mín</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu hǎo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfriendly (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">友好</span><span class=\"tr\">友好</span><rt>yǒu hǎo</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xìng jià bǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCost-effectiveness \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">性价比</span><span class=\"tr\">性價比</span><rt>xìng jià bǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nvery (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhigh (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高</span><span class=\"tr\">高</span><rt>gāo</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\netc. (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhèng cè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npolicy (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">政策</span><span class=\"tr\">政策</span><rt>zhèng cè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu zhù yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhelpful \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有助于</span><span class=\"tr\">有助于</span><rt>yǒu zhù yú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiāo chú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\neliminate (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">消除</span><span class=\"tr\">消除</span><rt>xiāo chú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hěn duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\na lot of \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">很多</span><span class=\"tr\">很多</span><rt>hěn duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"piān jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbias (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">偏见</span><span class=\"tr\">偏見</span><rt>piān jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:55');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(154, 'miracle-principal-zhang-guimei', 'Miracle Principal Zhang Guimei', '奇迹校长张桂梅', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6132.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6132-qvod1wck1c1rjefqhacq3gdq3mpi7qkkux875818b6.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/miracle-principal-zhang-guimei/', '云南丽江的一个贫困县有一所特殊的学校这所学校创办于年专门招收周边贫困山区的女孩学费住宿费包括吃饭等全都免费学校还会给学生提供被子等生活用品校长也是这所学校的创办者她叫张桂梅是一位六十多岁的阿姨她面容沧桑身材瘦弱让人很难相信她才六十多岁她牺牲了自己的青春健康把自己的一切都献给了教育张桂梅原本是东北人虽然在农村但是她聪明好学十几岁就跟着姐姐到云南支援建设因为工作能力出色成为了一名老师为了弥补自己教学能力和知识体系的不足她辞职后考上了丽江教育学院毕业后和丈夫一起在云南教书但是后来丈夫因病去世张桂梅把所有的爱和精力都投入到了教育事业中她的身体不好一直病痛缠身但是她始终坚持在岗位上不放弃任何一个女孩刚开始支教时张桂梅就发现这些贫困的女孩不能随心所欲地念书工作更像是一件商品或者生育机器大部分女孩从三四岁就开始给家里干活到了十五六岁左右就被卖到别人家里生儿育女等不再能生孩子了等待她们的还有无尽的农活和丈夫的打骂有些女孩突然就不来上课了其他的老师习以为常家庭太困难只能让她们辍学结婚但是张桂梅不放弃一家家地劝说让她们回到学校山路崎岖阻挡不了她把女孩们带出大山的决心学校的女生表示要是没有张校长可能她们的孩子都三岁了而这些女生连高中都还没有毕业年起张桂梅义务成为县福利院的院长并且开始筹办免费的女子高中让女孩们不会因为贫困而失学她四处奔走到处募捐一点一点地攒钱终于在年将女子高中建成了之后她不断地学习先进的教学模式建立起了适合这里的孩子们的教学方式学生们的作息非常严格也非常辛苦但是读书是这些孩子们唯一的出路她们只能付出比城里学生更多的努力才可能改变人生道路迄今为止这所学校走出了两千多名学生考上名校的学生数不胜数毕业后成为老师警察医生律师而改变了命运的她们永远不会忘记的就是张桂梅校长的心血和付出', 'Yúnnán Lìjiāng de yī gè pín kùn xiàn yǒu yī suǒ tè shū de xué xiào zhè suǒ xué xiào chuàng bàn yú nián zhuān mén zhāo shōu zhōu biān pín kùn shān qū de nǚ hái xué fèi zhù sù fèi bāo kuò chī fàn děng quán dōu miǎn fèi xué xiào hái huì gěi xué shēng tí gōng bèi zi děng shēng huó yòng pǐn xiào zhǎng yě shì zhè suǒ xué xiào de chuàng bàn zhě tā jiào Zhāng Guìméi shì yī wèi liù shí duō suì de ā yí tā miàn róng cāng sāng shēn cái shòu ruò ràng rén hěn nán xiāng xìn tā cái liù shí duō suì tā xī shēng le zì jǐ de qīng chūn jiàn kāng bǎ zì jǐ de yī qiè dōu xiàn gěi le jiào yù Zhāng Guìméi yuán běn shì dōng běi rén suī rán zài nóng cūn dàn shì tā cōng míng hào xué shí jǐ suì jiù gēn zhe jiějie dào Yúnnán zhī yuán jiàn shè yīn wèi gōng zuò néng lì chū sè chéng wéi le yī míng lǎo shī wèi le mí bǔ zì jǐ jiào xué néng lì hé zhī shí tǐ xì de bù zú tā cí zhí hòu kǎo shàng le Lìjiāng jiào yù xué yuàn bì yè hòu hé zhàng fū yī qǐ zài Yúnnán jiāo shū dàn shì hòu lái zhàng fū yīn bìng qù shì Zhāng Guìméi bǎ suǒ yǒu de ài hé jīng lì dōu tóu rù dào le jiào yù shì yè zhōng tā de shēn tǐ bù hǎo yī zhí bìng tòng chán shēn dàn shì tā shǐ zhōng jiān chí zài gǎng wèi shàng bù fàng qì rèn hé yī gè nǚ hái gāng kāi shǐ zhī jiào shí Zhāng Guìméi jiù fā xiàn zhè xiē pín kùn de nǚ hái bù néng suí xīn suǒ yù de niàn shū gōng zuò gèng xiàng shì yī jiàn shāng pǐn huò zhě shēng yù jī qì dà bù fèn nǚ hái cóng sān sì suì jiù kāi shǐ gěi jiā lǐ gàn huó dào le shí wǔ liù suì zuǒ yòu jiù bèi mài dào bié rén jiā lǐ shēng ér yù nǚ děng bù zài néng shēng hái zi le děng dài tā men de hái yǒu wú jìn de nóng huó hé zhàng fū de dǎ mà yǒu xiē nǚ hái tū rán jiù bù lái shàng kè le qí tā de lǎo shī xí yǐ wéi cháng jiā tíng tài kùn nán zhǐ néng ràng tā men chuò xué jié hūn dàn shì Zhāng Guìméi bù fàng qì yī jiā jiā de quàn shuō ràng tā men huí dào xué xiào shān lù qí qū zǔ dǎng bù le tā bǎ nǚ hái men dài chū dà shān de jué xīn xué xiào de nǚ shēng biǎo shì yào shì méi yǒu Zhāng xiào zhǎng kě néng tā men de hái zi dōu sān suì le ér zhè xiē nǚ shēng lián gāo zhōng dōu hái méi yǒu bì yè nián qǐ Zhāng Guìméi yì wù chéng wéi xiàn fú lì yuàn de yuàn zhǎng bìng qiě kāi shǐ chóu bàn miǎn fèi de nǚ zǐ gāo zhōng ràng nǚ hái men bù huì yīn wèi pín kùn ér shī xué tā sì chù bēn zǒu dào chù mù juān yī diǎn yī diǎn de zǎn qián zhōng yú zài nián jiāng nǚ zǐ gāo zhōng jiàn chéng le zhī hòu tā bù duàn de xué xí xiān jìn de jiào xué mó shì jiàn lì qǐ le shì hé zhè lǐ de hái zi men de jiào xué fāng shì xué shēng men de zuò xī fēi cháng yán gé yě fēi cháng xīn kǔ dàn shì dú shū shì zhè xiē hái zi men wéi yī de chū lù tā men zhǐ néng fù chū bǐ chéng lǐ xué shēng gèng duō de nǔ lì cái kě néng gǎi biàn rén shēng dào lù qì jīn wéi zhǐ zhè suǒ xué xiào zǒu chū le liǎng qiān duō míng xué shēng kǎo shàng míng xiào de xué shēng shǔ bù shèng shǔ bì yè hòu chéng wéi lǎo shī jǐng chá yī shēng lǜ shī ér gǎi biàn le mìng yùn de tā men yǒng yuǎn bù huì wàng jì de jiù shì Zhāng Guìméi xiào zhǎng de xīn xuè hé fù chū', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Yúnnán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nYunnan \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">云南</span><span class=\"tr\">雲南</span><rt>Yúnnán</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Lìjiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nLijiang \"><ruby><span class=\"si\">丽江</span><span class=\"tr\">麗江</span><rt>Lìjiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"pín kùn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npoor (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">贫困</span><span class=\"tr\">貧困</span><rt>pín kùn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncounty (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">县</span><span class=\"tr\">縣</span><rt>xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yǒu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nhave, there be (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"suǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">所</span><span class=\"tr\">所</span><rt>suǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tè shū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nspecial (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">特殊</span><span class=\"