"si\">让</span><span class=\"tr\">讓</span><rt>ràng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiāo fèi zhě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nconsumer\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">消费者</span><span class=\"tr\">消費者</span><rt>xiāo fèi zhě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yù bà bù néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nCan\'t stop\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">欲罢不能</span><span class=\"tr\">欲罷不能</span><rt>yù bà bù néng</rt></ruby></abbr>。<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiā:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nHome (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng sī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncompany (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公司</span><span class=\"tr\">公司</span><rt>gōng sī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nuse (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">用</span><span class=\"tr\">用</span><rt>yòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiāng tóng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsame (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">相同</span><span class=\"tr\">相同</span><rt>xiāng tóng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shāng yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBusiness (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">商业</span><span class=\"tr\">商業</span><rt>shāng yè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mó shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmodel (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">模式</span><span class=\"tr\">模式</span><rt>mó shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nDo (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">做</span><span class=\"tr\">做</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chū:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(complement) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">出</span><span class=\"tr\">出</span><rt>chū</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\