\"hé zuò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncooperate (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">合作</span><span class=\"tr\">合作</span><rt>hé zuò</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tóu zī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninvest (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">投资</span><span class=\"tr\">投資</span><rt>tóu zī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chuàng yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nStart a business (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">创业</span><span class=\"tr\">創業</span><rt>chuàng yè</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"tàn qīn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nVisiting relatives\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">探亲</span><span class=\"tr\">探親</span><rt>tàn qīn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"děng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\netc. (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">等</span><span class=\"tr\">等</span><rt>děng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"chǔ lǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndeal with (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">处理</span><span class=\"tr\">處理</span><rt>chǔ lǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"fēi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nnon (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">非</span><span class=\"tr\">非</span><rt>fēi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wài jiāo:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ndiplomatic (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">外交</span><span class=\"tr\">外交</span><rt>wài jiāo</rt></ruby></abbr>、<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gōng wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nofficial business (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">公务</span><span class=\"tr\">公務</span><rt>gōng wù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"huó dòng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nActivity (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">活动</span><span class=\"tr\">活動</span><rt>huó dòng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"wài jí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nforeign\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">外籍</span><span class=\"tr\">外籍</span><rt>wài jí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén yuán:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npersonnel (HSK5)\"><ruby