\" title=\"rén gōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nartificial (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人工</span><span class=\"tr\">人工</span><rt>rén gōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhì néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nintelligent (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">智能</span><span class=\"tr\">智能</span><rt>zhì néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qǐ yè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nenterprise (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">企业</span><span class=\"tr\">企業</span><rt>qǐ yè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gāo guǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nexecutives\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">高管</span><span class=\"tr\">高管</span><rt>gāo guǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"hé:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nand, with (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">和</span><span class=\"tr\">和</span><rt>hé</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lián hé guó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nUnited Nations\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">联合国</span><span class=\"tr\">聯合國</span><rt>lián hé guó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"mì shū zhǎng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsecretary general\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">秘书长</span><span class=\"tr\">秘書長</span><rt>mì shū zhǎng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhī chí:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsupport (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">支持</span><span class=\"tr\">支持</span><rt>zhī chí</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiàn lì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nEstablish (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">建立</span><span class=\"tr\">建立</span><rt>jiàn lì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\none (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"quán qiú xìng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nglobal\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">全球性</span><span class=\"tr\">全球性</span><rt>quán qiú xìng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén gōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nartificial (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人工</span><span class=\"tr\">人工</span><rt>rén gōng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhì néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nintelligent (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">智能</span><span class=\"tr\">智能</span><rt>zhì néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jiān guǎn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSupervise\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">监管</span><span class=\"tr\">監管</span><rt>jiān guǎn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī gòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmechanism (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机构</span><span class=\"tr\">機構</span><rt>jī gòu</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lèi sì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsimilar (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">类似</span><span class=\"tr\">類似</span><rt>lèi sì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nto\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">于</span><span class=\"tr\">于</span><rt>yú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guó jì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ninternationality (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">国际</span><span class=\"tr\">國際</span><rt>guó jì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuán zǐ néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\natomic energy\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">原子能</span><span class=\"tr\">原子能</span><rt>yuán zǐ néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jī gòu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmechanism (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">机构</span><span class=\"tr\">機構</span><rt>jī gòu</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:56');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(165, 'how-to-disinfect', 'How to Disinfect', '如何消毒', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6121.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6121-qbpnvsr7wqzgrkfof9ui93t0m8tuikrcw5w3l8npe0.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/how-to-disinfect/', '如果你在中国生活过可能会发现有些地区的人在外吃饭时会将碗筷先用开水烫一烫再吃他们觉得这样做可以消毒但是烫一烫真的能消毒吗其实这并不能达到消毒杀菌的目的更像一种餐前仪式感高温消毒是最常见的消毒方式很多病菌都能通过这种方式被杀灭餐具也不例外不过要达到效果必须具备两个条件温度和时间一壶度的开水倒入冰凉的餐具内会使温度迅速降低并持续下降一般只能达到度要消毒碗筷需要将水温维持在度并且持续浸泡至少分钟才能杀灭部分细菌清洁消毒和灭菌有什么不同呢清洁是指使用物理或化学方法清除物体表面的污垢灰尘和有机物比如日常洗手拖地等消毒是指使用物理或化学方法杀灭或清除病原微生物使其变得无害例如用酒精擦皮肤煮沸消毒等灭菌是指使用物理或化学方法杀灭或清除微生物例如高压蒸汽灭菌低温环氧乙烷灭菌等在医院中几乎所有的医疗器具都需要进行消毒其中很大一部分需要达到灭菌要求医疗器具通常分为高中低三个危险级别根据不同级别有不同的清洁消毒灭菌要求在日常生活中我们不需要达到医用级别的要求只需掌握常识性的消毒和清洁方法就可以了', 'rú guǒ nǐ zài Zhōngguó shēng huó guò kě néng huì fā xiàn yǒu xiē dì qū de rén zài wài chī fàn shí huì jiāng wǎn kuài xiān yòng kāi shuǐ tàng yī tàng zài chī tā men jué de zhè yàng zuò kě yǐ xiāo dú dàn shì tàng yī tàng zhēn de néng xiāo dú ma qí shí zhè bìng bù néng dá dào xiāo dú shā jūn de mù dì gèng xiàng yī zhǒng cān qián yí shì gǎn gāo wēn xiāo dú shì zuì cháng jiàn de xiāo dú fāng shì hěn duō bìng jūn dōu néng tōng guò zhè zhǒng fāng shì bèi shā miè cān jù yě bù lì wài bù guò yào dá dào xiào guǒ bì xū jù bèi liǎng gè tiáo jiàn wēn dù hé shí jiān yī hú dù de kāi shuǐ dǎo rù bīng liáng de cān jù nèi huì shǐ wēn dù xùn sù jiàng dī bìng chí xù xià jiàng yī bān zhǐ néng dá dào dù yào xiāo dú wǎn kuài xū yào jiāng shuǐ wēn wéi chí zài dù bìng qiě chí xù jìn pào zhì shǎo fēn zhōng cái néng shā miè bù fèn xì jūn qīng jié xiāo dú hé miè jūn yǒu shén me bù tóng ne qīng jié shì zhǐ shǐ yòng wù lǐ huò huà xué fāng fǎ qīng chú wù tǐ biǎo miàn de wū gòu huī chén hé yǒu jī wù bǐ rú rì cháng xǐ shǒu tuō dì děng xiāo dú shì zhǐ shǐ yòng wù lǐ huò huà xué fāng fǎ shā miè huò qīng chú bìng yuán wēi shēng wù shǐ qí biàn de wú hài lì rú yòng jiǔ jīng cā pí fū zhǔ fèi xiāo dú děng miè jūn shì zhǐ shǐ yòng wù lǐ huò huà xué fāng fǎ shā miè huò qīng chú wēi shēng wù lì rú gāo yā zhēng qì miè jūn dī wēn huán yǎng yǐ wán miè jūn děng zài yī yuàn zhōng jī hū suǒ yǒu de yī liáo qì jù dōu xū yào jìn xíng xiāo dú qí zhōng hěn dà yī bù fèn xū yào dá dào miè jūn yāo qiú yī liáo qì jù tōng cháng fēn wéi gāo zhōng dī sān gè wēi xiǎn jí bié gēn jù bù tóng jí bié yǒu bù tóng de qīng jié xiāo dú miè jūn yāo qiú zài rì cháng shēng huó zhōng wǒ men bù xū yào dá dào yī yòng jí bié de yāo qiú zhǐ xū zhǎng wò cháng shí xìng de xiāo dú hé qīng jié fāng fǎ jiù kě yǐ le', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rú guǒ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nif (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">如果</span><span class=\"tr\">如果</span><rt>rú guǒ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zài:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(located) at / (to be) in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shēng huó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nlive (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">生活</span><span class=\"tr\">生活</span><rt>shēng huó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"guò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(the structural particle, used after a verb indicating a past experience action which hasn\'t lasted to the present ) (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">过</span><span class=\"tr\">過</span><rt>guò</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kě néng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npossible (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">可能</span><span class=\"tr\">可能</span><rt>kě néng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr r