class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dān yōu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nworry\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">担忧</span><span class=\"tr\">擔憂</span><rt>dān yōu</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dāng qián:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncurrent (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">当前</span><span class=\"tr\">當前</span><rt>dāng qián</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"jǐn pò:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nurgent (HSK6)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">紧迫</span><span class=\"tr\">緊迫</span><rt>jǐn pò</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rèn wù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nTask (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">任务</span><span class=\"tr\">任務</span><rt>rèn wù</rt></ruby></abbr>。</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:56');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(167, 'where-to-travel-this-month', 'Where to travel this month?', '这个月去哪旅游？', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6119.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6119-q833h4bdteuh1k74aspqbc9bmkfxzl7pp9j2bay6oi.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/where-to-travel-this-month/', '中国是世界上面积第三大的国家宽广的土地和美景让无数游客向往中国的每个城市都有自己独特的气候和特色也有最适合旅行的时间但是你知道每个月最适合去哪个城市旅游吗一月去东北的哈尔滨最冷的时候你才可以看到冰雪节最美的样子如果你怕冷二月最适合去海南你可以在寒冷的冬天感受到热带的阳光和海浪三月应该去江南在初春的季节欣赏江浙沪的小桥流水桂林山水甲天下四月去桂林可以坐船游湖看桂林的十里画廊五月可以去云南逃离大城市的忙碌享受这里的慢生活湖南的张家界适合六月去这时候森林公园变成一个天然氧吧在这里你可以呼吸最新鲜的空气七月可以去西北的青海在青海湖边骑马享受蓝天白云八月当然要到贵州去避暑贵州凉爽的天气让夏日变得可爱起来青山绿水和瀑布等着你到了九月可以去新疆喝葡萄酒看雪山草地吃甜甜的瓜果品尝美味的牛羊肉十月进入了真正的秋季内蒙古的胡杨林变得金黄正是欣赏千年胡杨的好时候万物凋零的十一月只有九寨沟这样的地方依然五颜六色美得像个童话世界寒冷的十二月可以去长白山滑雪感受冬天的到来你的旅游计划做好了吗这个月你准备去哪旅游', 'Zhōngguó shì shì jiè shàng miàn jī dì sān dà de guó jiā kuān guǎng de tǔ dì hé měi jǐng ràng wú shù yóu kè xiàng wǎng Zhōngguó de měi gè chéng shì dōu yǒu zì jǐ dú tè de qì hòu hé tè sè yě yǒu zuì shì hé lǚ xíng de shí jiān dàn shì nǐ zhī dào měi gè yuè zuì shì hé qù nǎ gè chéng shì lǚ yóu ma yī yuè qù dōng běi de Hāěrbīn zuì lěng de shí hòu nǐ cái kě yǐ kàn dào bīng xuě jié zuì měi de yàng zi rú guǒ nǐ pà lěng èr yuè zuì shì hé qù Hǎinán nǐ kě yǐ zài hán lěng de dōng tiān gǎn shòu dào rè dài de yáng guāng hé hǎi làng sān yuè yīng gāi qù jiāng nán zài chū chūn de jì jié xīn shǎng jiāng zhè hù de xiǎo qiáo liú shuǐ guì lín shān shuǐ jiǎ tiān xià sì yuè qù Guìlín kě yǐ zuò chuán yóu hú kàn Guìlín de shí lǐ huà láng wǔ yuè kě yǐ qù Yúnnán táo lí dà chéng shì de máng lù xiǎng shòu zhè lǐ de màn shēng huó Húnán de Zhāngjiājiè shì hé liù yuè qù zhè shí hòu sēn lín gōng yuán biàn chéng yī gè tiān rán yǎng bā zài zhè lǐ nǐ kě yǐ hū xī zuì xīn xiān de kōng qì qī yuè kě yǐ qù xī běi de Qīnghǎi zài Qīnghǎi hú biān qí mǎ xiǎng shòu lán tiān bái yún bā yuè dāng rán yào dào Guìzhōu qù bì shǔ Guìzhōu liáng shuǎng de tiān qì ràng xià rì biàn de kě ài qǐ lái qīng shān lǜ shuǐ hé pù bù děng zhe nǐ dào le jiǔ yuè kě yǐ qù Xīnjiāng hē pú táo jiǔ kàn xuě shān cǎo dì chī tián tián de guā guǒ pǐn cháng měi wèi de niú yáng ròu shí yuè jìn rù le zhēn zhèng de qiū jì Nèiménggǔ de hú yáng lín biàn de jīn huáng zhèng shì xīn shǎng qiān nián hú yáng de hǎo shí hòu wàn wù diāo líng de shí yī yuè zhǐ yǒu Jiǔzhàigōu zhè yàng de dì fāng yī rán wǔ yán liù sè měi de xiàng gè tóng huà shì jiè hán lěng de shí èr yuè kě yǐ qù cháng bái shān huá xuě gǎn shòu dōng tiān de dào lái nǐ de lǚ yóu jì huà zuò hǎo le ma zhè gè yuè nǐ zhǔn bèi qù nǎ lǚ yóu', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Zhōngguó:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nChina (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">中国</span><span class=\"tr\">中國</span><rt>Zhōngguó</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbe (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì jiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nworld (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">世界</span><span class=\"tr\">世界</span><rt>shì jiè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shàng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\non, in (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"miàn jī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\narea (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">面积</span><span class=\"tr\">面積</span><rt>miàn jī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dì:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word for ordinal numbers)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">第</span><span class=\"tr\">第</span><rt>dì</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"sān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthree (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三</span><span class=\"tr\">三</span><rt>sān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\