ss=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"ma:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. question mark) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby></abbr>？<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nthis (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(measure word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yuè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmonth (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">月</span><span class=\"tr\">月</span><rt>yuè</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǐ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nyou (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhǔn bèi:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nPrepare (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">准备</span><span class=\"tr\">準備</span><rt>zhǔn bèi</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"qù:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ngo to (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">去</span><span class=\"tr\">去</span><rt>qù</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"nǎ:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nwhere (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">哪</span><span class=\"tr\">哪</span><rt>nǎ</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"lǚ yóu:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ntravel (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">旅游</span><span class=\"tr\">旅游</span><rt>lǚ yóu</rt></ruby></abbr>？</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '2025-11-15 02:48:56');
INSERT INTO `stories` (`id`, `slug`, `title_english`, `title_chinese`, `audio_url`, `image_url`, `tags`, `hsk_level`, `story_url`, `chinese_text`, `pinyin_text`, `content_html`, `created_at`) VALUES
(168, 'guangxi-dong-village', 'Guangxi Dong Village', '广西侗族村寨', 'https://traffic.libsyn.com/secure/learnchinese/6118.mp3', 'https://mandarinbean.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/6118-q44r8yo6r2dcjkaq4oy2r8vrmg81adjegv0o4hnl8y.jpg', '', 'HSK6', 'https://mandarinbean.com/guangxi-dong-village/', '广西省三江县的大山中有八个侗族村寨叫程阳八寨每个寨子相隔不远都以风雨桥连接其中最有名的风雨桥叫永济桥也是世界四大历史名桥之一永济桥始建于年长米宽米高米上面有座桥亭和个桥廊整座桥不用一根铁钉全部由木头拼接相当壮观那里依山傍水风景秀丽远离城市的喧嚣显得安静又悠闲寨子外就是梯田那里的村民现在依然以种植业为生随着旅游业开始发展也有一些村民开了民宿但是因为游客不多只有节假日会热闹一些侗族村寨里的村民还过着比较原始的生活妇女们穿着传统的侗族服装在田里干活或在村里缝制衣服古老的风雨桥边坐着闲聊的老人甚至还有更夫绕着村子打更提醒大家小心火烛这里不但保留了很多古老的习俗也有很多特色美食比如当地侗族人每天都要喝的打油茶由糯米花生芝麻等原料组成这是他们的咖啡如果到了程阳八寨一定不能错过百家宴百家宴是当地侗族人待客的最高礼仪现在也成为了非物质文化遗产保护项目每当有特别尊贵的客人到寨子里来每家每户都会准备酒菜到鼓楼广场摆长桌从第一桌吃到最后一桌非常热闹如果你喜欢远离城市又有特别文化习俗的地方这个原始而小众的侗族村寨会让你有惊喜', 'Guǎngxī shěng Sānjiāng xiàn de dà shān zhōng yǒu bā gè dòng zú cūn zhài jiào Chéngyáng bā zhài měi gè zhài zi xiāng gé bù yuǎn dōu yǐ fēng yǔ qiáo lián jiē qí zhōng zuì yǒu míng de fēng yǔ qiáo jiào yǒng jì qiáo yě shì shì jiè sì dà lì shǐ míng qiáo zhī yī yǒng jì qiáo shǐ jiàn yú nián cháng mǐ kuān mǐ gāo mǐ shàng miàn yǒu zuò qiáo tíng hé gè qiáo láng zhěng zuò qiáo bù yòng yī gēn tiě dīng quán bù yóu mù tou pīn jiē xiāng dāng zhuàng guān nà lǐ yī shān bàng shuǐ fēng jǐng xiù lì yuǎn lí chéng shì de xuān xiāo xiǎn de ān jìng yòu yōu xián zhài zi wài jiù shì tī tián nà lǐ de cūn mín xiàn zài yī rán yǐ zhòng zhí yè wéi shēng suí zhe lǚ yóu yè kāi shǐ fā zhǎn yě yǒu yī xiē cūn mín kāi le mín sù dàn shì yīn wèi yóu kè bù duō zhǐ yǒu jié jià rì huì rè nào yī xiē dòng zú cūn zhài lǐ de cūn mín hái guò zhe bǐ jiào yuán shǐ de shēng huó fù nǚ men chuān zhe chuán tǒng de dòng zú fú zhuāng zài tián lǐ gàn huó huò zài cūn lǐ féng zhì yī fú gǔ lǎo de fēng yǔ qiáo biān zuò zhe xián liáo de lǎo rén shèn zhì hái yǒu gēng fū rào zhe cūn zi dǎ gēng tí xǐng dà jiā xiǎo xīn huǒ zhú zhè lǐ bù dàn bǎo liú le hěn duō gǔ lǎo de xí sú yě yǒu hěn duō tè sè měi shí bǐ rú dāng dì dòng zú rén měi tiān dōu yào hē de dǎ yóu chá yóu nuò mǐ huā shēng zhī má děng yuán liào zǔ chéng zhè shì tā men de kā fēi rú guǒ dào le Chéngyáng bā zhài yī dìng bù néng cuò guò bǎi jiā yàn bǎi jiā yàn shì dāng dì dòng zú rén dài kè de zuì gāo lǐ yí xiàn zài yě chéng wéi le fēi wù zhì wén huà yí chǎn bǎo hù xiàng mù měi dāng yǒu tè bié zūn guì de kè rén dào zhài zi lǐ lái měi jiā měi hù dōu huì zhǔn bèi jiǔ cài dào gǔ lóu guǎng chǎng bǎi cháng zhuō cóng dì yī zhuō chī dào zuì hòu yī zhuō fēi cháng rè nào rú guǒ nǐ xǐ huān yuǎn lí chéng shì yòu yǒu tè bié wén huà xí sú de dì fāng zhè gè yuán shǐ ér xiǎo zhòng de dòng zú cūn zhài huì ràng nǐ yǒu jīng xǐ', '<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4064e155 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-id=\"4064e155\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\r\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\r\n<p><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Guǎngxī:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nGuangxi\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">广西</span><span class=\"tr\">廣西</span><rt>Guǎngxī</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shěng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nProvince (HSK4)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">省</span><span class=\"tr\">省</span><rt>shěng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"Sānjiāng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nSanjiang\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">三江</span><span class=\"tr\">三江</span><rt>Sānjiāng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"xiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\ncounty (HSK5)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">县</span><span class=\"tr\">縣</span><rt>xiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shān:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nMountain\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">山</span><span class=\"tr\">山</span><rt>shān</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nin, a