title=\"duō:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmany, more (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">多</span><span class=\"tr\">多</span><rt>duō</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"rén:&lt;br /&gt;\r\npeople, person (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"yě:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nalso (HSK2)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"kàn jiàn:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nsee (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">看见</span><span class=\"tr\">看見</span><rt>kàn jiàn</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"gèng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nmore (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">更</span><span class=\"tr\">更</span><rt>gèng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"dà:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nBig (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">大</span><span class=\"tr\">大</span><rt>dà</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"de:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"shì jiè:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nworld (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">世界</span><span class=\"tr\">世界</span><rt>shì jiè</rt></ruby></abbr>，<abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"zhōng yú:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nfinally (HSK3)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">终于</span><span class=\"tr\">終于</span><rt>zhōng yú</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"biàn chéng:&lt;br /&gt;\r\nbecome\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">变成</span><span class=\"tr\">變成</span><rt>biàn chéng</rt></ruby></abbr><abbr rel=\"tooltip\" title=\"le:&lt;br /&gt;\r\n(aux. word) (HSK1)\"><ruby><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></r